  FT["MY-H2749"] = {"id":"MY-H2749","coverage":"full","language":"en","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 226/2013&status=AMENDMENT","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2013年布城联邦直辖区（《国家土地法典》修改）（修正）令","en":"FEDERAL TERRITORY OF PUTRAJAYA (MODIFICATION OF NATIONAL LAND CODE) (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2013","orig":"FEDERAL TERRITORY OF PUTRAJAYA (MODIFICATION OF NATIONAL LAND CODE) (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2013","vi":"Lệnh về Lãnh thổ Liên bang Putrajaya (Sửa đổi Bộ luật Đất đai Quốc gia) (Sửa đổi) năm 2013","th":"คำสั่งเขตสหพันธรัฐปุตราจายา (การดัดแปลงประมวลกฎหมายที่ดินแห่งชาติ) (การแก้ไข) ค.ศ. 2013","id":"Perintah Wilayah Persekutuan Putrajaya (Modifikasi Kitab Undang-Undang Tanah Nasional) (Perubahan) Tahun 2013","ms":"Perintah Wilayah Persekutuan Putrajaya (Pengubahsuaian Kanun Tanah Negara) (Pindaan) 2013"},"level":"regulation","category":"02_民商事与经济法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA226","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2013","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\02_民商事与经济法\\2013_P.U.(A)226-2013_FEDERAL TERRITORY OF PUTRAJAYA (MODIFICATION OF NATIONAL LAND CODE) (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2013.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H2749-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"en":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Wilayah Persekutuan\nPutrajaya (Ubahsuaian Kanun Tanah Negara) (Pindaan) 2013.\n\n(2) Perintah ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 15 Julai 2013.\n\nPindaan Jadual"}},{"id":"MY-H2749-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"en":"2. Jadual kepada Perintah Wilayah Persekutuan  Putrajaya (Ubahsuaian Kanun\nTanah Negara) 2001 [P.U. (A) 213/2001] dipinda dalam ubah suaian seksyen 12―\n\n (a)  dengan menggantikan subseksyen (1) dengan subseksyen yang berikut :\n\n\"(1)    There shall be established a Land Executive Committee for the\nFederal Territory of Putrajaya consisting of―\n\n(a) the Chief Secretary to the G overnment who shall be the\nChairman;\n\n(b) the Secretary General of the Ministry of Federal Territories\nwho shall be the Deputy Chairman;\n\n(c) the Attorney General or his representative;\n\n(d) the Secretary General of Treasury or the Deputy Secretary\nGeneral of Treasury as his alternate;\n\n(e) the Director General of Lands and Mines;\n\n(f) the Senior Deputy Secretary General of the Prime Minister's\nDepartment; and\n\n(g) the President of the Perbadanan Putrajay a appointed under\nsection 5 of the Perbadanan Putrajaya Act 1995  [Act 536].\";\ndan\n\n      (b)  dengan menggantikan subseksyen (1A) dengan subseksyen yang berikut:\n\n\"(1A)  The quorum of the Land Executive Committee shall be its\nChairman  and  a  majority  of  its  other members mentioned in\nsubsection (1).\".\n\nDibuat 11 Julai 2013\n[PN(SU.2)1/EXT/KTN/5665/KLPL; KWP(S):24/PUU/698/1/3/15; PN(PU2)415/XIV]\n\nDengan Titah Perintah\n\nTAN SRI DR. ALI BIN HAMSA\nSetiausaha Jemaah Menteri\n\nCONSTITUTION (AMENDMENT) ACT 2001\n\nFEDERAL TERRITORY OF PUTRAJAYA (MODIFICATION OF NATIONAL LAND CODE)\n(AMENDMENT) ORDER 2013\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by subsection 6(4) of the Constitution\n(Amendment) Act 2001 [ Act A1095 ], the Yang di -Pertuan Agong makes the following\norder:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-6"};
  FT["MY-H275"] = {"id":"MY-H275","coverage":"full","language":"en","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-detail.php?act=343&lang=BI","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":8,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"1988年马来西亚可可局（注册成立）法","en":"MALAYSIAN COCOA BOARD (INCORPORATION) ACT 1988","orig":"MALAYSIAN COCOA BOARD (INCORPORATION) ACT 1988","vi":"Luật về Ủy ban Ca cao Malaysia (Thành lập) năm 1988","th":"พระราชบัญญัติคณะกรรมการโกโก้มาเลเซีย (การจดทะเบียนจัดตั้ง) ค.ศ. 1988","id":"Undang-Undang Dewan Kakao Malaysia (Pendirian) Tahun 1988","ms":"Akta Lembaga Koko Malaysia (Perbadanan) 1988"},"level":"law","category":"05_其他及未分类","status":"active","docNumber":"ACT343","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"1988","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 8 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\05_其他及未分类\\1988_343_MALAYSIAN COCOA BOARD (INCORPORATION) ACT 1988.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H275-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"en":"1. The Board shall, on or before the date on which any\n\ncorporation is established under section 10, make regulations in\nrespect of such corporation defining—\n\n(a) the purposes and objects for which such corporation is\nestablished;\n\nPower of\n\nBoard to\nmake\n\n\" regulations\n\nin respect\nofa\ncorporation.\n\nSavings.\n\nRegulation\nsubject to\nthe Act.\n\nAmendment\nof the\nregulations.\n23/67.\n\nRegister of\ncorporation.\n\nWinding up.\n\nCorporation\nto be bodies\ncorporate,\n\n[2nd Sch.]\n\n20                                 Act 343\n\n(b) the rights, powers, duties and functions of such\ncorporation;\n\n(c) the system of management thereof; and\n\n(d) the relations between such corporation and the Board\nand its rights of control over such corporation."}},{"id":"MY-H275-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"en":"2. Nothing in paragraph 1 shall be deemed to authorize the\nBoard to make regulations to establish any corporation for any\npurpose or object more extensive in scope than the purposes or\nobjects for which the Board was constituted or to confer on any\ncorporation any right, duty, power or function which is not within\nthe rights, duties, powers or functions of the Board under this Act."}},{"id":"MY-H275-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"en":"3. Subject to the provisions of this Act and of any regulations\nmade thereunder any regulations made under paragraph 1 shall be\nbinding on the corporation in respect of which they were made and\n\nshall have effect for all purposes as if they had been enacted in this\nAct."}},{"id":"MY-H275-A4","no":4,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 4"},"text":{"en":"4. The Board may at any time amend, revoke, or add to, any\nregulations made in respect of any corporation under paragraph 1\nand section 34 of the Interpretation Act 1967, shall apply to any\nsuch amended or revoked regulations as if such regulations had\nbeen written law."}},{"id":"MY-H275-A5","no":5,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 5"},"text":{"en":"5. The Board shall keep a register in the prescribed form of all\ncorporations established by it under section 10 and such register\ntogether with copies of all regulations made under paragraph 1\nshall be open to public inspection at such place or places and at\nsuch times as it may prescribe.            |"}},{"id":"MY-H275-A6","no":6,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 6"},"text":{"en":"6. (1) The Board may by order published in the Gazette direct\nthat any corporation established by it shall be wound up and\ndissolved.\n\n(2) Upon the dissolution of any corporation under this\nparagraph the assets of the corporation after payment of all\nliabilities shall be transferred to and vested in the Board.\n\n(3) The winding up of a corporation under this paragraph shall\nbe conducted in such manner as the Board may prescribe."}},{"id":"MY-H275-A7","no":7,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 7"},"text":{"en":"7. Every corporation established under section 10 shall be a body\ncorporate by such name as the Board shall give to such corporation\nand shall have perpetual succession and a common seal and may\nsue and be sued in such name, and for the purpose of carrying into\neffect the registered development project for which it has been\nestablished may enter into contracts and may hold and deal in or\nwith any immovable or movable property and may do all other\n\nbes   ets\nxa'! S\n\nya\n\nae ee\n\n[2nd Sch.)\n\nMALAYSIAN COCOA BOARD (INCORPORATION) 21\n\nmatters and things incidental or appertaining to a body corporate\nnot inconsistent with the provision of this Act and subject to such\nrestrictions or limitations as may be prescribed by the Board in\neach case."}},{"id":"MY-H275-A8","no":8,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 8"},"text":{"en":"8. Every corporation shall have a common seal, which shall bear\nsuch device as the corporation, with the approval of the Board\nmay approve, and such seal may from time to time be broken,\nchanged, altered and made a new by the corporation, with the\napproval of the Board, as the corporation shall think fit.\n\nDICETAK OLEH HAJI MOKHTAR SHAMSUDDIN, J.S.D.. S.M.T.. S.M.S.. S.M.P.. K.M.N.. P.1.S..\nKETUA PENGARAH PERCETAKAN NEGARA. KUALA LUMPUR\nDENGAN PERINTAH PADA 8HB SEPTEMBER 1988\n\nHarga: $2\n\nCommon\nseal of the\ncorporation."}}],"pack":"my-6"};
  FT["MY-H2750"] = {"id":"MY-H2750","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 226/2014&status=AMENDMENT","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":3,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2014年食品卫生（修正）条例","en":"FOOD HYGIENE (AMENDMENT) REGULATIONS 2014","orig":"FOOD HYGIENE (AMENDMENT) REGULATIONS 2014","ms":"Peraturan Kebersihan Makanan (Pindaan) 2014","vi":"Quy định về Vệ sinh thực phẩm (Sửa đổi) năm 2014","th":"ข้อบังคับสุขลักษณะอาหาร (การแก้ไข) ค.ศ. 2014","id":"Peraturan Higiene Pangan (Perubahan) Tahun 2014"},"level":"regulation","category":"05_其他及未分类","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA226","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2014","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 3 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\05_其他及未分类\\2014_P.U.(A)226-2014_FOOD HYGIENE (AMENDMENT) REGULATIONS 2014.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H2750-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. Peraturan-peraturan ini bolehlah dinamakan Peraturan-Peraturan\n\nKebersihan Makanan (Pindaan) 2014.\n\nPindaan peraturan 30"}},{"id":"MY-H2750-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Peraturan-Peraturan Kebersihan Makanan 2009 [P.U. (A) 95/2009], yang disebut\n\n\"Peraturan-Peraturan ibu\" dalam Peraturan-Peraturan ini, dipinda dalam\n\nperaturan 30—\n\n(a) dengan menggantikan subperaturan (1) dengan subperaturan yang\n\nberikut:\n\n \"(1) Pengendali makanan hendaklah menjalani latihan pengendali\n\nmakanan dan mendapatkan Sijil Latihan Pengendali Makanan daripada\n\ninstitusi yang diluluskan oleh Pengarah.\"; dan\n\n(b) dalam subperaturan (2), dengan menggantikan perkataan \"ditentukan\"\n\ndengan perkataan \"diluluskan\".\n\nPindaan Jadual Kedua"}},{"id":"MY-H2750-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"ms":"3. Jadual Kedua kepada Peraturan-Peraturan ibu dipinda dengan menggantikan\n\nperkataan \"[Subperaturan 5(1)]\" dengan perkataan \"[Peraturan 5]\".\n\nDibuat 22 Julai 2014\n\n[KKM-163/S/48; PN(PU2)418/XX]\n\n DATUK SERI DR. S. SUBRAMANIAM\n\n Menteri Kesihatan\n\nFOOD ACT 1983\n\nFOOD HYGIENE (AMENDMENT) REGULATIONS 2014\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by section 34 of the Food Act 1983 [Act 281], the\n\nMinister makes the following regulations:\n\nCitation"}}],"pack":"my-6"};
  FT["MY-H2751"] = {"id":"MY-H2751","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 226/2015&status=AMENDMENT","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":4,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2015年关税（禁止进口）（修正）（第7号）令","en":"CUSTOMS (PROHIBITION OF IMPORTS) (AMENDMENT) (NO. 7) ORDER 2015","orig":"CUSTOMS (PROHIBITION OF IMPORTS) (AMENDMENT) (NO. 7) ORDER 2015","ms":"Perintah Kastam (Larangan Import) (Pindaan) (Bilangan 7) 2015","vi":"Lệnh về Hải quan (Cấm nhập khẩu) (Sửa đổi) (số 7) năm 2015","th":"คำสั่งศุลกากร (การห้ามนำเข้า) (การแก้ไข) (ฉบับที่ 7) ค.ศ. 2015","id":"Perintah Kepabeanan (Larangan Impor) (Perubahan) (Nomor 7) Tahun 2015"},"level":"regulation","category":"03_涉外投资与贸易","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA226","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2015","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 4 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\03_涉外投资与贸易\\2015_P.U.(A)226-2015_CUSTOMS (PROHIBITION OF IMPORTS) (AMENDMENT) (NO. 7) ORDER 2015.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H2751-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Kastam (Larangan Mengenai\nImport) (Pindaan) (No. 7) 2015.\n\n(2) Perintah ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 1 November 2015.\n\nPindaan Jadual Pertama"}},{"id":"MY-H2751-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Perintah Kastam (Larangan Mengenai Import)  2012 [ P.U. (A) 490/2012], yang\ndisebut \"Perintah ibu\" dalam Perintah ini,  dipinda dalam Jadual Pertama  dengan\nmemasukkan selepas butiran 13 dan butir -butir yang berhubungan dengannya butiran\nyang berikut:\n\n(1)\nItem No.\n(2)\nDescription of Goods\n(3)\nCountry\n\"14. Liquid-filled type electric heating bag, cushion, pillow, pouch or\npad using alternating current (AC) or AC and direct current\n(AC/DC) as follows:\n\n(i) with 2-pin  inlet filled with liquid; or\n\n(ii) with 2-pin or 3-pin  inlet without liquid (empty)\n\nAll countries\n\n\".\n\nPindaan Jadual Kedua"}},{"id":"MY-H2751-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"ms":"3. Jadual Kedua  kepada Perintah i bu dipinda dalam Bahagian I  dengan\nmemasukkan selepas butiran 10 dan butir -butir yang berhubungan dengannya butiran\nyang berikut:\n\n(1)\nItem\nNo.\n(2)\nDescription of Goods\n(3)\nChapter/\nHeading/\nSubheading\n\n(4)\nCountry\n(5)\nMinistry/Department/\nStatutory Body Issuing\nLicence\n\n\"11. Mercury (Hg) and mercury\ncompunds covered  under\nMinamata Convention on\nMercury. Substances as listed\nbelow:\n\n(1) Mercury\n\n(2) Amalgam\n\n(3)  Inorganic or organic\ncompounds of mercury,\nwhether or not\nchemically defined,\nexcluding amalgams\n(including mercury\nsulphate and mercury\ncompounds of a kind\nused as lumino phores)\n\n(4) Organo mercury\ncompounds\n\n(5) Dental alloys containing\nmercury\n\n2805.40 000\n\n2843.90 000\n\n2852.10 000,\n2852.90 000\n\n2852.10 000,\n2852.90 000\n\n3006.40 110\nAll\ncountries\n\nPharmaceutical Services\nDivision, Ministry of\nHealth\n\n\".\n\nPindaan Jadual Keempat"}},{"id":"MY-H2751-A4","no":4,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 4"},"text":{"ms":"4.  Jadual Keempat kepada Perintah i bu dipinda dalam Bahagian II dengan\nmemasukkan selepas butiran 11 dan butir -butir yang berhubungan dengannya butiran\nyang berikut:\n\n (1)\nItem\nNo.\n(2)\nDescription of Goods\n(3)\nChapter/Heading/\nSubheading\n\n(4)\nCountry\n(5)\nManner of Import\n\n\"12. Liquid-filled type electric\nheating bag, cushion, pillow,\npouch or pad filled with liquid,\nusing 3 -pin inlet alternating\ncurrent (AC) or AC and direct\ncurrent (AC/DC)\n\n8516.79 900,\n9404.90 000\n\nAll\ncountries\nThat the import is\naccompanied by a letter of\napproval issued by the\nSuruhanjaya Tenaga in the\ncase of Peninsular Malaysia\nand Sabah, or the equivalent\ncounterpart in the case of\nSarawak, certifying that the\nspecified domestic electrical\napparatus conforms to the\nMalaysian Standard  or\nInternational\nElectrotechnical Commission\n(IEC) standard \".\n\nDibuat  6 Oktober 2015\n[SULIT KE.HT(96)669/15-36/Klt.18/S.K. 19; Perb.0.9060/ 18JLD.32(SK.5) ;\nPN(PU2)338C/XXIII]\n\nDATO' SERI AHMAD HUSNI BIN MOHAMAD HANADZLAH\nMenteri Kewangan Kedua\n\nCUSTOMS ACT 1967\n\nCUSTOMS (PROHIBITION OF IMPORTS) (AMENDMENT) (NO. 7) ORDER 2015\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by subsection 31(1) of\nthe Customs Act 1967 [Act 235], the Minister makes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-6"};
