  FT["MY-H2809"] = {"id":"MY-H2809","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 229/2020&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":3,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2020年合作社（接管古晋汽车合作社（KOPERASI AUTOMOBIL KUCHING SARAWAK BERHAD））（再委任）令","en":"CO-OPERATIVE SOCIETIES (ASSUMPTION OF CONTROL OF KOPERASI AUTOMOBIL KUCHING SARAWAK BERHAD) (REAPPOINTMENT) ORDER 2020","orig":"CO-OPERATIVE SOCIETIES (ASSUMPTION OF CONTROL OF KOPERASI AUTOMOBIL KUCHING SARAWAK BERHAD) (REAPPOINTMENT) ORDER 2020","ms":"Perintah Koperasi (Pengambilalihan Kawalan KOPERASI AUTOMOBIL KUCHING SARAWAK BERHAD) (Pelantikan Semula) 2020","vi":"Lệnh về Hợp tác xã (Tiếp nhận kiểm soát KOPERASI AUTOMOBIL KUCHING SARAWAK BERHAD) (Tái bổ nhiệm) năm 2020","th":"คำสั่งสหกรณ์ (การเข้าควบคุมสหกรณ์ยานยนต์กูชิงซาราวัก) (การแต่งตั้งอีกครั้ง) ค.ศ. 2020","id":"Perintah Koperasi (Pengambilalihan Pengendalian KOPERASI AUTOMOBIL KUCHING SARAWAK BERHAD) (Pengangkatan Kembali) Tahun 2020"},"level":"regulation","category":"02_民商事与经济法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA229","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2020","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 3 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\02_民商事与经济法\\2020_P.U.(A)229-2020_CO-OPERATIVE SOCIETIES (ASSUMPTION OF CONTROL OF KOPERASI AUTOMOBIL KUCHING SARAWAK BERHAD) (RE.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H2809-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Koperasi\n(Pengambilalihan Kawalan Koperasi Automobil Kuching Sarawak Berhad)\n(Pelantikan Semula) 2020.\n\nPelantikan semula bagi pengambilalihan kawalan"}},{"id":"MY-H2809-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Suruhanjaya melantik semula Meor Mohammad Shariffudin bin Meor Yahya\nuntuk mengambil alih kawalan semua harta, urusan, aktiviti dan hal ehwal\nKoperasi Automobil Kuching Sarawak Berhad, dan menjalankan kesemua urusan,  aktiviti\ndan hal ehwalnya bagi tempoh mulai 21 September 2020 hingga 20 September 2021\natau sehingga suatu Lembaga baharu dipilih di bawah undang-undang kecil Koperasi itu,\nmengikut mana-mana yang terdahulu.\n\nKos, perbelanjaan dan saraan"}},{"id":"MY-H2809-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"ms":"3. Apa-apa kos dan perbelanjaan yang dilakukan oleh Suruhanjaya, dan saraan bagi\norang yang dilantik semula di bawah perenggan 2, b erhubung dengan pengambilalihan\nkawalan di bawah perenggan 2 hendaklah kena dibayar daripada dana dan harta\nKoperasi Automobil Kuching Sarawak Berhad sebagai suatu caj pertama.\n\nDibuat  12 Ogos 2020\n[SKM.IP(SULIT)(KP): 471A/1/3JLD.3; PN(PU2)527/XX]\n\nDATUK NORDIN BIN SALLEH\nPengerusi Eksekutif\nSuruhanjaya Koperasi Malaysia\n\nCO-OPERATIVE SOCIETIES ACT 1993\n\nCO-OPERATIVE SOCIETIES (ASSUMPTION OF CONTROL OF KOPERASI AUTOMOBIL\nKUCHING SARAWAK BERHAD) (REAPPOINTMENT) ORDER 2020\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by paragraph 69(2) (a)\nand subsection 69 A(2) of the Co -operative Societies Act 1993 [ Act 502 ],\nthe Commission makes the following order:\n\nCitation"}}],"pack":"my-6"};
  FT["MY-H281"] = {"id":"MY-H281","coverage":"partial","language":"en","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-detail.php?act=351&lang=BI","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":14,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"1961年婴儿监护法","en":"GUARDIANSHIP OF INFANTS ACT 1961","orig":"GUARDIANSHIP OF INFANTS ACT 1961","vi":"Luật về Giám hộ trẻ sơ sinh năm 1961","th":"พระราชบัญญัติการเป็นผู้ปกครองทารก ค.ศ. 1961","id":"Undang-Undang Perwalian Bayi Tahun 1961","ms":"Akta Penjagaan Bayi 1961"},"level":"law","category":"02_民商事与经济法","status":"active","docNumber":"ACT351","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"1961","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 21 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\02_民商事与经济法\\1961_351_GUARDIANSHIP OF INFANTS ACT 1961.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H281-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"en":"1. (1) This Act may be cited as the Guardianship of Infants\nAct, 1961.\n\n(2) Nothing in this Act shall apply in any State to persons\nprofessing the Muslim religion| until this Act has been\nadopted by a law made by the} Legislature of that State;\nand any such law may provide that—\n\n(a) nothing in this Act which|is contrary to the Muslim\nreligion or the custom pf the Malays shall apply\nto any person under the age of eighteen years who\nprofesses the Muslim religion and whose father\nprofesses or professed at the date of his death that\nreligion or, in the case of an illegitimate child,\nwhose mother so professes or professed that\nreligion; and\n\n(b) in the case of any other person, the provisions of this\nAct, so far as they are contrary to the Muslim\nreligion, shall cease to apply to such person upon his\nprofessing the Muslim | religion, if at the date of\nsuch professing he has completed his age of\neighteen years or, if not having completed such age,\nhe professes the Muslim religion with the consent\nof the person who under this Act is the guardian\nof the person of the infant."}},{"id":"MY-H281-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"en":"2. (1) In this Act, unless there is anything repugnant in the\ncontext—\n\n\"Court\" means the High Court or a Judge when sitting\nin open Court;\n\n\"infant\" means a person  who has not attained his\nmajority;              |\n\n\"Judge\" means a Judge sitting in Chambers.\n\nNN\n\nShort title\nand applica\n\ntion.\n\nInterpreta-\ntion.\n\n56                            13 or 196\n\n(2) (a) For the purposes of this Act—\n\n(i) every person professing the Muslim religion\nshall be deemed to have attained his\nmajority when he shall have completed\nA Bee of eighte¢n years and not before;\nan\n\n(ii) every other person |shall be deemed to have\nattained his majority when he shall have\ncompleted his age of twenty-one years and\nnot before.\n\n(b) In computing the age of any person the day on\nwhich he was born is to be recKoned as a whole day and\nif he falls within sub-paragraph (1) of paragraph (a) he shall\nbe deemed to have attained his majority at the beginning of\nthe eighteenth anniversary of that day, and if he falls within\nsub-paragraph (ii) of paragraph (a) at the beginning of the\ntwenty-first anniversary of that day.\n\nDutiesof 3, The guardian of the person bf an infant shall have the\nguarcanof custody of the infant, and shall be responsible for his\n\nsupport, health and education.\n\nDuties of 4. Subject to the rights and [powers of any trustee or\nae  personal representative in whom an infant's property is\nvested, a guardian of the property of an infant shall have\nthe control and management of the infant's property, and\nshall deal therewith as carefully as a man of ordinary\nprudence would deal with his own property, and may,\nsubject to this Act, do all acts which are reasonable and\nproper for the realisation or] protection of the infant's\n\nproperty.\n\nFather tobe 5, Subject to the provisions of section 10 the father of an\ngrderof' infant shall be the guardian/of the infant's person and '\nCourtasto property:\n\ncustody.\n\n;        Provided that the Court or 4 Judge may make such order\nas it or he thinks fit regarding the custody of the infant,\nand the right of access thereto. of either parent, and may\nvary or discharge such order at any time on the application\nof either parent.\n\nWhee no (6. Subject to the provisions of section 10, where an infant\n\nmother     has no father living, the mother of the infant shall be the\npeerings    guardian of his person and property:\n\norguardian Provided that the Court or a Judge may appoint some\nby Court. | Other person to be the guardian of the infant's person and\n\nproperty, or either of them to act jointly with the mother.\n\nGUARDIANSHIP OF INFANTS                     57"}},{"id":"MY-H281-A7","no":7,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 7"},"text":{"en":"7. If both the parents of an infant) are dead, the testamen-\ntary guardian (if any) appointed by) the last surviving parent\nshall, subject to the provisions of section 10, be the guardian\nof his person and property."}},{"id":"MY-H281-A8","no":8,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 8"},"text":{"en":"8. If both parents of the infant have died without appointing\na testamentary guardian, any Magistrate, kathi, penghulu,\npolice officer not below the rank of Sergeant, any person\nhaving the custody of such infant] or any person with the\npowers of a Protector under the Children and Young\nPersons Ordinance, 1947, may cause such infant to be taken\nbefore the Court or a Judge and the Court or a Judge may\nappoint a guardian of the infant's person and property or\neither of them."}},{"id":"MY-H281-A9","no":9,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 9"},"text":{"en":"9. The Court or a Judge may, in jappointing any guardian\nof an_infant's property, by order define, restrict, or extend\nthe power and authority of the gudrdian in relation thereto,\nto such extent as is necessary for the welfare of the infant."}},{"id":"MY-H281-A10","no":10,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 10"},"text":{"en":"10. The Court or a Judge may at any time remove from\nhis guardianship any guardian, whether a parent or other-\nwise and whether of the person! or the property of the\ninfant, and may appoint from time to time another person\nto be guardian in his place."}},{"id":"MY-H281-A11","no":11,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 11"},"text":{"en":"11. The Court or a Judge, in exercising the powers con-\nferred by the foregoing provisio\nregard primarily to the welfare jof the infant and shall,\nwhere the infant has a parent pr parents, consider the\nwishes of such parent or both of them, as the case may be."}},{"id":"MY-H281-A12","no":12,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 12"},"text":{"en":"12. A Judge may, for the purpose] of any application under\nthis Act, direct that any person appearing to have the\ncustody of an infant shall producg the infant in the Judge's\nChambers, or at such other place as he may appoint, and\nhe may make such order for th¢ temporary custody and\nprotection of the infant as he thinks fit."}},{"id":"MY-H281-A13","no":13,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 13"},"text":{"en":"13. Where an infant leaves, or is removed from, the custody\nof his lawful guardian, the Court or a Judge may order that\nhe be returned to such custody, land for the purposes of\nenforcing such order, may direct) an officer of the Court\nto seize the person of the infant land deliver him into the\ncustody of his lawful guardian."}},{"id":"MY-H281-A14","no":14,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 14"},"text":{"en":"14. (1) Where a person is appointed by the Court to be the\nguardian of an infant's property he shall, unless the Judge\notherwise orders, give security in such sum as may be\nappointed for the due performance of his duties as such\nguardian.\n\nof this Act, shall have ‘°°\n\nTestamen-\ntary\nguardian,\n\nGuardian\nof orphan.\n\nMU.\n33 of 1947.\n\nVariation\nof power\nof guardian\nof property.\n\nRemoval of\nguardian.\n\nMatters\n\no be\nconsidered.\n\nProduction\nof infant.\n\nPlacing\ninfant in\ncustody of\nguardian.\n\nSecurity to\nbe given.\n\n58                 13 oF 1961\n\n(2) Such security shall be given in the manner prescribed\nfor the time being in the case Af receivers appointed by the\nCourt; and the guardian so appointed shall pass his accounts\nat such periods as may be ordered, and shall pay in any\nbalance certified to be due from him into Court in the\nmanner prescribed in the case of receivers.\n\nLimitation 15, (1) A guardian of the property of an infant shall not,\npal without the leave of the Court or a Judge—\n\n(a) sell, charge, mortgage, exchange, or otherwise part\nwith the possession of any of the movable or\nimmovable property of|the infant; or\n\n(b) lease any land belonging to the infant for a term\nexceeding one year.\n\n(2) Any disposal of an infant's property in contraven-\ntion of this section may be declared void, and on such\ndeclaration the Judge may make such order as appears\nrequisite for restoring to the infant's estate the property\nso disposed of.\n\n(3) The Court or a Judge |shall not make any order\nunder sub-section (2) unless it is necessary or advisable in\nthe interests of the infant.\n\nGuardian 16. A guardian of the property of an infant shall not, unless\ngive dis.   in any case the Court or a Judge otherwise orders, be\nnae for empowered to give a good discharge for any legacy or other\nProperty. capital monies payable to or receivable by an infant.\n\nCoen  17. (1) A guardian of the property of an infant may make\n\ninfantout reasonable provision out of the income of such property for\n\nofincome. his maintenance and education,  aving regard to his station\nin life; but no sum exceeding three hundred dollars per\nmonth may be so applied without the leave of the Court\nor a Judge.\n\n(2) Where the income of tHe infant's property in the\nhands of the guardian is insufficient for such purpose, or\nmoney is required for the infant's advancement, a Judge\nmay order that provision for such purpose be made out of\nthe capital of the infant's property, and for such purpose\nmay authorise the sale, charge or mortgage.of any part of\nthe infant's property and give |such directions in regard\nthereto as may be necessary in the interests of the infant.\n\nGUARDIANSHIP OF INFANTS           59"}},{"id":"MY-H281-A18","no":18,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 18"},"text":{"en":"18. (1) If it appears that, having regard to the station in\nlife of an infant and to the value of His property and to all\nthe circumstances of the case, it wojild be expedient that\nthe capital property of the infant shopld be made available\nfor his maintenance, education or advancement in such\nmanner as to avoid the expense of applications to the\nCourt, a Judge may, instead of appoinlting a guardian of the\nproperty of the infant, order that all the property of the\ninfant, of whatsoever description, sHall be placed in the\nhands of a person to be appointed by the Judge, with full\npower to deal with and apply the same for the purpose\naforesaid in his sole and uncontrolled discretion; and in\nsuch case the receipt of the person so appointed shall be a\ngood discharge to any person making any payment or\ntransfer of any property to him on behalf of the infant.\n\n(2) Any person so appointed maly be ordered by the\nCourt or a Judge to render an account of his dealings with\nthe infant's estate.\n\n(3) The Court or a Judge may for any sufficient reason\ndischarge any order, or revoke any] appointment, made\nunder sub-section (1), and may appoint another person with\nthe same power or such greater or less power as may appear\nadvisable, or may appoint a guardian of the infant's\nproperty."}},{"id":"MY-H281-A19","no":19,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 19"},"text":{"en":"19. Any guardian may apply to a Judge for his opinion,\nadvice or discretion on any question respecting the manage-\nment or administration of the infant's| property."}},{"id":"MY-H281-A20","no":20,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 20"},"text":{"en":"20. (1) Nothing in this Act shall apply to any money paid\ninto a subordinate court to the credit] of an infant in any\naction or proceeding in a subordinate court, or to any\nmoney in a subordinate court ordered] to be transferred to\nthe credit of an infant, but the same} shall be dealt with\naccording to rules of court unless the Court or a Judge shall\nin any case otherwise order.\n\n(2) In this section \"subordinate court\" means any court\nsubordinate to the Supreme Court."}},{"id":"MY-H281-A21","no":21,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 21"},"text":{"en":"21. The Rule Committee may make| rules to carry the\nprovisions of this Act into effect and, without prejudice to\n\nSpecial\norder in case\nof small\nestate,\n\nApplication\nfor opinion,\netc.\n\nException\nfor money\npaid intoa\nsubordinate\ncourt.\n\nRules of\nCourt.\n\n|\n60                 13 or 1961\n\nthe generality of such power, may by such rules provide for\nthe manner in which applications to the Court or a Judge\nare to be made, and generally for all matters of procedure\nand other incidental matters arising out of the provisions\nof this Act.\n\nRepeal of 22. The Guardianship of Infants Ordinance of the Straits\nS. Ord.            .\nCap. 50.    Settlements is hereby repealed.\n\n[Received the Royal Assent\non the 9th day of March,\n1961.)\n\nSection\n\nGUARDIANSHIP OH INFANTS                     61\n\nTABLE OF CONTENTS\n\nShort title and application.\nInterpretation.\n\nDuties of guardian of person.\nDuties of guardian of property.\nFather to be guardian; order pf Court as to custody.\n\nWhere no father mother to be/guardian; or guardian appointed\nby Court.\n\nTestamentary guardian.\nGuardian of orphan.\nVariation of power of guardihn of property.\nRemoval of guardian.\nMatters to be considered.\nProduction of infant.\nPlacing infant in custody of guardian.\nSecurity to be given.           .\nLimitation of guardian's powers.\n\nGuardian may not give discharge for capital property.\nGuardian may support infant out of income.\n\nSpecial order in case of small estate.\n\nApplication for opinion, etc\nException for money paid into a subordinate court.\nRules of Court.\nRepeal of S.S. Ord. Cap. 5).\n\nKUALA LUMPUR\n\nPRINTED BY THE GOVERNMENT PRINTER AND PUBLISHED BY AUTHORITY ON 23RD MARCH, 1961\n\nPrice: 50 cts."}}],"pack":"my-6"};
  FT["MY-H2810"] = {"id":"MY-H2810","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 229/2021&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2021年牙科（附表二修正）令","en":"DENTAL (AMENDMENT OF SECOND SCHEDULE) ORDER 2021","orig":"DENTAL (AMENDMENT OF SECOND SCHEDULE) ORDER 2021","ms":"Perintah Pergigian (Pindaan Jadual Kedua) 2021","vi":"Lệnh về Nha khoa (Sửa đổi Phụ lục thứ hai) năm 2021","th":"คำสั่งทันตกรรม (การแก้ไขภาคผนวกที่สอง) ค.ศ. 2021","id":"Perintah Kedokteran Gigi (Perubahan Lampiran Kedua) Tahun 2021"},"level":"regulation","category":"04_劳工与行政法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA229","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2021","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\04_劳工与行政法\\2021_P.U.(A)229-2021_DENTAL (AMENDMENT OF SECOND SCHEDULE) ORDER 2021.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H2810-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Pergigian (Pindaan\n\nJadual Kedua) 2021.\n\nPindaan Jadual Kedua"}},{"id":"MY-H2810-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Jadual Kedua kepada Akta Pergigian 1971 dipinda, berhubung dengan negara\n\n\"Australia\", dalam butiran \"University of Sydney\", dengan memasukkan selepas\n\nbutir-butir \"Bachelor of Dental Surgery\" butir-butir yang berikut:\n\nPerihal kelulusan\n\n\"Bachelor of Dentistry\n\n (Diiktiraf pada 20 November 2004)\".\n\nDibuat 3 Mei 2021\n\n[KKM-60(21/4)/3/1; PN(PU2)93/VIII]\n\nDATO' SRI DR. ADHAM BIN BABA\n\nMenteri Kesihatan\n\nDENTAL ACT 1971\n\nDENTAL (AMENDMENT OF SECOND SCHEDULE) ORDER 2021\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by subsection 12(2) of the\n\nDental Act 1971 [Act 51], the Minister, after consulting the Council,\n\nmakes the following order:\n\nCitation"}}],"pack":"my-6"};
  FT["MY-H2811"] = {"id":"MY-H2811","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 229/2022&status=AMENDMENT","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2022年金融服务（资金最低金额或资产超过负债的盈余）（持牌人）（修正）（第2号）令","en":"FINANCIAL SERVICES (MINIMUM AMOUNT OF CAPITAL FUNDS OR SURPLUS OF ASSETS OVER LIABILITIES) (LICENSED PERSON) (AMENDMENT) (NO. 2) ORDER 2022","orig":"FINANCIAL SERVICES (MINIMUM AMOUNT OF CAPITAL FUNDS OR SURPLUS OF ASSETS OVER LIABILITIES) (LICENSED PERSON) (AMENDMENT) (NO. 2) ORDER 2022","ms":"Perintah Perkhidmatan Kewangan (Jumlah Minimum Dana Modal atau Lebihan Aset Melebihi Liabiliti) (Orang Berlesen) (Pindaan) (Bilangan 2) 2022","vi":"Lệnh về Dịch vụ tài chính (Số tiền tối thiểu của quỹ vốn hoặc thặng dư tài sản so với nợ phải trả) (Người được cấp phép) (Sửa đổi) (số 2) năm 2022","th":"คำสั่งบริการทางการเงิน (จำนวนเงินขั้นต่ำของกองทุนหรือส่วนเกินสินทรัพย์เหนือหนี้สิน) (ผู้ได้รับใบอนุญาต) (การแก้ไข) (ฉบับที่ 2) ค.ศ. 2022","id":"Perintah Jasa Keuangan (Jumlah Minimum Dana Modal atau Surplus Aset atas Kewajiban) (Orang Berlisensi) (Perubahan) (Nomor 2) Tahun 2022"},"level":"regulation","category":"02_民商事与经济法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA229","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2022","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\02_民商事与经济法\\2022_P.U.(A)229-2022_FINANCIAL SERVICES (MINIMUM AMOUNT OF CAPITAL FUNDS OR SURPLUS OF ASSETS OVER LIABILITIES) (LIC.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H2811-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Perkhidmatan Kewangan\n(Amaun Minimum Dana Modal atau Lebihan Aset berbanding Liabiliti)\n(Orang Berlesen) (Pindaan) (No. 2) 2022.\n\nPindaan perenggan 3"}},{"id":"MY-H2811-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Perintah Perkhidmatan Kewangan (Amaun Minimum Dana Modal atau\nLebihan Aset b erbanding Liabiliti) (Orang B erlesen) 2013 [P.U. (A) 199/2013 ] dipinda\ndalam perenggan 3, dalam takrif \"bank digital berlesen\" dengan menggantikan perkataan\n\"sebahagian besarnya\" dengan perkataan \"hampir sepenuhnya\".\n\nDibuat 6 Julai 2022\n[MOF.SID(S)700-1/2/51(S.K.1); PN(PU2)718/JLD. 6]\n\nTENGKU DATUK SERI UTAMA ZAFRUL BIN TENGKU ABDUL AZIZ\n    Menteri Kewangan\n\nFINANCIAL SERVICES ACT 2013\n\nFINANCIAL SERVICES (MINIMUM AMOUNT OF CAPITAL FUNDS OR SURPLUS OF\nASSETS OVER LIABILITIES) (LICENSED PERSON) (AMENDMENT) (NO. 2) ORDER 2022\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by subsection 12(1)\nof the Financial Services Act 2013 [Act 758], the Minister makes the following order:\n\nCitation"}}],"pack":"my-6"};
  FT["MY-H2812"] = {"id":"MY-H2812","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 229/2023&status=AMENDMENT","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":3,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2023年法院规则（修正）","en":"RULES OF COURT (AMENDMENT) 2023","orig":"RULES OF COURT (AMENDMENT) 2023","ms":"Kaedah Mahkamah (Pindaan) 2023","vi":"Quy tắc Tòa án (Sửa đổi) năm 2023","th":"ข้อบังคับศาล (การแก้ไข) ค.ศ. 2023","id":"Tata Tertib Mahkamah (Perubahan) Tahun 2023"},"level":"regulation","category":"01_宪法与基础法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA229","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2023","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 3 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\01_宪法与基础法\\2023_P.U.(A)229-2023_RULES OF COURT (AMENDMENT) 2023.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H2812-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. Kaedah-kaedah ini bolehlah dinamakan Kaedah-Kaedah Mahkamah\n(Pindaan) 2023.\n\nPindaan Aturan 41"}},{"id":"MY-H2812-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Kaedah-Kaedah Mahkamah 2012 [ P.U. (A) 205/2012 ], yang disebut\n\"Kaedah-Kaedah ibu\" dalam Kaedah -Kaedah ini, dipinda dalam Aturan 41,\nsubkaedah 9(2) dengan memotong perkataan \"dan pemfailan\".\n\nPindaan Lampiran A"}},{"id":"MY-H2812-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"ms":"3. Lampiran A Kaedah-Kaedah ibu dipinda—\n\n(a) dalam Borang No. 2, dengan menggantikan perkataan \"termasuklah hari\npenyampaian itu\" dengan perkataan \"tidak termasuk  hari penyampaian itu\"; dan\n\n(b) dalam Borang No. 2A, dengan menggantikan perkataan \"termasuklah hari\npenyampaian itu\" dengan perkataan \"tidak termasuk hari penyampaian itu\".\n\nDibuat 8 Jun 2023\n[PKPMP.BD.600-1/5/26; PN(PU2)153/XIX]\n\nJawatankuasa Kaedah-Kaedah:\n\nTUN TENGKU MAIMUN BINTI TUAN MAT\nKetua Hakim Negara, Malaysia\n\nTAN SRI DATUK AMAR ABANG ISKANDAR BIN ABANG HASHIM\nPresiden Mahkamah Rayuan, Malaysia\n\nDATO' MOHAMAD ZABIDIN BIN MOHD DIAH\nHakim Besar Mahkamah Tinggi di Malaya\n\nDATO' ABDUL RAHMAN BIN SEBLI\nHakim Besar Mahkamah Tinggi di Sabah dan Sarawak\n\nPUAN SUZANA BINTI ATAN\nbagi pihak Peguam Negara, Malaysia\n\nTAN SRI DATUK NALLINI PATHMANATHAN\nHakim Mahkamah Persekutuan\n\nDATUK HAJJAH AZIZAH BINTI HAJI NAWAWI\nHakim Mahkamah Rayuan\n\nTUAN TEE GEOK HOCK\nHakim Mahkamah Tinggi di Malaya\n\nDATUK ISMAIL BIN BRAHIM\nHakim Mahkamah Tinggi di Sabah dan Sarawak\n\nDATO' HASBI BINTI HASAN\nKetua Pendaftar Mahkamah Persekutuan\n\nPUAN KAREN CHEAH YEE LYNN\nPeguam bela, Semenanjung Malaysia\n\nENCIK ROGER CHIN KEN FONG\nPeguam bela, Sabah\n\nENCIK GURVIR SINGH SANDHU\nPeguam bela, Sarawak\n\nJawatankuasa Kaedah-Kaedah Mahkamah Rendah:\n\nTUN TENGKU MAIMUN BINTI TUAN MAT\nKetua Hakim Negara, Malaysia\n\nTAN SRI DATUK AMAR ABANG ISKANDAR BIN ABANG HASHIM\nPresiden Mahkamah Rayuan, Malaysia\n\nDATO' MOHAMAD ZABIDIN BIN MOHD DIAH\nHakim Besar Mahkamah Tinggi di Malaya\n\nDATO' ABDUL RAHMAN BIN SEBLI\nHakim Besar Mahkamah Tinggi di Sabah dan Sarawak\n\nPUAN SUZANA BINTI ATAN\nbagi pihak Peguam Negara, Malaysia\n\nTAN SRI DATUK NALLINI PATHMANATHAN\nHakim Mahkamah Persekutuan\n\nDATUK HAJJAH AZIZAH BINTI HAJI NAWAWI\nHakim Mahkamah Rayuan\n\nTUAN TEE GEOK HOCK\nHakim Mahkamah Tinggi di Malaya\n\nDATUK ISMAIL BIN BRAHIM\nHakim Mahkamah Tinggi di Sabah dan Sarawak\n\nDATO' HASBI BINTI HASAN\nKetua Pendaftar Mahkamah Persekutuan\n\nPUAN KAREN CHEAH YEE LYNN\nPeguam bela, Semenanjung Malaysia\n\nENCIK ROGER CHIN KEN FONG\nPeguam bela, Sabah\n\nENCIK GURVIR SINGH SANDHU\nPeguam bela, Sarawak\n\n[Akan dibentangkan di Dewan Rakyat menurut subseksyen  17(5) Akta Mahkamah\nKehakiman 1964 dan seksyen 8 Akta Kaedah-Kaedah Mahkamah Rendah 1955]\n\nCOURTS OF JUDICATURE ACT 1964\n\nSUBORDINATE COURTS RULES ACT 1955\n\nRULES OF COURT (AMENDMENT) 2023\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by section 17 of\nthe Courts of Judicature Act 1964 [ Act 91 ] a nd section 4 of\nthe Subordinate Courts Rules Act 1955 [ Act 55 ], and with the consent of\nthe Chief Judge of the High Court in Malaya and the Chief Judge of the High Court in Sabah\nand Sarawak, the Rules Committee and the Subordinate Courts Rules Committee\nmake the following rules:\n\nCitation"}}],"pack":"my-6"};
  FT["MY-H2813"] = {"id":"MY-H2813","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 229/2024&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2024年自雇人员社会保障（小贩或商贩缴纳率）条例","en":"SELF-EMPLOYMENT SOCIAL SECURITY (RATES OF CONTRIBUTION FOR HAWKER OR TRADER) REGULATIONS 2024","orig":"SELF-EMPLOYMENT SOCIAL SECURITY (RATES OF CONTRIBUTION FOR HAWKER OR TRADER) REGULATIONS 2024","ms":"Peraturan Keselamatan Sosial Pekerja Sendiri (Kadar Caruman bagi Penjaja atau Peniaga) 2024","vi":"Quy định về An sinh xã hội cho người tự làm việc (Mức đóng góp của người bán hàng rong hoặc tiểu thương) năm 2024","th":"ข้อบังคับประกันสังคมผู้ประกอบอาชีพอิสระ (อัตราการสมทบของผู้ค้าแผงลอยหรือพ่อค้า) ค.ศ. 2024","id":"Peraturan Jaminan Sosial Pekerja Mandiri (Tarif Iuran bagi Pedagang Kaki Lima atau Pedagang) Tahun 2024"},"level":"regulation","category":"04_劳工与行政法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA229","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2024","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\04_劳工与行政法\\2024_P.U.(A)229-2024_SELF-EMPLOYMENT SOCIAL SECURITY (RATES OF CONTRIBUTION FOR HAWKER OR TRADER) REGULATIONS 2024.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H2813-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Peraturan-peraturan ini bolehlah dinamakan Peraturan-Peraturan\n\nKeselamatan Sosial Pekerjaan Sendiri (Kadar Caruman bagi Penjaja\n\natau Peniaga) 2024.\n\n(2) Peraturan-Peraturan ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 1 September 2024.\n\nKadar caruman"}},{"id":"MY-H2813-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. (1) Seseorang penjaja atau peniaga hendaklah membayar suatu caruman\n\nkepada Pertubuhan atau mana-mana ejen keselamatan sosial pekerjaan sendiri\n\npada kadar sebagaimana yang dipilih oleh penjaja atau peniaga itu berdasarkan\n\npendapatan bulanan pilihan yang diinsuranskan sebagaimana yang dinyatakan\n\ndalam Jadual.\n\n(2) Penjaja atau peniaga yang disebut dalam subperaturan (1) hendaklah\n\nmerupakan orang yang—\n\n(a) menjalankan aktiviti pekerjaan sendiri sebagaimana yang\n\ndinyatakan dalam perenggan 10 Jadual Pertama kepada Akta;\n\n(b) mempunyai apa-apa lesen atau kelulusan bagi aktiviti\n\nberhubung dengan menjaja atau berniaga, di jalan atau pasar\n\nyang dikeluarkan oleh mana-mana pihak berkuasa di bawah\n\nAkta Kerajaan Tempatan 1976 [Akta 171], Ordinan Kerajaan\n\nTempatan 1961 (Sabah No. 11 1991) atau Ordinan Kerajaan\n\nTempatan 1996 (Sarawak Bab. 20).\n\n(3) Tempoh pelindungan bagi kadar caruman yang dipilih oleh penjaja\n\natau peniaga di bawah subperaturan (1) hendaklah bagi tempoh dua belas bulan\n\nberturut-turut.\n\n(4) Jika dalam tempoh pelindungan yang disebut dalam subperaturan (3),\n\nkesahan apa-apa lesen atau kelulusan bagi aktiviti berhubung dengan menjaja atau\n\nberniaga, di jalan atau pasar yang dikeluarkan oleh mana-mana pihak berkuasa\n\ndi bawah Akta Kerajaan Tempatan 1976, Ordinan Kerajaan Tempatan 1961 atau\n\nOrdinan Kerajaan Tempatan 1996 itu habis tempoh,—\n\n(a) tempoh pelindungan itu hendaklah terus berkuat kuasa\n\nsehingga tempoh dua belas bulan berturut-turut itu habis; dan\n\n(b) penjaja atau peniaga hendaklah mengemukakan kepada\n\nPertubuhan, apabila diminta oleh Pertubuhan, apa-apa lesen\n\natau kelulusan baharunya, mengikut mana-mana yang berkenaan,\n\nuntuk penentusahan.\n\nJADUAL\n\n[Peraturan 2]\n\nKADAR CARUMAN BAGI PENJAJA ATAU PENIAGA\n\n1. Bagi maksud Jadual ini, \"pendapatan bulanan pilihan yang diinsuranskan\"\n\nertinya kelas pendapatan yang ditunjukkan di bawah untuk dipilih oleh penjaja\n\natau peniaga bagi maksud pembayaran caruman.\n\n2. Kadar caruman berdasarkan pendapatan bulanan pilihan yang diinsuranskan\n\nadalah seperti yang berikut:\n\n(1)\n\nBil.\n\n(2)\n\nPendapatan Bulanan Pilihan\n\nyang Diinsuranskan\n\n[RM]\n\n(3)\n\nKadar Caruman bagi\n\nDua Belas Bulan Berturut-turut\n\n[RM]\n\n1. 1,050.00 157.20\n\n2. 1,550.00 232.80\n\n3. 2,950.00 442.80\n\n4. 3,950.00 592.80\n\nDibuat 28 Ogos 2024\n\n[KSM.PUU(S)600-1/2/27/8 (5); PN(PU2)744/JLD.4]\n\n SIM CHEE KEONG\n\nMenteri Sumber Manusia\n\nSELF-EMPLOYMENT SOCIAL SECURITY ACT 2017\n\nSELF-EMPLOYMENT SOCIAL SECURITY\n\n(RATES OF CONTRIBUTION FOR HAWKER OR TRADER) REGULATIONS 2024\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by paragraph 83(2)(h) of the\n\nSelf-Employment Social Security Act 2017 [Act 789], the Minister makes\n\nthe following regulations:\n\nCitation and commencement\n\n1. (1) These regulations may be cited as the Self-Employment Social Security\n\n(Rates of Contribution for Hawker or Trader) Regulations 2024.\n\n(2) These Regulations come into operation on 1 September 2024.\n\nRates of contribution\n\n2. (1) A hawker or trader shall pay a contribution to the Organization or\n\nany self-employment social security agent at the rates as selected by the hawker\n\nor trader based on the selected insured monthly earning as specified in the Schedule.\n\n(2) The hawker or trader referred to in subregulation (1) shall be\n\nthe person who—\n\n(a) carries out the self-employment activity as specified\n\nin paragraph 10 of the First Schedule to the Act; and\n\n(b) holds any licences or approval for activity in relation to\n\nthe hawking or trading, at street or market issued by\n\nany authorities under the Local Government Act 1976 [Act 171],\n\nthe Local Government Ordinance 1961 (Sabah No. 11 of 1991) or\n\nthe Local Authorities Ordinance 1996 (Sarawak Cap. 20).\n\n(3) The coverage period for the rates of contribution selected\n\nby the hawker or trader under subregulation (1) shall be for a period\n\nof twelve consecutive months.\n\n(4) If within the coverage period referred to in subregulation (3),\n\nthe validity of any licences or approval for activity in relation to the hawking or\n\ntrading, at street or market issued by any authorities under the Local Government\n\nAct 1976, the Local Government Ordinance 1961 or the Local Authorities\n\nOrdinance 1996 expires,—\n\n(a) the coverage period shall continue to have effect until the period\n\nof twelve consecutive months expires; and\n\n(b) the hawker or trader shall submit to the Organization,\n\nupon request by the Organization, his any new licences or approval,\n\nas the case may be, for verification.\n\nSCHEDULE\n\n[Regulation 2]\n\nRATES OF CONTRIBUTION FOR HAWKER OR TRADER\n\n1. For the purposes of this Schedule, \"selected insured monthly earning\"\n\nmeans the class of earnings as shown below to be selected by hawker or\n\ntrader activity for the purpose of payment of contribution.\n\n2. The rates of contribution based on the selected insured monthly earning\n\nare as follows:\n\n(1)\n\nNo.\n\n(2)\n\nSelected Insured\n\nMonthly Earning\n\n[RM]\n\n(3)\n\nRates of Contribution for\n\nTwelve Consecutive Months\n\n[RM]\n\n1. 1,050.00 157.20\n\n2. 1,550.00 232.80\n\n3. 2,950.00 442.80\n\n4. 3,950.00 592.80\n\nMade 28 August 2024\n\n[KSM.PUU(S)600-1/2/27/8(5); PN(PU2)744/JLD.4]\n\n SIM CHEE KEONG\n\n Minister of Human Resources"}}],"pack":"my-6"};
  FT["MY-H2814"] = {"id":"MY-H2814","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 229/2025&status=AMENDMENT","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":6,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2025年水务产业（供水服务费率）（马六甲州）（修正）条例","en":"WATER SERVICES INDUSTRY (RATES FOR WATER SUPPLY SERVICES) (STATE OF MALACCA) (AMENDMENT) REGULATIONS 2025","orig":"WATER SERVICES INDUSTRY (RATES FOR WATER SUPPLY SERVICES) (STATE OF MALACCA) (AMENDMENT) REGULATIONS 2025","ms":"Peraturan Industri Perkhidmatan Air (Kadar Perkhidmatan Bekalan Air) (Negeri Melaka) (Pindaan) 2025","vi":"Quy định về Ngành dịch vụ nước (Giá dịch vụ cấp nước) (Bang Malacca) (Sửa đổi) năm 2025","th":"ข้อบังคับอุตสาหกรรมบริการน้ำ (อัตราค่าบริการจ่ายน้ำ) (รัฐมะละกา) (การแก้ไข) ค.ศ. 2025","id":"Peraturan Industri Jasa Air (Tarif Layanan Penyediaan Air) (Negara Bagian Malaka) (Perubahan) Tahun 2025"},"level":"regulation","category":"04_劳工与行政法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA229","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2025","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 6 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\04_劳工与行政法\\2025_P.U.(A)229-2025_WATER SERVICES INDUSTRY (RATES FOR WATER SUPPLY SERVICES) (STATE OF MALACCA) (AMENDMENT) REGULA.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H2814-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. Domestik\n\n(meter individu)\n\n(a) 0 meter padu dan\n\nsehingga 20 meter padu\n\n0.94 9.40\n\n(b) melebihi 20 meter padu\n\ndan sehingga 35 meter\n\npadu\n\n1.69\n\n(c) melebihi 35 meter padu 2.26"}},{"id":"MY-H2814-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Domestik\n\n(meter pukal)\n\nkadar rata 2.22 25.00"}},{"id":"MY-H2814-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"ms":"3. Bukan domestik (a) 0 meter padu dan\n\nsehingga 35 meter padu\n\n2.66 26.60\n\n(b) melebihi 35 meter padu 2.72"}},{"id":"MY-H2814-A4","no":4,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 4"},"text":{"ms":"4. Rumah ibadat dan\n\ninstitusi kebajikan\n\nkadar rata 1.01 10.10"}},{"id":"MY-H2814-A5","no":5,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 5"},"text":{"ms":"5. Perkapalan kadar rata 8.02 80.20\n\n(1)\n\nBil.\n\n(2)\n\nJenis penggunaan\n\n(3)\n\nJumlah penggunaan\n\n(4)\n\nKadar\n\nsetiap\n\nmeter padu\n\n(RM)\n\n(5)\n\nKadar\n\nminimum\n\n(setiap bulan)\n\n(RM)"}},{"id":"MY-H2814-A6","no":6,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 6"},"text":{"ms":"6. Pusat data kadar rata 5.32 53.20\".\n\nPenggantian Jadual Kedua\n\n3. Peraturan-Peraturan ibu dipinda dengan menggantikan Jadual Kedua dengan\n\njadual yang berikut:\n\n\"JADUAL KEDUA\n\n[Peraturan 3]\n\nJENIS PENGGUNAAN\n\n(1)\n\nBil.\n\n(2)\n\nJenis penggunaan\n\n(3)\n\nPerihalan\n\n1. Domestik\n\n(meter individu)\n\nBekalan air melalui meter individu atau meter\n\npetak ke premis kediaman atau unit kediaman\n\n2. Domestik\n\n(meter pukal)\n\nBekalan air melalui meter pukal ke bangunan\n\nkediaman bertingkat tinggi, komuniti berpagar,\n\npremis kediaman, unit kediaman, kuarters estet\n\ndan kuarters kerajaan\n\n3. Bukan domestik Premis komersial, premis industri, premis\n\nperdagangan, premis perniagaan, premis\n\nkerajaan, sekolah, institusi pengajian tinggi,\n\nhospital, perusahaan pemprosesan air (termasuk\n\nkios air), perladangan dan perkebunan\n\n(1)\n\nBil.\n\n(2)\n\nJenis penggunaan\n\n(3)\n\nPerihalan\n\n4. Rumah ibadat dan institusi\n\nkebajikan\n\nRumah ibadat yang pembinaannya diluluskan\n\noleh kerajaan di bawah mana-mana\n\nundang-undang bertulis atau pengoperasiannya\n\ndiluluskan oleh badan keagamaan berkaitan yang\n\ndiiktiraf oleh kerajaan untuk memberikan\n\nkelulusan bagi rumah ibadat\n\nInstitusi kebajikan yang berdaftar dengan Jabatan\n\nKebajikan Masyarakat, yang diberikan\n\npengecualian cukai oleh Lembaga Hasil Dalam\n\nNegeri Malaysia atau yang diiktiraf oleh kerajaan\n\nsebagai sebuah institusi kebajikan\n\n5. Perkapalan Bekalan air untuk kegunaan di atas kapal yang\n\nberlabuh di pelabuhan\n\n6. Pusat data Premis yang digunakan secara khusus untuk\n\nmenempatkan peralatan dan infrastruktur\n\nteknologi maklumat dan komunikasi secara\n\nberpusat bagi maksud mengurus data termasuk\n\nmenyimpan, mengumpul, memproses atau\n\nmengagih data\".\n\nDibuat 30 Julai 2025\n\n[PETRA. BAP. 100-1/1/3 KLT. 5 (8); PN(PU2)660/JLD.19]\n\nDATO' SRI HAJI FADILLAH BIN HAJI YUSOF\n\nMenteri Peralihan Tenaga dan Transformasi Air\n\nWATER SERVICES INDUSTRY ACT 2006\n\nWATER SERVICES INDUSTRY (RATES FOR WATER SUPPLY SERVICES)\n\n(STATE OF MALACCA) (AMENDMENT) REGULATIONS 2025\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by paragraphs 84(2)(a) and 179(i) of the\n\nWater Services Industry Act 2006 [Act 655], the Minister, on the recommendation of the\n\nCommission, makes the following regulations:\n\nCitation and commencement\n\n1. (1) These regulations may be cited as the Water Services Industry\n\n(Rates for Water Supply Services) (State of Malacca) (Amendment)\n\nRegulations 2025.\n\n(2) These Regulations come into operation on 1 August 2025.\n\nSubstitution of First Schedule\n\n2. The Water Services Industry (Rates for Water Supply Services) (State of Malacca)\n\nRegulations 2010 [P.U. (A) 372/2010], which are referred to as the \"principal Regulations\"\n\nin these Regulations, are amended by substituting for the First Schedule the\n\nfollowing schedule:\n\n\"FIRST SCHEDULE\n\n[Regulation 2]\n\nRATES FOR WATER SUPPLY SERVICES\n\n(1)\n\nNo.\n\n(2)\n\nType of use\n\n(3)\n\nAmount of consumption\n\n(4)\n\nRate\n\nper\n\ncubic metre\n\n(RM)\n\n(5)\n\nMinimum\n\ncharge\n\n(per month)\n\n(RM)\n\n1. Domestic\n\n(individual meter)\n\n(a) 0 cubic metre and up to\n\n20 cubic metres\n\n0.94 9.40\n\n(b) exceeding 20 cubic\n\nmetres and up to\n\n35 cubic metres\n\n1.69\n\n(c) exceeding 35 cubic\n\nmetres\n\n2.26\n\n2. Domestic\n\n(bulk meter)\n\nflat rate 2.22 25.00\n\n3. Non-domestic (a) 0 cubic metre and up to\n\n35 cubic metres\n\n2.66 26.60\n\n(b) exceeding 35 cubic\n\nmetres\n\n2.72\n\n4. House of worship\n\nand welfare\n\ninstitution\n\nflat rate 1.01 10.10\n\n(1)\n\nNo.\n\n(2)\n\nType of use\n\n(3)\n\nAmount of consumption\n\n(4)\n\nRate\n\nper\n\ncubic metre\n\n(RM)\n\n(5)\n\nMinimum\n\ncharge\n\n(per month)\n\n(RM)\n\n5. Shipping flat rate 8.02 80.20\n\n6. Data centre flat rate 5.32 53.20\".\n\nSubstitution of Second Schedule\n\n3. The principal Regulations are amended by substituting for the Second Schedule\n\nthe following schedule:\n\n\"SECOND SCHEDULE\n\n[Regulation 3]\n\nTYPE OF USE\n\n(1)\n\nNo.\n\n(2)\n\nType of use\n\n(3)\n\nDescription\n\n1. Domestic\n\n(individual meter)\n\nSupply of water through individual meter or\n\nparcel meter to residential premises or\n\nresidential units\n\n2. Domestic\n\n(bulk meter)\n\nSupply of water through bulk meter to high rise\n\nresidential building, gated community,\n\nresidential premises, residential units, estate\n\nquarters and government quarters\n\n(1)\n\nNo.\n\n(2)\n\nType of use\n\n(3)\n\nDescription\n\n3. Non-domestic Commercial premises, industrial premises, trade\n\npremises, business premises, government\n\npremises, school, institute of higher learning,\n\nhospital, water processing industry (including\n\nwater kiosk), plantation and farming\n\n4. House of worship and\n\nwelfare institution\n\nHouse of worship which its construction was\n\napproved by the government under any written\n\nlaws or its operation was approved by the\n\nrelevant religious bodies recognized by the\n\ngovernment to give approvals for houses of\n\nworship\n\nWelfare institution registered with the\n\nDepartment of Social Welfare, given tax\n\nexemptions by the Inland Revenue Board of\n\nMalaysia or recognized by the government as\n\na welfare institution\n\n5. Shipping Supply of water for the use aboard ships\n\nanchored at port\n\n6. Data centre Premises specifically used to centrally house\n\nequipment and infrastructure of information\n\ntechnology and communication for the purpose\n\nof managing data including storing, collecting,\n\nprocessing or distributing data\".\n\nMade 30 July 2025\n\n[PETRA. BAP. 100-1/1/3 KLT. 5 (8); PN(PU2)660/JLD.19]\n\n DATO' SRI HAJI FADILLAH BIN HAJI YUSOF\n\n Minister of Energy Transition and Water Transformation"}}],"pack":"my-6"};
  FT["MY-H2815"] = {"id":"MY-H2815","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 229/2026&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2026年所得税（雇用认可个人的扣除）规则","en":"INCOME TAX (DEDUCTION FOR EMPLOYMENT OF APPROVED INDIVIDUAL) RULES 2026","orig":"INCOME TAX (DEDUCTION FOR EMPLOYMENT OF APPROVED INDIVIDUAL) RULES 2026","ms":"Kaedah Cukai Pendapatan (Potongan bagi Penggajian Individu yang Diluluskan) 2026","vi":"Quy tắc về Thuế thu nhập (Khấu trừ việc sử dụng lao động là cá nhân được phê duyệt) năm 2026","th":"กฎภาษีเงินได้ (การหักค่าใช้จ่ายจากการจ้างบุคคลที่ได้รับอนุมัติ) ค.ศ. 2026","id":"Tata Tertib Pajak Penghasilan (Pengurangan atas Pekerjaan Individu yang Disetujui) Tahun 2026"},"level":"regulation","category":"04_劳工与行政法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA229","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2026","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\04_劳工与行政法\\2026_P.U.(A)229-2026_INCOME TAX (DEDUCTION FOR EMPLOYMENT OF APPROVED INDIVIDUAL) RULES 2026.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H2815-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Kaedah-kaedah ini bolehlah dinamakan Kaedah-Kaedah Cukai\n\nPendapatan (Potongan bagi Pengambilan Kerja Individu yang Diluluskan) 2026.\n\n(2) Kaedah-Kaedah ini berkuat kuasa mulai tahun taksiran 2025 hingga\n\ntahun taksiran 2027.\n\nPotongan"}},{"id":"MY-H2815-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. (1) Bagi maksud menentukan pendapatan larasan seseorang majikan yang\n\nlayak dalam tempoh asas bagi suatu tahun taksiran, suatu potongan hendaklah\n\ndibenarkan bagi suatu amaun yang bersamaan dengan lima puluh peratus daripada\n\nsaraan jenis yang dibenarkan di bawah seksyen 33 Akta yang kena dibayar olehnya\n\nkepada orang yang diluluskan.\n\n(2) Majikan yang layak hendaklah mematuhi syarat yang dikenakan\n\noleh Menteri dan pematuhan syarat itu hendaklah ditentusahkan oleh\n\nTalent Corporation Malaysia Berhad.\n\n(3) Potongan yang disebut dalam subkaedah (1) hendaklah bagi suatu tempoh\n\ntidak melebihi dua belas bulan berturut-turut.\n\n(4) Amaun potongan yang dibenarkan di bawah subkaedah (1)\n\nhendaklah sebagai tambahan kepada apa-apa potongan di bawah seksyen 33 Akta.\n\n(5) Bagi maksud kaedah ini—\n\n\"individu yang diluluskan\" mempunyai erti yang diberikan kepadanya dalam\n\nPerintah Cukai Pendapatan (Pendapatan Individu yang Diluluskan)\n\n(Wanita Kembali Bekerja Selepas Berhenti Bekerja Secara Sementara)\n\n(Pengecualian) 2026 [P.U. (A) 215/2026];\n\n\"majikan yang layak\" ertinya mana-mana orang yang mengambil kerja individu\n\nyang diluluskan tidak termasuk—\n\n(a) suatu syarikat yang dikawal sama ada secara langsung atau\n\nsecara tidak langsung oleh individu yang diluluskan itu;\n\n(b) suatu ketuanpunyaan tunggal; atau\n\n(c) saudara individu yang diluluskan itu yang merupakan ibu atau bapa\n\ntermasuklah ibu atau bapa mertua, anak termasuklah anak tiri atau\n\nanak angkat mengikut mana-mana undang-undang, abang, kakak atau adik,\n\ndatuk, nenek atau cucu atau pasangan;\n\n\"Talent Corporation Malaysia Berhad\" ertinya suatu syarikat berhad menurut\n\njaminan yang diperbadankan di bawah Akta Syarikat 2016 [Akta 777]\n\ndengan nombor pendaftarannya 919577-H dan bermastautin di Malaysia.\n\nDibuat 10 Jun 2026\n\n[MOF.TAX(S)700-2/7/2212; LHDN.AY.A 600-12/1/7(29)-399; PN(PU2)80/JLD.116]\n\nDATUK SERI AMIR HAMZAH AZIZAN\n\nMenteri Kewangan II\n\n[Akan dibentangkan di Dewan Rakyat menurut subseksyen 154(2)\n\nAkta Cukai Pendapatan 1967]\n\nINCOME TAX ACT 1967\n\nINCOME TAX (DEDUCTION FOR EMPLOYMENT OF APPROVED INDIVIDUAL)\n\nRULES 2026\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by paragraph 154(1)(b)\n\nof the Income Tax Act 1967 [Act 53] read together with paragraph 33(1)(d) of the Act,\n\nthe Minister makes the following rules:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-6"};
  FT["MY-H2816"] = {"id":"MY-H2816","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 22/2012&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":9,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2012年所得税（豁免）令","en":"INCOME TAX (EXEMPTION) ORDER 2012","orig":"INCOME TAX (EXEMPTION) ORDER 2012","ms":"Perintah Cukai Pendapatan (Pengecualian) 2012","vi":"Lệnh về Thuế thu nhập (Miễn trừ) năm 2012","th":"คำสั่งภาษีเงินได้ (การยกเว้น) ค.ศ. 2012","id":"Perintah Pajak Penghasilan (Pembebasan) Tahun 2012"},"level":"regulation","category":"02_民商事与经济法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA22","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2012","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 9 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\02_民商事与经济法\\2012_P.U.(A)22-2012_INCOME TAX (EXEMPTION) ORDER 2012.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H2816-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Cukai Pendapatan\n(Pengecualian) 2012.\n(2) Perintah ini hendaklah berkuat kuasa mulai 1 Januari 2010 hingga\n31 Disember 2014.\nTafsiran"}},{"id":"MY-H2816-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Dalam Perintah ini\n\"dilakukan\" mempunyai erti yang sama yang diberikan kepadanya dalam\nperenggan 46 dan 55 Jadual 3 Akta;\n\"kemudahan jagaan kesihatan swasta\" mempunyai erti yang sama yang\ndiberikan kepadanya di bawah seksyen 2 Akta Kemudahan dan Perkhidmatan Jagaan\nKesihatan Swasta 1998 [Akta 586];\n\"kemudahan jagaan kesihatan swasta baru\" ertinya suatu establismen\nkemudahan jagaan kesihatan swasta diluluskan yang dijalankan oleh suatu syarikat\nyang layak;\n\"Lembaga Kemajuan Pe rindustrian Malaysia\" ertinya suatu pertubuhan\nperbadanan yang ditubuhkan di bawah seksyen 3 Akta Lembaga Kemajuan\nPerindustrian Malaysia (Pemerbadanan) 1965 [Akta 397];\n\n\"Majlis Pelancongan Kesihatan Malaysia\" ertinya suatu majlis yang ditubuhkan di\nbawah Kementerian Kesihatan Malaysia bagi maksud membangunkan dan\nmempromosikan industri pelancongan kesihatan di Malaysia;\n\"pelancong kesihatan\" ertinya\n(a) seorang bukan warganegara Malaysia yang menyertai  program Malaysia\nMy Second Home;\n(b) seorang pegawai dagang bukan warganegara Malaysia yang memegang\npermit kerja Malaysia dan tanggungannya; atau\n(c) seorang bukan warganegara Malaysia yang melawat dan menerima\nkemudahan jagaan kesihatan swasta di Malaysia;\n\"perbelanjaan modal yang layak\" ertinya perbelanjaan modal yang dilakukan\noleh suatu syarikat yang layak atas suatu aset yang digunakan di Malaysia semata-mata\nbagi maksud projek yang layak \n(a) berhubung de ngan bangunan, kos pembelian atau pembinaan bangunan\nbaru yang mengikut piawaian dan bangunan itu –\n(i) telah dilesenkan dengan Kementerian Kesihatan; dan\n(ii) telah didaftarkan dengan Majlis Pelancongan Kesihatan Malaysia ;\ndan\n(b) berhubung dengan loji dan jentera, peralatan perubatan atau kemudahan\nlain yang digunakan bagi maksud projek yang layak itu hendaklah\nditentusahkan oleh Kementerian Kesihatan dan diluluskan oleh Menteri:\nDengan syarat bahawa perbelanjaan modal yang layak itu tidak termasuk\nperbelanjaan modal yang dilakukan atas bangunan yang dig unakan sebagai tempat\n\nkediaman yang disediakan keseluruhannya atau sebahagiannya untuk kegunaan\npengarah atau individu yang menjadi anggota pihak pengurusan atau pentadbiran, atau\npekerja, syarikat yang layak;\n\"projek pembesaran, pemodenan atau pembaharuan\" ertinya suatu projek yang\ndijalankan oleh suatu syarikat yang layak dalam membesarkan, memodenkan atau\nmembaharui perniagaan kemudahan jagaan kesihatan swasta nya sedia ada ,\ntermasuklah perkhidmatan infrastruktur dan fungsian, dan perniagaan itu\n(a) tidak pernah diberikan apa-apa pengecualian di bawah Perintah ini; dan\n(b) melibatkan pelaburan baru;\n\"projek yang layak \" ertinya\n(a) mana-mana perniagaan kemudahan jagaan kesihatan swasta baru; atau\n(b) mana-mana projek bagi pembesaran, pemodenan atau pembaharuan\nperniagaan kemudahan jagaan kesihatan swasta yang sedia ada,\nyang diluluskan oleh Kementerian Kesihatan dan ditentusahkan oleh Majlis\nPelancongan Kesihatan Malaysia; dan\n\"syarikat yang layak\" ertinya suatu syarikat yang\n(a) diperbadankan di bawah Akta Syarikat 1965 [Akta 125];\n(b) bermastautin di Malaysia; dan\n(c) melaksanakan projek yang layak.\nPemakaian"}},{"id":"MY-H2816-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"ms":"3. Perintah ini hendaklah terpakai bagi\n\n(a) syarikat yang layak yang belum memulakan perniagaan nya atau\nperniagaan jagaan kesihatan swasta barunya pada tarikh permohonan\ndikemukakan kepada Lembaga Pembangunan Pe rindustrian Malaysia;\natau\n(b) syarikat yang layak yang belum melakukan apa -apa perbelanjaan yang\nlayak ke atas projek pembesaran, pemodenan atau pembaharuan pada\ntarikh permohonan dikemukakan kepada Lembaga Pembangunan\nPerindustrian Malaysia; dan\n(c) permohonan yang dibuat oleh s yarikat yang layak kepada Lembaga\nPembangunan Perindustrian Malaysia pada atau selepas 1 Januari 2010\ntetapi tidak lewat dari 31 Disember 2014.\nPengecualian"}},{"id":"MY-H2816-A4","no":4,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 4"},"text":{"ms":"4. (1) Menteri mengecualikan suatu syarikat yang layak dalam tempoh asas bagi\nsuatu tahun taksiran daripada pembayaran cukai pendapatan berkenaan dengan\npendapatan berkanun yang diperoleh daripada suatu projek yang layak yang\nbersamaan dengan am aun elaun sebagaimana yang ditentukan dalam\nsubperenggan (2).\n(2) Amaun elaun yang disebut dalam subperengg an (1) hendaklah seratus\nperatus daripada perbelanjaan modal yang layak yang dilakukan dalam tempoh asas\nbagi suatu tahun taksiran dalam tempoh lima tahun.\n(3) Tarikh permulaan kuat kuasa bagi tempoh yang disebut dalam\nsubperenggan (2) hendaklah ditent ukan oleh Lembaga Pembangunan Perindustrian\nMalaysia dan, berhubung dengan\n(a) suatu perniagaan jagaan kesihatan swasta baru, pada tarikh\nperbelanjaan modal yang layak yang pertama telah dilakukan dan\ntarikh itu tidak boleh lebih awal dari 1 Januari 2010 atau\nhendaklah tiga tahun dari tarikh kelulusan sebagai perniagaan\n\nkemudahan jagaan kesihatan swasta bagi pelancongan kesihatan ,\nmengikut mana-mana yang terkemudian; atau\n(b) suatu projek pembesaran, pemodenan atau pembaharuan, pada\ntarikh perbelanjaan modal yang layak yang pertama dilakukan dan\ntarikh itu tidak boleh lebih awal dari t arikh permohonan diterima\noleh Lembaga Pembangunan Perindustrian Malaysia.\n(4) Tiada apa -apa jua dalam subperenggan (1) boleh melepaskan atau\ndisifatkan telah melepaskan syarikat yang layak itu daripada mematuhi apa -apa\nkehendak bagi mengemukakan apa -apa penyata atau penyata akaun atau memberikan\napa-apa maklumat lain di bawah peruntukan Akta.\nPendapatan berkanun"}},{"id":"MY-H2816-A5","no":5,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 5"},"text":{"ms":"5. (1) Pendapatan berkanun yang disebut dalam subperenggan 4(1) dalam\ntempoh asas untuk setiap tempoh pengecualian hendaklah ditentukan selepas\nmemotong elaun yang digolongkan dibuat di bawah Jadual 3 Akta walaupun tiada\ntuntutan bagi elaun itu telah dibuat:\nDengan syarat bahawa jika suatu aset digunakan bagi maksud projek yang layak,\ndigunakan juga bagi maksud suatu perniagaan selain projek yang layak itu, maka elaun\nyang digolongkan dibuat di bawah Jadual 3 Akta hendaklah dipotong sebagaimana yang\nmunasabah dengan mengambil kira takat aset itu digunakan bagi maksud proje k yang\nlayak itu.\n(2) Amaun elaun yang dikecualikan yang disebut dalam subperenggan 4(1)\nhendaklah bersamaan dengan amaun pendapatan berkanun bagi setiap tahun taksiran.\n(3) Jika oleh sebab ketiadaan atau ket idakcukupan pendapatan berkanun\npengecualian t idak boleh diberikan atau tidak boleh diberikan sepenuhnya kepada\namaun sebagaimana yang ditentukan yang syarikat yang layak itu berhak di bawah\nsubperenggan 4(1) bagi tahun taksiran itu, maka sekian banyak daripada amaun itu\nyang tidak boleh dikecualik an bagi tahun taksiran itu hendaklah dikecualikan bagi\n\ntahun taksiran pertama yang berikutnya bagi tempoh asas yang terdapat pendapatan\nberkanun daripada projek yang layak itu, dan bagi tahun taksiran berikutnya\nsehinggalah keseluruhan amaun yang atasnya ia berhak dikecualikan.\nPenentuan perbelanjaan modal yang layak"}},{"id":"MY-H2816-A6","no":6,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 6"},"text":{"ms":"6. (1) Bagi maksud P erintah ini, suatu syarikat yang layak yang melakukan\nsuatu perbelanjaan yang layak hanya layak untuk membuat tuntutan bagi elaun modal\ndi bawah Jadual 3 kepada Akta jika p erbelanjaan yang layak itu merupakan suatu\nperbelanjaan modal yang layak di bawah Jadual itu.\n(2) Jika perbelanjaan modal yang laya k bagi suatu aset dilakukan oleh suatu\nsyarikat yang layak bagi maksud projek yang layak dan aset itu dilupuskan pada bila -\nbila masa dalam masa lima tahun dari tarikh perolehan aset, amaun pendapatan yang\ndikecualikan berkenaan dengan elaun aset itu disifatkan tidak dikecualikan kepada\nsyarikat itu yang sepatutnya syarikat itu berhak.\nPenarikan balik pengecualian cukai"}},{"id":"MY-H2816-A7","no":7,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 7"},"text":{"ms":"7. Menteri boleh menarik balik pengecualian cukai atas pendapatan berkanun bagi\nprojek yang layak yang disebut dalam subperenggan 4(1) jika suatu syarikat yang layak\nitu gagal mematuhi syarat sebagaimana yang diluluskan oleh Menteri.\nAkaun berasingan"}},{"id":"MY-H2816-A8","no":8,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 8"},"text":{"ms":"8. Suatu syarikat yang layak hendaklah menyenggara suatu akaun berasingan bagi\npendapatan yang diperoleh daripada projek yang layak dalam tempoh asas bagi setiap\ntahun taksiran sehingga projek yang layak itu mendapat keseluruhan elaun atau\nelaun-elaun yang syarikat itu berhak mendapatnya.\nKetidakpakaian"}},{"id":"MY-H2816-A9","no":9,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 9"},"text":{"ms":"9. Perintah ini tidak terpakai bagi suatu syarikat yang layak dalam tempoh asas\nbagi suatu tahun taksiran jika syarikat yang layak itu bagi tahun taksiran itu telah \n(a) membuat suatu tuntutan bagi elaun pelaburan semula di bawah Jadual 7A\natau elaun pelaburan di bawah Jadual 7B Akta;\n\n(b) diberikan apa -apa insentif di bawah Akta Penggalakan Perindustrian\n1986 [Akta 327];\n(c) diberikan suatu pengecualian di bawah perenggan 127(3)( b) atau\nsubseksyen 127(3A) Akta: atau\n(d) membuat tuntutan bagi suatu potongan di bawah mana -mana Kaedah\nyang dibuat di bawah seksyen 154 Akta kecuali elaun di bawah Jadual 3\nAkta.\nDibuat 27 Disember 2011\n[Perb. 0.3865/G/4 JLD. 15(S.K.1)(30); LHDN. 01/35/(S)/42/51/82-71; PN(PU2)80/LXII]\nDATO' SERI AHMAD HUSNI MOHAMAD HANADZLAH\nMenteri Kewangan Kedua\n[Akan dibentangkan di Dewan Rakyat menurut subseksyen 127(4) Akta Cukai\nPendapatan 1967]\n\nINCOME TAX ACT 1967\nINCOME TAX (EXEMPTION) ORDER 2012\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by paragraph 127(3)(b) of the Income Tax Act 1967\n[Act 53], the Minister makes the following order:\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-6"};
  FT["MY-H2817"] = {"id":"MY-H2817","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 22/2013&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":4,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2013年道路交通（禁止驾驶货车）规则","en":"ROAD TRAFFIC (PROHIBITION ON DRIVING OF GOODS VEHICLES) RULES 2013","orig":"ROAD TRAFFIC (PROHIBITION ON DRIVING OF GOODS VEHICLES) RULES 2013","ms":"Kaedah Lalu Lintas Jalan (Larangan Memandu Kenderaan Barang) 2013","vi":"Quy tắc về Lưu thông đường bộ (Cấm điều khiển xe chở hàng) năm 2013","th":"กฎการจราจรทางถนน (การห้ามขับรถบรรทุกสินค้า) ค.ศ. 2013","id":"Tata Tertib Lalu Lintas Jalan (Larangan Mengemudikan Kendaraan Barang) Tahun 2013"},"level":"regulation","category":"04_劳工与行政法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA22","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2013","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 4 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\04_劳工与行政法\\2013_P.U.(A)22-2013_ROAD TRAFFIC (PROHIBITION ON DRIVING OF GOODS VEHICLES) RULES 2013.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H2817-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Kaedah-kaedah ini bolehlah dinamakan Kaedah-Kaedah Lalu Lintas\n\nJalan (Larangan Pemanduan Kenderaan Barangan) 2013.\n\n(2) Kaedah-Kaedah ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 8 Februari 2013.\n\nTafsiran"}},{"id":"MY-H2817-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Dalam Kaedah-Kaedah ini, \"kenderaan barangan\" ertinya mana-mana jenis\n\nkenderaan yang diperihalkan dalam Jadual Pertama dan Kedua.\n\nLarangan"}},{"id":"MY-H2817-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"ms":"3. Pemanduan mana-mana kenderaan barangan yang dinyatakan dalam\n\nruang (1) Jadual Pertama di mana-mana bahagian mana-mana jalan dilarang pada 8, 9,\n\n16 dan 17 Februari 2013 bagi masa yang dinyatakan dalam ruang (2) Jadual Pertama.\n\nPengecualian"}},{"id":"MY-H2817-A4","no":4,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 4"},"text":{"ms":"4. (1) Kenderaan barangan yang dinyatakan dalam Jadual Kedua dikecualikan\n\ndaripada kaedah 3.\n\n (2) Walau apa pun kaedah 3 dan subkaedah (1), Menteri boleh mengecualikan\n\nmana-mana kenderaan barangan daripada mana-mana peruntukan Kaedah-Kaedah ini\n\ntertakluk kepada apa-apa syarat yang ditentukan olehnya.\n\nJADUAL PERTAMA\n\n [Kaedah 3]\n\nKENDERAAN BARANGAN YANG DILARANG\n\n(1)\n\nJenis Kenderaan Barangan\n\n(a) Lori balak dan lori yang membawa\n\nbahan binaan seperti simen, besi,\n\nkeluli, batu, pasir dan tanah\n\n(b) Jentera berat\n\n(c) Lori kontena/kargo yang\n\nmembawa barang-barang\n\nelektronik/elektrik dan lori\n\nkontena/kargo yang berulang-alik\n\ndi antara pelabuhan dengan\n\nlapangan terbang yang tidak\n\nberada di tempat yang sama\n\n(d) Lori pembancuh simen, kren\n\nbergerak dan lori jongket yang\n\nmembawa batu, pasir dan tanah\n\n(2)\n\nMasa Larangan\n\nsepanjang masa\n\nsepanjang masa\n\ndari 12.00 tengah malam hingga\n\n6.00 pagi\n\n(i) sepanjang masa; atau\n\n(ii) dari 6.00 petang hingga 6.00 pagi\n\ndi kawasan Lembah Kelang\n\n(70 km dari pusat bandar) dan\n\ndi kawasan Johor Bahru, Ipoh dan\n\nKuantan (50 km dari pusat\n\nbandar) tertakluk kepada had\n\nmasa operasi yang dibenarkan\n\ndi jalan tertentu\n\nJADUAL KEDUA\n\n[Subkaedah 4(1)]\n\nKENDERAAN BARANGAN YANG DIKECUALIKAN\n\nLori membawa gas dan kimia untuk bekalan perubatan dan industri kimia\n\nLori kontena/kargo yang berulang-alik dari lapangan terbang dan ke lapangan\n\nterbang\n\nLori kontena/kargo yang berulang-alik di antara pelabuhan dengan lapangan\n\nterbang yang berada di tempat yang sama\n\nLori kargo membawa barang keperluan harian (makanan dan minuman dari\n\nkilang, buah-buahan, sayur-sayuran, bahan-bahan mentah, barang runcit, akhbar\n\ndan ternakan) atau lori tiada muatan yang dalam perjalanan pulang\n\nLori yang mengangkut sampah dan kumbahan\n\nKenderaan barangan dengan berat kenderaan kasar 5,000 kg dan ke bawah\n\nLori kontena/kargo yang berulang-alik di antara terminal di pelabuhan yang\n\nberada di tempat yang sama\n\nLori kontena/kargo yang berulang-alik dari pelabuhan ke gudang dan sebaliknya,\n\nserta di sekitar kawasan perindustrian yang berhampiran dengan pelabuhan\n\nLori tanker yang membawa bahan bakar (petroleum/diesel, gas dan LPG)\n\nLori dan jentera berat yang terlibat dalam operasi kecemasan dan menyelamat\n\nDibuat 30 Januari 2013\n\n[KP/PUU/0.440/W/BD/9 Jld.18; PN(PU2)460/LXIX]\n\n DATO' SERI KONG CHO HA\n\n Menteri Pengangkutan\n\nROAD TRANSPORT ACT 1987\n\nROAD TRAFFIC (PROHIBITION ON DRIVING OF GOODS VEHICLES) RULES 2013\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by paragraph 88(1)(c) of the Road Transport\n\nAct 1987 [Act 333], the Minister, after consultation with the Minister charged with the\n\nresponsibility for works, makes the following rules:\n\nCitation and commencement\n\n1. (1) These rules may be cited as the Road Traffic (Prohibition on Driving of\n\nGoods Vehicles) Rules 2013.\n\n (2) These Rules come into operation on 8 February 2013.\n\nInterpretation\n\n2. In these Rules, \"goods vehicles\" means any type of vehicles as described in the\n\nFirst and Second Schedules.\n\nProhibition\n\n3. The driving of any goods vehicles specified in column (1) of the First Schedule on\n\nany part of any road is prohibited on 8, 9, 16 and 17 February 2013 for the time as\n\nspecified in column (2) of the First Schedule.\n\nExemption\n\n4. (1) The goods vehicles specified in the Second Schedule are exempted from\n\nrule 3.\n\n (2) Notwithstanding rule 3 and subrule (1), the Minister may exempt any\n\ngoods vehicles from any provisions of these Rules subject to such conditions as he may\n\ndetermine.\n\nFIRST SCHEDULE\n\n[Rule 3]\n\nPROHIBITED GOODS VEHICLES\n\n(1)\n\nTypes of Goods Vehicles\n\n(a) Timber lorry and lorry\n\ntransporting construction\n\nmaterials such as cement, iron,\n\nsteel, stones, sand and earth\n\n(b) Heavy machinery\n\n(c) Container/cargo lorry transporting\n\nelectronic/electrical goods and\n\ncontainer/cargo lorry plying\n\nbetween ports and airports which\n\nare not in the same locality\n\n(d) Cement mixer lorry, mobile cranes\n\nand tipper lorry transporting\n\nstones, sand and earth\n\n(2)\n\nTime of Prohibition\n\nat all times\n\nat all times\n\nfrom 12.00 a.m. to 6.00 a.m.\n\n(i) at all times; or\n\n(ii) from 6.00 p.m. to 6.00 a.m. in the\n\narea of Klang Valley (70 km from\n\ncity centre) and in the area of\n\nJohor Bahru, Ipoh and Kuantan\n\n(50 km from city centre) subject\n\nto the limit of the operation time\n\nallowed on certain road\n\nSECOND SCHEDULE\n\n[Subrule 4(1)]\n\nEXEMPTED GOODS VEHICLES\n\nLorry transporting gas and chemicals for medical and chemical industry supplies\n\nContainer/cargo lorry plying from airport and to airport\n\nContainer/cargo lorry plying between ports and airports which are in the same\n\nlocality\n\nCargo lorry transporting daily consumption goods (food and beverages from the\n\nfactory, fruits, vegetables, raw materials, groceries, newspapers and livestock) or\n\nunladen lorry on the return journey\n\nLorry transporting garbage and sewage\n\nGoods vehicle with gross vehicle weight 5,000 kg and below\n\nContainer/cargo lorry plying between terminals at the port in the same locality\n\nContainer/cargo lorry plying from port to warehouse and vice versa, also around\n\nthe industrial area near the port\n\nTanker lorry transporting fuel (petroleum/diesel, gas and LPG)\n\nLorry and heavy machinery involved in providing emergency and rescue operation\n\nMade 30 January 2013\n\n[KP/PUU/0.440/W/BD/9 Jld.18; PN(PU2)460/LXIX]\n\n DATO' SERI KONG CHO HA\n\n Minister of Transport"}}],"pack":"my-6"};
