  FT["MY-H2880"] = {"id":"MY-H2880","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 233/2011&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2011年砂拉越州（1946年二手货商法的延伸与修改）令","en":"STATE OF SARAWAK (EXTENSION AND MODIFICATION OF THE SECOND-HAND DEALERS ACT 1946) ORDER 2011","orig":"STATE OF SARAWAK (EXTENSION AND MODIFICATION OF THE SECOND-HAND DEALERS ACT 1946) ORDER 2011","ms":"Perintah Negeri Sarawak (Pelanjutan dan Pengubahsuaian Akta Peniaga Barang Terpakai 1946) 2011","vi":"Lệnh về Bang Sarawak (Mở rộng và sửa đổi Luật Người buôn bán hàng cũ 1946) năm 2011","th":"คำสั่งรัฐซาราวัก (การขยายใช้และการแก้ไขพระราชบัญญัติผู้ค้าของมือสอง ค.ศ. 1946) ค.ศ. 2011","id":"Perintah Negara Bagian Sarawak (Perluasan dan Modifikasi Undang-Undang Pedagang Barang Bekas 1946) Tahun 2011"},"level":"regulation","category":"05_其他及未分类","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA233","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2011","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\05_其他及未分类\\2011_P.U.(A)233-2011_STATE OF SARAWAK (EXTENSION AND MODIFICATION OF THE SECOND-HAND DEALERS ACT 1946) ORDER 2011.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H2880-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Negeri Sarawak (Peluasan\n\ndan Ubah Suaian Akta Peniaga Sekendhend 1946) 2011.\n\n(2) Perintah ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 12 Julai 2011.\n\nPeluasan dan ubah suaian Akta ke Negeri Sarawak"}},{"id":"MY-H2880-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. (1) Akta Peniaga Sekendhend 1946 [Akta 189], yang disebut \"Akta yang\n\ndipeluaskan\" dalam Perintah ini, adalah dipeluaskan ke Negeri Sarawak.\n\n(2) Dalam pemakaiannya bagi Negeri Sarawak, Akta yang dipeluaskan diubah\n\nsuai sebagaimana yang dinyatakan dalam Jadual.\n\nJADUAL\n\nNEGERI SARAWAK\n\n[Subperenggan 2(2)]\n\nPeruntukan Akta Peniaga\n\nSekendhend 1946\n\nUbah suaian\n\nKesemuanya (kecuali jika\n\ndiperuntukkan selainnya\n\nsecara nyata kemudian\n\ndaripada ini)\n\nSebutan mengenai \"Chief Police Officer\"\n\nhendaklah ditafsirkan sebagai sebutan\n\nmengenai \"Commissioner of Police\".\n\nSeksyen 1 Dalam subseksyen (2), gantikan perkataan\n\n\"only in Peninsular Malaysia\" dengan\n\nperkataan \"to Peninsular Malaysia and the\n\nState of Sarawak\".\n\nSeksyen 7 Dalam subseksyen (2), gantikan perkataan\n\n\", Chinese and Tamil languages\" dengan\n\nperkataan \"language\".\n\nDibuat 23 Jun 2011\n\n[KDN(S)/9/836 Klt.4(67); PN(PU2)112/IV]\n\nDengan Titah Perintah,\n\nTAN SRI MOHD. SIDEK BIN HAJI HASSAN\n\nSetiausaha Jemaah Menteri\n\n[Akan dibentangkan di Dewan Rakyat dan Dewan Negara menurut subseksyen 74(9)\n\nAkta Malaysia]\n\nMALAYSIA ACT\n\nSTATE OF SARAWAK (EXTENSION AND MODIFICATION OF THE\n\nSECOND-HAND DEALERS ACT 1946) ORDER 2011\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by section 74 of the Malaysia Act [Act 26/1963], the\n\nYang di-Pertuan Agong makes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement\n\n1. (1) This order may be cited as the State of Sarawak (Extension and\n\nModification of the Second-hand Dealers Act 1946) Order 2011.\n\n(2) This Order comes into operation on 12 July 2011.\n\nExtension and modification of the Act to the State of Sarawak\n\n2. (1) The Second-hand Dealers Act 1946 [Act 189], which is referred to as the\n\n\"extended Act\" in this Order, is extended to the State of Sarawak.\n\n(2) In its application to the State of Sarawak, the extended Act is modified in\n\nthe manner set out in the Schedule.\n\nSCHEDULE\n\nTHE STATE OF SARAWAK\n\n[Subparagraph 2(2)]\n\nProvisions of the\n\nSecond-hand Dealers Act 1946\n\nModification\n\nThe whole (except where\n\nit is expressly otherwise\n\nprovided hereinafter)\n\nReferences to \"Chief Police Officer\" shall\n\nbe construed as references to\n\n\"Commissioner of Police\".\n\nSection 1 In subsection (2), substitute for the words\n\n\"only in Peninsular Malaysia\" the words\n\n\"to Peninsular Malaysia and the State of\n\nSarawak\".\n\nSection 7 In subsection (2), substitute for the words\n\n\", Chinese and Tamil languages\" the word\n\n\"language\".\n\nMade 23 June 2011\n\n[KDN(S)/9/836 Klt.4(67); PN(PU2)112/IV]\n\nBy Command,\n\nTAN SRI MOHD. SIDEK BIN HAJI HASSAN\n\nSecretary to the Cabinet\n\n[To be laid before Dewan Rakyat and Dewan Negara pursuant to subsection 74(9) of the\n\nMalaysia Act]"}}],"pack":"my-6"};
  FT["MY-H2881"] = {"id":"MY-H2881","coverage":"full","language":"en","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 233/2012&status=AMENDMENT","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":21,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2012年联邦法院规则（修正）","en":"RULES OF THE FEDERAL COURT (AMENDMENT) 2012","orig":"RULES OF THE FEDERAL COURT (AMENDMENT) 2012","vi":"Quy tắc Tòa án Liên bang (Sửa đổi) năm 2012","th":"ข้อบังคับศาลกลาง (การแก้ไข) ค.ศ. 2012","id":"Tata Tertib Mahkamah Persekutuan (Perubahan) Tahun 2012","ms":"Kaedah Mahkamah Persekutuan (Pindaan) 2012"},"level":"regulation","category":"01_宪法与基础法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA233","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2012","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 21 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\01_宪法与基础法\\2012_P.U.(A)233-2012_RULES OF THE FEDERAL COURT (AMENDMENT) 2012.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H2881-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"en":"1. This action be consolidated with action(s) in Suit No .................of …..., and\nSuit No ................ of ............."}},{"id":"MY-H2881-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"en":"2. The petitioner have leave to amend the petition by .................................... ....\nand that the service of the petition and the respondent's appearance do stand,\nand that the costs incurred and thrown away by the amendment be the\nrespondent's in any event."}},{"id":"MY-H2881-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"en":"3. The petitioner have leave to amend the petition as shown in the\ndocument served herewith and to re -serve the amended petition in .... ....... days,\nwith leave to the respondent to re -serve an amended defence (if so advised) in\n......... days thereafter, (and with leave to the petitioner to re -serve an amended\nreply (if so advis ed) in ...... days thereafter) and that the costs incurred and\nthrown away by the amendments be the respondent's in any event."}},{"id":"MY-H2881-A4","no":4,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 4"},"text":{"en":"4. The respondent have leave to amend the defence as shown in (the\ndocument served with) the respondent's notice under this sum mons and to re -\nserve the amended defence in ...... days (or with leave to the petitioner to re -\nserve an amended reply (if so advised) in ...... days thereafter) and that the costs\nof and the costs thrown away as the result of the amendments be the\npetitioner's in any event."}},{"id":"MY-H2881-A5","no":5,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 5"},"text":{"en":"5. The petitioner serve on the respondent within ...... days the further and\nbetter particulars of the petition specified in (the document served with) the\nrespondent's notice under this summons."}},{"id":"MY-H2881-A6","no":6,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 6"},"text":{"en":"6. The respondent serve on the petiti oner within ...... days the further and\n\nbetter particulars of the defence specified in the document served herewith."}},{"id":"MY-H2881-A7","no":7,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 7"},"text":{"en":"7. The petitioner serve on the respondent within ...... days the further and\nbetter particulars of the reply specified in (the document s erved with) the\nrespondent's notice under this summons."}},{"id":"MY-H2881-A8","no":8,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 8"},"text":{"en":"8. The petitioner give security for the respondent's costs to the satisfaction\nof the Registrar in the sum of ............................. on the ground ..............................and\nthat in the meantime all further proceedings be stayed."}},{"id":"MY-H2881-A9","no":9,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 9"},"text":{"en":"9. The petitioner within .. .... days serve on the respondent a list of\ndocuments (and file an affidavit verifying such list) (limited to the documents\nrelating to the\n(period from ............... to ...............)\n(issues raised in paras .............................. of the petition and paras .............................. of\nthe defence)\n(issues of ......................................................................................................))"}},{"id":"MY-H2881-A10","no":10,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 10"},"text":{"en":"10. The respondent within ...... days serve the petitioner with a list of\ndocuments (and file an affidavit verifying such list) (limited to documents\nrelating to the\n(period from ............... to ...............)\n(issues raised in paras ................ .................. of the petition and paras\n..............................of the defence)\n(issues of .....................................................................................................))"}},{"id":"MY-H2881-A11","no":11,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 11"},"text":{"en":"11. There be inspection of documents within .... .......................... days of the\nservice of the lists (filing of the affidavits)."}},{"id":"MY-H2881-A12","no":12,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 12"},"text":{"en":"12. The petitioner have leave to serve on the respondent the interrogatories\nshown in the document served herewith, and that the respondent answer the\ninterrogatories on affidavit within ..................... days."}},{"id":"MY-H2881-A13","no":13,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 13"},"text":{"en":"13. The respondent have leave to serve on the petitioner the interrogatories\nshown in the document served with the respondent's notice under this\nsummons, and that the petitioner answer the interrogatories on affidavit within\n.............. days."}},{"id":"MY-H2881-A14","no":14,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 14"},"text":{"en":"14. The petitioner (or respondent) (retain and preserve pending the trial of\nthe action) (upon ... ........ days notice to give inspection of) (the subject matter of\nthe action, to the respondent (or petitioner) a nd to his legal advisers (and\nexperts))."}},{"id":"MY-H2881-A15","no":15,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 15"},"text":{"en":"15. The statements in .............................. be admissible in evidence at the trial\nwithout calling as a witness the maker of the statements (and, if a copy of that\ndocument certified by .................. ................ to be a true copy is produced, without\nproduction of the original document)."}},{"id":"MY-H2881-A16","no":16,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 16"},"text":{"en":"16. An affidavit of .............................. (in the form of the draft affidavit (served\nherewith) (with the respondent's notice under this summons)) (to be served\nwithin …….... days) be admissible in evidence at the trial."}},{"id":"MY-H2881-A17","no":17,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 17"},"text":{"en":"17. Evidence of the following fact(s), namely, .............................. be received at\nthe trial by statement on oath of information and belief (by the production of\nthe following documents or entries in books or copy documents or copy entries\nin books, namely, ..............................)."}},{"id":"MY-H2881-A18","no":18,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 18"},"text":{"en":"18. It be recorded that the parties ((petitioner) (respondent) refuses to\nadmit for the purposes of this action that .................... .......... the truth of the\nstatements in the document served (herewith) with the respondent's notice\nunder this summons."}},{"id":"MY-H2881-A19","no":19,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 19"},"text":{"en":"19. Trial. (Estimated length and number of witnesses) ................ To be set\ndown within ... ............ days (and to be tried i mmediately after the action in Suit\n\nNo .............................. of 20..............)."}},{"id":"MY-H2881-A20","no":20,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 20"},"text":{"en":"20. The costs of this application be costs in the cause.\nDated the .............. day of ..............., 20......\nEntered No .............................. 20......\nClerk\n(Seal)\n.....................................\nRegistrar\nTo the respondent(s) and to his (their) solicitors.\nThis summons is taken out by .............................. of .............................., solicitors for the\npetitioner.\nFORM 2B\n(rule 21C)\nNOTICE UNDER SUMMONS FOR DIRECTIONS\n(Title as in action)\nTake notice that the abovenamed respondent intends to apply at the hearing of\nthe summons for directions herein for an order that (insert directions required\n- see Form 2A).\nDated the ....... day of ..............., 20......\n.....................................\nSolicitors for the\n.....................................\nRegistrar\nEntered No. ..............................of 20......\nClerk\n\nThis summons is taken out by ......... ..................................................................... solicitor for\n..........................................................\nTo\n...................................................................................................................\"\nDibuat 31 Julai 2012\n[JK/MP 322 Jld. 11; PN(PU2)153/XIV]\nTUN ARIFIN BIN ZAKARIA\nKetua Hakim Negara, Malaysia\nTAN SRI ABDUL GANI PATAIL\nPeguam Negara, Malaysia\nTAN SRI DATO' SERI MD. RAUS BIN SHARIF\nPresiden Mahkamah Rayuan, Malaysia\nTAN SRI DATO' SERI ZULKEFLI BIN AHMAD MAKINUDIN\nHakim Besar Mahkamah Tinggi di Malaya\nTAN SRI DATUK SERI PANGLIMA RICHARD MALANJUM\nHakim Besar Mahkamah Tinggi di Sabah dan Sarawak\nDATO' AHMAD BIN HJ. MAAROP\nHakim Mahkamah Persekutuan\nDATUK ZAHARAH BINTI IBRAHIM\nHakim Mahkamah Rayuan\n\nDATUK DR. HAJI HAMID SULTAN BIN ABU BACKER\nHakim Mahkamah Tinggi di Malaya\nDATUK DAVID WONG DAK WAH\nHakim Mahkamah Tinggi di Sabah dan Sarawak\nPUAN AL-BAISHAH BINTI HJ. ABD. MANAN\nHakim Kanan Mahkamah Sesyen, Kuala Lumpur\nENCIK LIM CHEE WEE\nPeguam bela, Semenanjung Malaysia\nENCIK G.B.B. NANDY @ GAANESH\nPeguam bela, Sabah\nENCIK KHAIRIL AZMI BIN MOHD HASBIE\nPeguam bela, Sarawak\n[Akan dibentangkan di Dewan Rakyat menurut subseksyen 17(5) Akta Mahkamah\nKehakiman 1964]\n\nCOURTS OF JUDICATURE ACT 1964\nRULES OF THE FEDERAL COURT (AMENDMENT) 2012\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by section 17 of the Courts of Judicature Act 1964 [ Act 91]\nand with the consent of the Chief Justice, the Rules Committee makesthe following rules:\nCitation and commencement\n1. (1) These rules may be cited as the Rules of the Federal Court (Amendment)\n(2) These Rules come into operation on 1 August 2012.\nAmendment of rule 3\n2. The Rules of the Federal Court 1995 [ P.U. (A) 376/1995 ], which are referred to as the\n\"principal Rules\" in these Rules, are amended by substituting for rule 3 the following rule:\n\"Application of the\nRules of Court 2012.\netc.\nP.U. (A) 524/94.\nP.U. (A) 205/2012.\n3. Where no other provision is made by any written\nlaw or by these Rules, the procedure and practice in the\nRules of Court of Appeal 1994 and the Rules of Court 2012\nshall apply mutatis mutandis.\".\nAmendment of rule 16\n3. The principal Rules are amended by substituting for rule 16 the following rule:\n\"Mode of entering\nappearance.\nP.U. (A) 205/2012\n16. Appearance to a petition may be entered in\naccordance with the provisions of Order 12 of the Rules of\nCourt 2012.\nSubstitution of rule 20\n4. The principal Rules are amended by substituting for rule 20 the following rule:\n\"Filing of the\nsummons for\ndirections.\n20. (1) The Petitioner, within fourteen days after the\nfilling of the written statement of defence , takes out a\nsummons in Form 2A (in these Rules referred to as a\n\nsummons for directions) returnable in not less than\nfourteen days.\n(2) If the petitioner does not take out a summons\nfor directions in accordance with the foregoing provisions\nof this rule, the respondent or any respondent may do so or\napply for an order to dismiss the action.\n(3) On an application by a respondent to dismiss\nthe action under paragraph (2) the Court may either\ndismiss the action on such terms as may be just or deal with\nthe application as if it were a summons for directions.\n(4) In the case of an action which is proceeding\nonly as respects a counterclaim, references in this rule to\nthe petitioner and respondent shall be construed\nrespectively as references to the party making the\ncounterclaim and the respondent to the counterclaim.\".\nNew rule 21A, 21B and 21C\n5. The principal Rules are amended by inserting after rule 21 the following rules:\n\"Duty to consider all\nmatters."}},{"id":"MY-H2881-A21","no":21,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 21"},"text":{"en":"21A. (1) When the summons for directions first comes\nto be heard, the Court shall consider whether\n(a) it is possible to deal the n with all the\nmatters which, by the subsequent rules\nof this Order, are required to be\nconsidered on the hearing of the\nsummons for directions; or\n(b) it is expedient to adjourn the\nconsideration of all or any of those\n\nmatters until a later stage.\n(2) If, when the summons for directions first\ncomes to be heard , the Court considers that it is possible to\ndeal then with all the said matters, it shall deal with them\nforthwith and shall endeavo ur to secure that all other\nmatters which must or can be dealt with on interlocutory\napplications and have not already been dealt with are also\nthen dealt with.\n(3) If, when the summons for directions first\ncomes to be heard , the Court considers that it is expedient\nto adjourn the consideration of all or any of the matt ers\nwhich, by the subsequent rules of this Order, are required\nto be considered on the hearing of the summons, the Court\nshall deal forthwith with such of those matters as it\nconsiders can conveniently be dealt with forthwith and\nadjourn the consideration of the remaining matters and\nshall endeavour to secure that all other matters which must\nor can be dealt with on interlocutory applications and have\nnot already been dealt with are dealt with either then or at\na resumed hearing of the summons for directions.\n(4) If the hearing of the summons for directions\nis adjourned without a day being fixed for the resumed\nhearing thereof, any party may restore it to the list on two\ndays' notice to the other parties.\nDuty to give all\ninformation at\nhearing.\n21B. (1) Subject to paragraph (3), no affidavit shall be\nused on the hearing of the summons for directions except\nby the leave or direction of the Court, but, subject to\nparagraph (5), it shall be the duty of the parties to the\n\naction and their solicitors to give all such information and\nproduce all such documents on any hearing of the summons\nas the Court may reasonably require for the purposes of\nenabling it properly to deal with the summons.\n(2) The Court may, if it appears proper so to do\nin the circumstances , authorize any such information or\ndocuments to be given or produced to the Court without\nbeing disclosed to the other parties but, in the absence of\nsuch authority, any information or document given or\nproduced under this paragraph shall be given or prod uced\nto all the parties present or represented on the hearing of\nthe summons as well as to the Court.\n(3) No leave shall be required by virtue of\nparagraph (1) for the use of an affidavit by any party on the\nhearing of the summons for directions in conne ction with\nany application thereat for any order if, under any of these\nrules, an application for such an order is required to be\nsupported by an affidavit.\n(4) If the Court on any hearing of the summons\nfor directions requires a party to the action or h is solicitor\nor counsel to give any information or produce any\ndocument and that information or document is not given or\nproduced, then, subject to paragraph (5), the Court may\n(a) cause the facts to be recorded in the\norder with a view to such special order ,\nif any, as to costs as may be just being\nmade at the trial; or\n(b) if it appears to the Court to be just so to\n\ndo, order the whole or any part of the\npleadings of the party concerned to be\nstruck out, if the party is plaintiff or the\nclaimant under a counte rclaim, order\nthe action or counterclaim to be\ndismissed on such terms as may be just.\n(5) Notwithstanding anything in the foregoing\nprovisions of this rule, no information or documents which\nare privileged from disclosure shall be required to be given\nor produced under this rule by or by the solicitors of any\nparty otherwise than with the consent of that party.\nDuty to make all\ninterlocutory\napplications on\nsummons for\ndirections.\n21C. (1) Any party to whom the summons for\ndirections is addressed must , so far as practicable , apply at\nthe hearing of the summons for any order or directions\nwhich he may desire as to any matter capable of being dealt\nwith on an interlocutory application in the action and must,\nnot less than seven days before the hearing of the\nsummons, serve on the other parties a notice in Form 2B\nspecifying those orders and directions in so far as they\ndiffer from the orders and directions asked for by the\nsummons.\n(2) If the hearing of the summons for directions\nis adjourned and any par ty to the proceedings desire to\napply at the resumed hearing for any order or directions\nnot asked for by the summons or in any notice given under\nparagraph (1), he must, not less than seven days before the\nresumed hearing of the summons, serve on the othe r\nparties a notice specifying those orders and directions in so\nfar as they differ from the orders and directions asked for\nby the summons or in any such notice as aforesaid.\n\n(3) Any application subsequent to the summons\nfor directions and before judgment as to any matter capable\nof being dealt with on an interlocutory application in the\naction must be made under the summons by two clear days'\nnotice to the other party stating the grounds of the\napplication.\".\nAmendment of rule 28\n6. Rule 28 of the principal Rules is amended by substituting for the words \"Rules of\nthe High Court 1980\" the words \"Rules of Court 2012\".\nAmendment of rule 66\n7. Rule 66 of the principal Rules is amended\n(a) in paragraph (2), by inserting the words \" and must be supported by an\naffidavit\" after the words \"Form 6\"; and\n(b) in paragraph (4), by substituting for the words \"upon a motion in the High\nCourt\" the words \"provided in the Rules of Court 2012\".\nAmendment of rule 69\n8. Rule 69 of the principal Rules is amended by substituting for the words \"Rules of\nthe High Court 1980\" the words \"Rules of Court 2012\".\nAmendment of rule 85\n9. Rule 85 of the principal Rules is amended by substituting for the words \"Rules of\nthe High Court 1980\" the words \"Rules of Court 2012\".\nSubstitution of rule 122\n10. The principal Rules are amended by substituting for rule 122 the following rule:\n\n\"122. Save as hereinafter provided, the office hours for the Registry shall be\nfrom 8:00 a.m. to 5:00 p.m. except on Friday the office hours shall be fro m 8:00\na.m. to 12:15 p.m. and from 2:45 p.m. to 5:00 p.m..\nProvided that, the Registrar shall not receive any document presented for filing\nexcept as follows:\n(a) on Monday until Thursday between the hours of 8:30 a.m. to 4:00 p.m. ;\nand\n(b) on Friday between the hours of 8:30 a.m. to 12:15 p.m. and from 2:45 p.m.\nto 4:00 p.m..\".\nAmendment of First Schedule\n11. The First Schedule of the principal Rules is amended by inserting after Form 2\nthe following forms:\n\"FORM 2A\n(rule 20)\nSUMMONS FOR DIRECTIONS\nN.B.-Applicants to complete the text of any matter required and to strike out the\nnumber opposite any matter not required but not to strike out the text, which\nmust be left for the Judge (or Registrar).\n(Title as in action)\nLet all parties concerned attend before the Judge on ............... the ...... day of\n............... 20 .............., at ...............m. on the hearing of an application for directions in\nthis action, that:\n1. This action be consolidated with action(s) in Suit No .......... .......of …..., and\nSuit No ................ of .............\n\n2. The petitioner have leave to amend the petition by ........................................\nand that the service of the petition and the respondent's appearance do stand,\nand that the costs incurred and thrown away by the amendment be the\nrespondent's in any event.\n3. The petitioner have leave to amend the petition as shown in the\ndocument served herewith and to re -serve the amended petition in .... ....... days,\nwith leave to the respondent to re-serve an amended defence (if so advised) in\n......... days thereafter, (and with leave to the petitioner to re -serve an amended\nreply (if so advised) in ...... days thereafter) and that the costs incurred and\nthrown away by the amendments be the respondent's in any event.\n4. The respondent have leave to amend the defence as shown in (the\ndocument served with) the respondent's notice under this summons and to re -\nserve the amended defence in ...... days (or with leave to the petitioner to re -\nserve an amended reply (if so advised) in ...... days thereafter) and that the costs\nof and the costs thrown away as the result of the amendments be the\npetitioner's in any event.\n5. The petitioner serve on the respondent within ...... days the further and\nbetter particulars of the petition specified in (the document served with) the\nrespondent's notice under this summons.\n6. The respondent serve on the petitioner within ...... days the further and\nbetter particulars of the defence specified in the document served herewith.\n7. The petitioner serve on the respondent within ...... days the further and\nbetter particulars of the reply specified in (the document served with) the\nrespondent's notice under this summons.\n8. The petitioner give security for the respondent's costs to the satisfaction\nof the Registrar in the sum of ............................. on the ground ..............................and\nthat in the meantime all further proceedings be stayed.\n\n9. The petitioner within .. .... days serve on the respondent a list of\ndocuments (and file an affidavit verifying such list) (limited to the documents\nrelating to the\n(period from ............... to ...............)\n(issues raised in paras .............................. of the petition and paras ............ .................. of\nthe defence)\n(issues of ......................................................................................................))\n10. The respondent within ...... days serve the petitioner with a list of\ndocuments (and file an affida vit verifying such list) (limited to documents\nrelating to the\n(period from ............... to ...............)\n(issues raised in paras .................................. of the petition and paras\n..............................of the defence)\n(issues of .....................................................................................................))\n11. There be inspection of documents within .............................. days of the\nservice of the lists (filing of the affidavits).\n12. The petitioner have leave to serve on the respondent the interrogatories\nshown in the document served herewith, and that the respondent answer the\ninterrogatories on affidavit within ..................... days.\n13. The respondent have leave to serve on the petitioner the interrogatories\nshown in the document served with the respondent's notice under this\nsummons, and that the petitioner answer the interrogatories on affidavit within\n.............. days.\n14. The petitioner (or respondent) (retain and preserve pen ding the trial of\nthe action) (upon ... ........ days notice to give inspection of) (the subject matter of\nthe action, to the respondent (or petitioner) and to his legal advisers (and\n\nexperts)).\n15. The statements in .............................. be admi ssible in evidence at the trial\nwithout calling as a witness the maker of the statements (and, if a copy of that\ndocument certified by .................................. to be a true copy is produced, without\nproduction of the original document).\n16. An affidavit of .............................. (in the form of the draft affidavit (served\nherewith) (with the respondent's notice under this summons)) (to be served\nwithin …….... days) be admissible in evidence at the trial.\n17. Evidence of the following f act(s), namely, .............................. be received at\nthe trial by statement on oath of information and belief (by the production of\nthe following documents or entries in books or copy documents or copy entries\nin books, namely, ..............................).\n18. It be recorded that the parties ((petitioner) (respondent) refuses to\nadmit for the purposes of this action that .............................. the truth of the\nstatements in the document served (herewith) with the respondent's notice\nunder this summons.\n19. Trial. (Estimated length and number of witnesses) ................ To be set\ndown within ... ............ days (and to be tried immediately after the action in Suit\nNo .............................. of 20..............).\n20. The costs of this application be costs in the cause.\nDated the .............. day of ..............., 20......\nEntered No .............................. 20......\nClerk\n(Seal)\n\n.....................................\nRegistrar\nTo the respondent(s) and to his (their) solicitors.\nThis summons is taken out by .............................. of .............................., solicitors for the\npetitioner.\nFORM 2B\n(rule 21C)\nNOTICE UNDER SUMMONS FOR DIRECTIONS\n(Title as in action)\nTake notice that the abovenamed respondent intends to apply at the hearing of\nthe summons for directions herein for an order that (insert directions required\n- see Form 2A).\nDated the ....... day of ..............., 20......\n.....................................\nSolicitors for the\n.....................................\nRegistrar\nEntered No. ..............................of 20......\nClerk\nThis summons is taken out by .............................................................................. solicitor for\n..........................................................\nTo\n...................................................................................................................\"\nMade 31 July 2012\n[JK/MP 322 Jld. 11; PN(PU2)153/XIV]\n\nTUN ARIFIN BIN ZAKARIA\nChief Justice, Malaysia\nTAN SRI ABDUL GANI PATAIL\nAttorney General, Malaysia\nTAN SRI DATO' SERI MD. RAUS BIN SHARIF\nPresident of the Court of Appeal, Malaysia\nTAN SRI DATO' SERI ZULKEFLI BIN AHMAD MAKINUDIN\nChief Judge of the High Court in Malaya\nTAN SRI DATUK SERI PANGLIMA RICHARD MALANJUM\nChief Judge of the High Court in Sabah and Sarawak\nDATO' AHMAD BIN HJ. MAAROP\nJudge of the Federal Court\nDATUK ZAHARAH BINTI IBRAHIM\nJudge of the Court of Appeal\nDATUK DR. HAJI HAMID SULTAN BIN ABU BACKER\nJudge of the High Court in Malaya\nDATUK DAVID WONG DAK WAH\nJudge of the High Court in Sabah and Sarawak\nPUAN AL-BAISHAH BINTI HJ. ABD. MANAN\nSenior Sessions Court Judge, Kuala Lumpur\nENCIK LIM CHEE WEE\nAdvocate, Peninsular Malaysia\n\nENCIK G.B.B. NANDY @ GAANESH\nAdvocate, Sabah\nENCIK KHAIRIL AZMI BIN MOHD HASBIE\nAdvocate, Sarawak\n[To be laid before the Dewan Rakyat pursuant to subsection 17(5) of the Courts of Judicature Act\n1964]"}}],"pack":"my-6"};
  FT["MY-H2882"] = {"id":"MY-H2882","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 233/2014&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2014年印刷机与出版物（不良出版物管制）（第7号）令","en":"PRINTING PRESSES AND PUBLICATIONS (CONTROL OF UNDESIRABLE PUBLICATIONS) (NO. 7) ORDER 2014","orig":"PRINTING PRESSES AND PUBLICATIONS (CONTROL OF UNDESIRABLE PUBLICATIONS) (NO. 7) ORDER 2014","ms":"Perintah Mesin Cetak dan Penerbitan (Kawalan Penerbitan Tidak Diingini) (Bilangan 7) 2014","vi":"Lệnh về Máy in và ấn phẩm (Kiểm soát ấn phẩm không mong muốn) (số 7) năm 2014","th":"คำสั่งแท่นพิมพ์และสิ่งพิมพ์ (การควบคุมสิ่งพิมพ์ที่ไม่พึงประสงค์) (ฉบับที่ 7) ค.ศ. 2014","id":"Perintah Mesin Cetak dan Penerbitan (Pengendalian Terbitan Tidak Diinginkan) (Nomor 7) Tahun 2014"},"level":"regulation","category":"04_劳工与行政法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA233","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2014","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\04_劳工与行政法\\2014_P.U.(A)233-2014_PRINTING PRESSES AND PUBLICATIONS (CONTROL OF UNDESIRABLE PUBLICATIONS) (NO. 7) ORDER 2014.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H2882-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Mesin Cetak dan Penerbitan\n\n(Kawalan Hasil Penerbitan Tidak Diingini) (No. 7) 2014.\n\nLarangan"}},{"id":"MY-H2882-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Pencetakan, pengimportan, penghasilan, penghasilan semula, penerbitan,\n\npenjualan, pengeluaran, pengelilingan, pengedaran atau pemilikan hasil penerbitan\n\nyang diperihalkan dalam Jadual yang mungkin memudaratkan ketenteraman awam dan\n\nyang mungkin menggemparkan fikiran orang ramai adalah dilarang secara mutlak\n\ndi seluruh Malaysia.\n\nJADUAL\n\nTajuk Hasil\n\nPenerbitan\n\nPengarang/\n\nPenyusun\n\nPenerbit Pencetak Bahasa\n\n1. Metodologi Fiqih\n\nIslam Kontemporer\n\nDr. Ir.\n\nMuhammad\n\nShahrur\n\nPenerbit eLSAQ\n\nPress Ngawen\n\nMaguwoharjo\n\nDepok Sleman\n\nYogyakarta\n\n- Melayu\n\nTajuk Hasil\n\nPenerbitan\n\nPengarang/\n\nPenyusun\n\nPenerbit Pencetak Bahasa\n\n2. Mencari Jalan Pulang\n\nDaripada Sosialisme\n\nKepada Islam\n\nKassim Ahmad ZI Publications\n\nSdn. Bhd.\n\nB-2-19,\n\nMerchant Square,\n\nJalan Tropicana\n\nSelatan 1, PJU 3,\n\n47410 Petaling\n\nJaya, Selangor\n\nDarul Ehsan\n\nBS Print\n\nSdn. Bhd.\n\nMelayu\n\nDibuat 18 Julai 2014\n\n[KDN:PQ(S) 600-1/1 Jld. 5- (8); KDN:PQ(S) 600-2/1 Jld. 2- (7); PN(PU2)417/XII]\n\nDATO' SERI DR. AHMAD ZAHID BIN HAMIDI\n\nMenteri Dalam Negeri\n\nPRINTING PRESSES AND PUBLICATIONS ACT 1984\n\nPRINTING PRESSES AND PUBLICATIONS (CONTROL OF UNDESIRABLE PUBLICATIONS)\n\n(NO. 7) ORDER 2014\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by subsection 7(1) of the Printing Presses and\n\nPublications Act 1984 [Act 301], the Minister makes the following order:\n\nCitation\n\n1. This order may be cited as the Printing Presses and Publications (Control of\n\nUndesirable Publications) (No. 7) Order 2014.\n\nProhibition\n\n2. The printing, importation, production, reproduction, publishing, sale, issue,\n\ncirculation, distribution or possession of the publications described in the Schedule\n\nwhich are likely to be prejudicial to public order and which are likely to alarm public\n\nopinion are absolutely prohibited throughout Malaysia.\n\nSCHEDULE\n\nTitle of\n\nPublication\n\nAuthor/\n\nCompiler\n\nPublisher Printer Language\n\n1. Metodologi Fiqih\n\nIslam Kontemporer\n\nDr. Ir.\n\nMuhammad\n\nShahrur\n\nPenerbit eLSAQ\n\nPress Ngawen\n\nMaguwoharjo\n\nDepok Sleman\n\nYogyakarta\n\n- Malay\n\nTitle of\n\nPublication\n\nAuthor/\n\nCompiler\n\nPublisher Printer Language\n\n2. Mencari Jalan Pulang\n\nDaripada Sosialisme\n\nKepada Islam\n\nKassim Ahmad ZI Publications\n\nSdn. Bhd.\n\nB-2-19,\n\nMerchant Square,\n\nJalan Tropicana\n\nSelatan 1, PJU 3,\n\n47410 Petaling\n\nJaya, Selangor\n\nDarul Ehsan\n\nBS Print\n\nSdn. Bhd.\n\nMalay\n\nMade 18 July 2014\n\n[KDN:PQ(S) 600-1/1 Jld. 5- (8); KDN:PQ(S) 600-2/1 Jld. 2- (7); PN(PU2)417/XII]\n\nDATO' SERI DR. AHMAD ZAHID BIN HAMIDI\n\nMinister of Home Affairs"}}],"pack":"my-6"};
  FT["MY-H2883"] = {"id":"MY-H2883","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 233/2015&status=AMENDMENT","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2015年联邦道路（私营管理）（通行费征收）（雨水管理与公路隧道大道（SMART））（修正）令","en":"FEDERAL ROADS (PRIVATE MANAGEMENT) (COLLECTION OF TOLLS) (STORM WATER MANAGEMENT AND ROAD TUNNEL HIGHWAY (SMART)) (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2015","orig":"FEDERAL ROADS (PRIVATE MANAGEMENT) (COLLECTION OF TOLLS) (STORM WATER MANAGEMENT AND ROAD TUNNEL HIGHWAY (SMART)) (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2015","ms":"Perintah Jalan Raya Persekutuan (Pengurusan Swasta) (Kutipan Tol) (Pengurusan Air Hujan dan Lebuhraya Terowong Jalan (SMART)) (Pindaan) 2015","vi":"Lệnh về Đường bộ liên bang (Quản lý tư nhân) (Thu phí đường bộ) (Quản lý nước mưa và đường hầm cao tốc (SMART)) (Sửa đổi) năm 2015","th":"คำสั่งทางหลวงสหพันธ์ (การบริหารจัดการเอกชน) (การจัดเก็บค่าผ่านทาง) (การจัดการน้ำฝนและทางด่วนอุโมงค์ถนน (SMART)) (การแก้ไข) ค.ศ. 2015","id":"Perintah Jalan Raya Federal (Pengelolaan Swasta) (Pemungutan Tol) (Pengelolaan Air Hujan dan Jalan Tol Terowong (SMART)) (Perubahan) Tahun 2015"},"level":"regulation","category":"04_劳工与行政法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA233","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2015","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\04_劳工与行政法\\2015_P.U.(A)233-2015_FEDERAL ROADS (PRIVATE MANAGEMENT) (COLLECTION OF TOLLS) (STORM WATER MANAGEMENT AND ROAD TUNNE.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H2883-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Jalan-Jalan Persekutuan\n\n(Pengurusan Persendirian) (Pungutan Tol) (Lebuh Raya Storm Water\n\nManagement and Road Tunnel (SMART)) (Pindaan) 2015.\n\n (2) Perintah ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 15 Oktober 2015.\n\nPenggantian Jadual Pertama"}},{"id":"MY-H2883-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Perintah Jalan-Jalan Persekutuan (Pengurusan Persendirian) (Pungutan Tol)\n\n(Lebuh Raya Storm Water Management and Road Tunnel (SMART)) 2007\n\n[P.U. (A) 222/2007] dipinda dengan menggantikan Jadual Pertama dengan Jadual yang\n\nberikut:\n\n\"JADUAL PERTAMA\n\n[subperenggan 2(1)]\n\nKADAR TOL BAGI TEMPOH KONSESI\n\nDARI 15 OKTOBER 2015 HINGGA 31 DISEMBER 2042\n\n(1) (2)\n\nKelas Kenderaan Tol Kena Dibayar\n\n(RM)\n\nKenderaan yang mempunyai dua\n\ngandar dan tiga atau empat roda\n\ndan tidak melebihi 2.4 meter had\n\nketinggian\n\n3.00\n\nBagi maksud mengira bilangan gandar dan roda sesuatu kenderaan, gandar dan roda\n\nmana-mana treler yang ditarik oleh kenderaan itu dikira termasuk sebagai sebahagian\n\ndaripada gandar dan roda kenderaan itu.\".\n\nDibuat 12 Oktober 2015\n\n[KKR.PUU.110-1/7/18; PN(PU2)426/LX]\n\nDATO' SRI HAJI FADILLAH BIN HAJI YUSOF\n\nMenteri Kerja Raya\n\nFEDERAL ROADS (PRIVATE MANAGEMENT) ACT 1984\n\nFEDERAL ROADS (PRIVATE MANAGEMENT) (COLLECTION OF TOLLS)\n\n(STORM WATER MANAGEMENT AND ROAD TUNNEL HIGHWAY (SMART))\n\n(AMENDMENT) ORDER 2015\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by section 2 of the Federal Roads (Private\n\nManagement) Act 1984 [Act 306], the Minister makes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-6"};
  FT["MY-H2884"] = {"id":"MY-H2884","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 233/2016&status=AMENDMENT","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":15,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2016年资本市场与服务（争议解决）（修正）条例","en":"CAPITAL MARKETS AND SERVICES (DISPUTE RESOLUTION) (AMENDMENT) REGULATIONS 2016","orig":"CAPITAL MARKETS AND SERVICES (DISPUTE RESOLUTION) (AMENDMENT) REGULATIONS 2016","ms":"Peraturan Pasaran Modal dan Perkhidmatan (Penyelesaian Pertikaian) (Pindaan) 2016","vi":"Quy định về Thị trường vốn và dịch vụ (Giải quyết tranh chấp) (Sửa đổi) năm 2016","th":"ข้อบังคับตลาดทุนและบริการ (การระงับข้อพิพาท) (การแก้ไข) ค.ศ. 2016","id":"Peraturan Pasar Modal dan Jasa (Penyelesaian Sengketa) (Perubahan) Tahun 2016"},"level":"regulation","category":"02_民商事与经济法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA233","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2016","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 15 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\02_民商事与经济法\\2016_P.U.(A)233-2016_CAPITAL MARKETS AND SERVICES (DISPUTE RESOLUTION) (AMENDMENT) REGULATIONS 2016.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H2884-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Peraturan-peraturan ini bolehlah dinamakan Peraturan-Peraturan\nPasaran Modal dan Perkhidmatan (Penyelesaian Pertikaian) (Pindaan) 2016.\n\n(2) Peraturan-Peraturan ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 5 September 2016.\n\nPindaan am"}},{"id":"MY-H2884-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2.   Peraturan-Peraturan Pasaran Modal dan Perkhidmatan\n(Penyelesaian Pertikaian) 2010 [P.U. (A) 437/2010], yang disebut \"Peraturan-Peraturan\nibu\" dalam Peraturan -Peraturan ini , dipinda dalam teks bahasa kebangsaan,\ndengan menggantikan perkataan \"pertubuhan perbadanan yang diluluskan\"\ndi mana -mana jua terdapat , termasuk dalam nota bahu, kecuali dalam takrif\n\"pertubuhan perbadanan yang diluluskan\" dalam peraturan 2, subperaturan 5( 1) dan\nsubperaturan 8(2), dengan perkataan \"pertubuhan perbadanan diluluskan\".\n\nPindaan peraturan 2"}},{"id":"MY-H2884-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"ms":"3. Peraturan-Peraturan ibu dipinda dalam peraturan 2—\n\n(a) dalam takrif \"anggota\" , dengan menggantikan perkataan\n\"subperaturan 5(2)\" dengan perkataan \"subperaturan 5(2) dan (3)\";\n\n(b) dalam takrif \"award\", dengan memasukkan selepas perkataan\n\"suatu award yang diberi\" perkataan \"atau suatu keputusan yang dibuat\";\n\n(c) dengan menggantikan takrif \"pertubuhan perbadanan yang diluluskan\"\ndengan takrif yang berikut:\n\n ‘ \"pertubuhan perbadanan diluluskan\" ertinya suatu pertubuhan\nperbadanan yang diluluskan oleh Suruhanjaya menurut seksyen 379\nAkta;'; dan\n\n(d) dalam takrif \"terma rujuka n\", dengan menggantikan perkataan\n\"suatu set terma\" dengan perkataan \"kaedah -kaedah yang diadakan\nmenurut perenggan 379(3)(b) Akta\".\n\nPindaan peraturan 3"}},{"id":"MY-H2884-A4","no":4,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 4"},"text":{"ms":"4. Peraturan 3 Peraturan-Peraturan ibu dipinda—\n\n(a) dengan memotong subperaturan (1); dan\n\n(b) dalam subperaturan (2), dengan menggantikan perkataan \"tidak boleh\nmemberikan kelulusan di bawah subperaturan (1) melainkan  jika\"\ndengan perkataan \"boleh meluluskan suatu pertubuhan perbadanan\nmenjadi suatu pertubuhan perbadanan diluluskan sekiranya\".\n\nPindaan peraturan 4"}},{"id":"MY-H2884-A5","no":5,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 5"},"text":{"ms":"5. Subperaturan 4 (2) Peraturan-Peraturan ibu dipinda  dengan menggantikan\nperkataan \"suatu pertubuhan perbadanan\" dengan perkataan \"pertubuhan perbadanan\nyang membuat permohonan di bawah subperaturan (1)\".\n\nPindaan peraturan 5"}},{"id":"MY-H2884-A6","no":6,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 6"},"text":{"ms":"6. Peraturan 5 Peraturan-Peraturan ibu dipinda—\n\n(a) dengan menggantikan subperaturan (1) dengan subperaturan yang\nberikut:\n\n\"(1) Pertubuhan perbadanan diluluskan adalah sebagaimana\nyang dinyatakan dalam Jadual 1.\"; dan\n\n(b) dengan memasukkan selepas subperaturan (2) subpe raturan yang\nberikut:\n\n\"(3)   Walau apa pun subperaturan (2), Suruhanjaya boleh\nmengarahkan mana -mana orang berlesen atau orang ber daftar untuk\nmenjadi anggota pertubuhan perbadanan diluluskan.\".\n\nPindaan peraturan 6"}},{"id":"MY-H2884-A7","no":7,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 7"},"text":{"ms":"7. Peraturan 6 Peraturan-Peraturan ibu dipinda—\n\n(a) dengan memotong subperaturan (1) dan (2);\n\n(b) dalam subperaturan (3) , dengan menggantikan perkataan\n\"di laman Internet yang tersedia kepada awam\" dengan perkataan\n\"di laman sesawang pertubuhan perbadanan diluluskan itu\";\n\n(c) dalam subperaturan (4)—\n\n(i) dengan memasukkan selepas perenggan (d) perenggan yang\nberikut:\n\n\"(da) skop, kriteria dan proses bagi rayuan terhadap\nkeputusan yang dibuat oleh pertubuhan\nperbadanan diluluska n itu menurut suatu\npenghukuman, yang akan didengar oleh suatu\njawatankuasa rayuan sebagaimana yang ditentukan\noleh Suruhanjaya;\"\n\n(ii) dalam perenggan (e)—\n\n(A) dalam teks bahasa kebangsaan, dengan menggantikan\nperkataan \"fi lain atau bayaran\" dengan perkataan\n\"fi atau bayaran lain\";\n\n(B) dengan memasukkan selepas perkataan \"kelas anggotanya\"\nperkataan \", atau oleh mana-mana orang yang disebut dalam\nsubperaturan 8(3),\"; dan\n\n(C) dengan memasukkan selepas perkataan \"anggota yang\nberlainan kelas\" perkataan \" atau o rang yang disebut dalam\nsubperaturan 8(3) yang berlainan kelas\"; dan\n\n(iii) dalam perenggan (j), dengan menggantikan perkataan\n\"dan anggota yang relevan\" dengan perkataan \" , anggota yang\nrelevan dan orang yang disebut dalam subperaturan 8(3)\".\n\nPindaan peraturan 7"}},{"id":"MY-H2884-A8","no":8,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 8"},"text":{"ms":"8. Perenggan 7(1) (h) Peraturan-Peraturan ibu dipinda  dengan menggantikan\nperkataan \" di bawah subperaturan 4(1) dan (2)\" dengan perkataan \"bagi maksud\nPeraturan-Peraturan ini\".\n\nPindaan peraturan 8"}},{"id":"MY-H2884-A9","no":9,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 9"},"text":{"ms":"9. Peraturan 8 Peraturan-Peraturan ibu dipinda—\n\n(a) dengan menggantikan subperaturan (2) dengan subperaturan yang\nberikut:\n\n\"(2) Suatu pertubuhan perbadanan dilul uskan hendaklah\ndengan serta-merta memberitahu Suruhanjaya—\n\n(a) tentang apa-apa perkara yang boleh menjejaskan atau\n\nyang berkemungkin an menjejaskan kemampuannya\nuntuk menjalankan kewajipannya yang diperuntukkan\ndi bawah subperaturan (1); dan\n\n(b) tentang apa-apa pertikaian atau tuntutan—\n\n(i)    yang boleh meng akibatkan penghakisan\nkeyakinan awam terhadap integriti pasaran\nmodal; atau\n\n(ii)    yang melibatkan salah laku yang serius atau\npelanggaran undang-undang sekuriti.\"; dan\n\n(b) dalam teks bahasa kebangsaan, dalam subperaturan (3), dengan\nmenggantikan perkataan \"is\" dengan perkataan \"ia\".\n\nPindaan peraturan 9"}},{"id":"MY-H2884-A10","no":10,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 10"},"text":{"ms":"10.  Subperaturan 9(1) dan (3)  Peraturan-Peraturan ibu dipinda  dengan\nmenggantikan perkataan \" laman Internet yang tersedia kepada awam\" dengan\nperkataan \"laman sesawang pertubuhan perbadanan diluluskan itu\", masing-masing.\n\nPemotongan peraturan 10"}},{"id":"MY-H2884-A11","no":11,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 11"},"text":{"ms":"11.    Peraturan-Peraturan ibu dipinda dengan memotong peraturan 10.\n\nPeraturan baharu 13A"}},{"id":"MY-H2884-A12","no":12,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 12"},"text":{"ms":"12.    Peraturan-Peraturan ibu dipinda dengan memasukkan selepas peraturan 13\nperaturan yang berikut:\n\n\"Kegagalan mematuhi kaedah-kaedah pertubuhan perbadanan diluluskan"}},{"id":"MY-H2884-A13","no":13,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 13"},"text":{"ms":"13A.   (1) Seseorang anggota atau orang yang disebut dal am\nsubperaturan 8(3) hendaklah mematuhi kaedah -kaedah pertubuhan\nperbadanan diluluskan.\n\n       (2)  Pertubuhan perbadanan diluluskan hendaklah memberitahu\nSuruhanjaya mengenai apa-apa kegagalan mana-mana anggota atau oran g yang\ndisebut dalam subperaturan 8(3) untuk mematuhi kaedah -kaedah pertubuhan\nperbadanan diluluskan.\n\n  (3)   Suruhanjaya boleh, apabila diberitahu mengenai kegagalan\nmana-mana anggota atau orang yang disebut dalam subperenggan 8(3) untuk\nmematuhi kaedah -kaedah pertubuhan perbadanan diluluskan , memberikan\napa-apa arahan yang difikirkan nya patut kepada pertubuhan perbadanan\ndiluluskan.\n\n (4)   Pertubuhan perbadanan diluluskan hendaklah mengambil apa -apa\ntindakan sebagaimana ya ng diarahkan oleh Suruhanjaya di bawah\nsubperaturan (3).\".\n\nPindaan peraturan 14\n13. Peraturan 14 Peraturan-Peraturan ibu dipinda—\n\n(a) dalam subperaturan (1)—\n\n(i) dalam teks bahasa kebangsaan, dengan menggantikan perkataan\n\"memasuki\" dengan perkataan \"membuat\";\n\n(ii) dengan memasukkan selepas perkataan \"mana -mana badan\npenyelesaian pertikaian\" perkataan \"atau badan\";  dan\n\n(iii) dengan menggantikan perkataan \"dengan badan penyelesaian\npertikaian itu\" dengan perkataan \" dengan badan penyelesaian\npertikaian atau badan lain itu\"; dan\n\n(b) dalam subperaturan (2)—\n\n(i) dengan memasukkan selepas perkataan \"kerjasama kepada\n\nSuruhanjaya\" perkataan \" atau mana -mana pihak berkuasa kawal\nselia lain sebagaimana yang diarahkan oleh Suruhanjaya\"; dan\n\n(ii) dengan memasukkan selepas perkataan \"bantua n kepada\nSuruhanjaya\" perkataan \"atau pihak berkuasa kawal selia itu\".\n\nPeraturan baharu 15"}},{"id":"MY-H2884-A14","no":14,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 14"},"text":{"ms":"14.    Peraturan-Peraturan ibu dipinda dengan memasukkan selepas peraturan 14\nperaturan yang berikut:\n\n\"Kerahsiaan"}},{"id":"MY-H2884-A15","no":15,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 15"},"text":{"ms":"15. Tiada seorang pun yang mempunyai akses kepada a pa-apa maklumat\natau dokumen yang berhubungan dengan apa -apa pertikaian atau tuntutan yang\ndirujuk kepada pertubuhan perbadanan diluluskan boleh mendedahkan\nmaklumat atau dokumen itu melainkan jika—\n\n(a) pendedahan itu dibuat dengan persetujuan orang yang\nmemberikan maklumat atau dokumen itu;\n\n(b) pendedahan itu dikehendaki atau dibenarkan di bawah Akta  atau\nPeraturan-Peraturan ini;\n\n(c) pendedahan itu dikehendaki atau diarahkan oleh mana -mana\nmahkamah atau Suruhanjaya;\n\n(d) pendedahan itu dikehendaki bagi maksud pelaksan aan atau\npenguatkuasaan suatu award di bawah Peraturan-Peraturan ini;\n\n(e) pendedahan itu adalah bagi maksud penguatkuasaan  apa-apa\ntindakan sivil atau jenayah di bawah mana -mana undang -undang\nbertulis;\n\n(f) pendedahan itu adalah bagi maksud  suatu semakan kehakim an\nterhadap pertubuhan perbadanan diluluskan itu; atau\n(g) maklumat atau dokumen itu telah berada dalam domain awam.\".\n\nPenggantian Jadual 2\n15. Peraturan-Peraturan ibu dipinda dengan menggantikan Jadual 2 dengan jadual\nyang berikut:\n\n\"JADUAL 2\n\n[Subperaturan 5(2)]\n\nSenarai pemegang Lesen Perkhidmatan Pasaran Modal\n\nMelainkan jika ditentukan selainnya oleh Suruhanjaya, pemegang Lesen\nPerkhidmatan Pasaran Modal  atau bank Islam dan bank berlesen seperti yang\ndiperuntukkan di bawah Bahagian 1 Jadual 4 kepada Akta bagi aktiviti terkawal\nyang berikut hendaklah disifatkan sebagai anggota suatu pertubuhan\nperbadanan diluluskan:"}}],"pack":"my-6"};
  FT["MY-H2885"] = {"id":"MY-H2885","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 233/2017&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2017年光学（修正）条例","en":"OPTICAL (AMENDMENT) REGULATIONS 2017","orig":"OPTICAL (AMENDMENT) REGULATIONS 2017","ms":"Peraturan Optik (Pindaan) 2017","vi":"Quy định về Quang học (Sửa đổi) năm 2017","th":"ข้อบังคับทัศนมาตร (การแก้ไข) ค.ศ. 2017","id":"Peraturan Optik (Perubahan) Tahun 2017"},"level":"regulation","category":"05_其他及未分类","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA233","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2017","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\05_其他及未分类\\2017_P.U.(A)233-2017_OPTICAL (AMENDMENT) REGULATIONS 2017.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H2885-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. Peraturan-peraturan ini bolehlah dinamakan Peraturan-Peraturan\n\nOptik (Pindaan) 2017.\n\nPindaan Jadual"}},{"id":"MY-H2885-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Jadual kepada Peraturan-Peraturan Optik 1994 [P.U. (A) 210/1994] dipinda\n\ndengan menggantikan Borang 17 dengan borang yang berikut:\n\n\"Borang 17\n\n[Peraturan 24]\n\nAKTA OPTIK 1991\n\n[Seksyen 30]\n\nPERATURAN-PERATURAN OPTIK 1994\n\nKEBENARAN MEMPRESKRIPSI DAN MENDISPENS KANTA LEKAP\n\nNo. Perakuan Pendaftaran Penuh: _____________________________\n\nNo. Kebenaran Mempreskripsi dan Mendispens Kanta Lekap: __________________________\n\nADALAH DENGAN INI DIPERAKU BAHAWA _________________________________________________\n\n(No. k/p / No. Pasport: __________________________) yang beralamat di __________________________\n\nialah seorang juruoptik berdaftar yang dibenarkan untuk mempreskripsi dan\n\nmendispens kanta lekap tertakluk kepada pembaharuan perakuan pengamalan tahunan\n\nsemasa beliau sebagai juruoptik.\n\nTarikh: _________________________\n\nPendaftar\n\nMajlis Optik Malaysia\".\n\nDibuat27 Julai 2017\n\n[KKM87/A4/7-1/2; PN(PU2)503/VI]\n\nDATUK SERI DR. S. SUBRAMANIAM\n\nMenteri Kesihatan\n\nOPTICAL ACT 1991\n\nOPTICAL (AMENDMENT) REGULATIONS 2017\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by section 42 of the Optical Act 1991 [Act 469], the\n\nMinister, after consulting the Malaysian Optical Council, makes the following regulations:\n\nCitation"}}],"pack":"my-6"};
  FT["MY-H2886"] = {"id":"MY-H2886","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 233/2018&status=AMENDMENT","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2018年销售税（税率）（修正）令","en":"SALES TAX (RATES OF TAX) (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2018","orig":"SALES TAX (RATES OF TAX) (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2018","ms":"Perintah Cukai Jualan (Kadar-Kadar Cukai) (Pindaan) 2018","vi":"Lệnh về Thuế bán hàng (Các thuế suất) (Sửa đổi) năm 2018","th":"คำสั่งภาษีขาย (อัตราภาษี) (การแก้ไข) ค.ศ. 2018","id":"Perintah Pajak Penjualan (Tarif-Tarif Pajak) (Perubahan) Tahun 2018"},"level":"regulation","category":"02_民商事与经济法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA233","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2018","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\02_民商事与经济法\\2018_P.U.(A)233-2018_SALES TAX (RATES OF TAX) (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2018.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H2886-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Cukai Jualan (Kadar Cukai)\n(Pindaan) 2018.\n\n (2)  Perintah ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 6 September 2018.\n\nPindaan Jadual Pertama"}},{"id":"MY-H2886-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Perintah Cukai Jualan (Kadar Cukai) 2018 [P.U. (A) 221/2018] dipinda dalam\nJadual Pertama—\n\n(a) berhubung dengan kepala 03.05—\n\n(i) dalam ruang (3), selepas subkepala 0305.49.00 00 dan butir -butir\nyang berhubungan dengann ya, dengan memotong perkataan\n\"-   Fish, salted but not dried or smoked and fish in brine, other\nthan edible fish offal:\"; dan\n\n(ii) dengan memot ong subkepala 0305.61.00 00, 0305.62.00 00,\n0305.64.00 00, 0305. 69, 0305.69.10 00 dan 0305.69.9 0 00 da n\nbutir-butir yang berhubungan dengannya;\n\n(b) dengan memasuk kan selepas kepala 16 .04 dan butir -butir yang\nberhubungan dengannya kepala dan butir-butir yang berikut:\n\n       P .U. (A) 233\n\nHeading\n(1)\nSubheading\n(2)\nDescription\n(3)\n\n\"16.05  Crustaceans, molluscs and othe r aquatic\ninvertebrates, prepared or preserved.\n 1605.10 - Crab:\n 1605.10.10 00 - - In airtight containers for retail sale\n 1605.10.90 00 - - Other\n  - Shrimps and prawns:\n 1605.21.00 00 - - Not in airtight container\n 1605.29 - - Other:\n 1605.29.20 00 - - - Shrimp ball\n 1605.29.30 00 - - - Breaded shrimp\n 1605.29.90 00 - - - Other\n 1605.30.00 00 - Lobster\n 1605.40.00 00 - Other crustaceans\n  - Molluscs:\n 1605.51.00 00 - - Oysters\n 1605.52.00 00 - - Scallops, including queen scallops\n 1605.53.00 00 - - Mussels\n 1605.54 - - Cuttlefish and squid:\n 1605.54.10 00 - - - In airtight containers for retail sale\n 1605.54.90 00 - - - Other\n 1605.55.00 00 - - Octopus\n 1605.56.00 00 - - Clams, cockles and ark shells\n 1605.57 - - Abalone:\n 1605.57.10 00 - - - In airtight containers for retail sale\n 1605.57.90 00 - - - Other\n 1605.58.00 00 - - Snails, other than sea snails\n 1605.59.00 00 - - Other\n  - Other aquatic invertebrates:\n 1605.61.00 00 - - Sea cucumbers\n 1605.62.00 00 - - Sea urchins\n 1605.63.00 00 - - Jellyfish\n 1605.69.00 00 - - Other\";\n\n(c) dengan memasukkan selepas kepala 39 .22 dan butir -butir yang\nberhubungan dengannya kepala dan butir-butir yang berikut:\n\nHeading\n(1)\nSubheading\n(2)\nDescription\n(3)\n\"40.11  New pneumatic tyres, of rubber.\n 4011.40.00 00 - Of a kind used on motorcycles\n\n       P .U. (A) 233\n\nHeading\n(1)\nSubheading\n(2)\nDescription\n(3)\n40.13  Inner tubes, of rubber.\n 4013.90 - Other:\n 4013.90.20 00 - - Of a kind used on motorcycles\";\n\n(d) dengan memasukkan selepas kepala 91.04 kepala  \"91.05\" dalam\nruang (1) yang terdapat bersetentangan dengan perkataan\n\"Other clocks.\" dalam ruang (3);\n\n(e) dengan memasukkan sebelum kepala 91.07 kepala \" 91.06\" dalam ruang\n(1) yang terdapat bersetentangan dengan perkataan \"Time of day\nrecording apparatus and apparatus for measuring, recording or\notherwise indicating intervals of time, with clock or watch\nmovement or with synchronous motor (for example, time -registers,\ntime-recorders).\" dalam ruang (3); dan\n\n(f) berhubung denga n kepala 9 4.06, dalam ruang (2),  dengan memotong\nsubkepala \"9406.00\".\n\nDibuat 6 September 2018\n[Perb. R.0.3865/356/7JLD.2(SK.2); PN(PU2)751]\n\nLIM GUAN ENG\nMenteri Kewangan\n\n[Akan dibentangkan di Dewan Rakyat menurut subseksyen 10(3) Akta Cukai Jualan 2018]\n\n       P .U. (A) 233\n\nSALES TAX ACT 2018\nSALES TAX (RATES OF TAX) (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2018\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by subsection 10(2) of the\nSales Tax Act 2018 [Act 806], the Minister makes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-6"};
  FT["MY-H2887"] = {"id":"MY-H2887","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 233/2019&status=AMENDMENT","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":6,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2019年服务税（违法行为罚款了结）（修正）条例","en":"SERVICE TAX (COMPOUNDING OF OFFENCES) (AMENDMENT) REGULATIONS 2019","orig":"SERVICE TAX (COMPOUNDING OF OFFENCES) (AMENDMENT) REGULATIONS 2019","ms":"Peraturan Cukai Perkhidmatan (Pengkompaunan Kesalahan) (Pindaan) 2019","vi":"Quy định về Thuế dịch vụ (Xử lý vi phạm bằng phạt tiền) (Sửa đổi) năm 2019","th":"ข้อบังคับภาษีบริการ (การระงับข้อหาด้วยค่าปรับ) (การแก้ไข) ค.ศ. 2019","id":"Peraturan Pajak Jasa (Penyelesaian Pelanggaran dengan Denda) (Perubahan) Tahun 2019"},"level":"regulation","category":"02_民商事与经济法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA233","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2019","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 6 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\02_民商事与经济法\\2019_P.U.(A)233-2019_SERVICE TAX (COMPOUNDING OF OFFENCES) (AMENDMENT) REGULATIONS 2019.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H2887-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1)  Peraturan-peraturan ini bolehlah dinamakan Peraturan-Peraturan\nCukai Perkhidmatan (Pengkompaunan Kesalahan) (Pindaan) 2019.\n\n (2)  Peraturan-Peraturan ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 1 September 2019.\n\nPindaan peraturan 4"}},{"id":"MY-H2887-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Peraturan-Peraturan Cukai Perkhidmatan (Pengkompaunan Kesalahan)  2018\n[P. U. (A) 218/2018], yang disebut \"Peraturan-Peraturan ibu\" dipinda—\n\n(a) dalam subperaturan (2), dengan menggantikan  perkataan \"empat belas\nhari\" di mana -mana jua terdapat dengan perkataan \"empat belas hari atau\napa-apa tempoh lanjutan sebagaimana yang diberikan ole h Ketua\nPengarah\"; dan\n\n(b) dalam subperaturan (3), dengan menggantikan  perkataan \"pada atau\nsebelum habis tempoh\" dengan perkataan \"dalam tempoh\".\n\nPindaan peraturan 5"}},{"id":"MY-H2887-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"ms":"3. Peraturan 5 Peraturan-Peraturan ibu dipinda—\n\n(a)       dalam subperaturan (1)—\n\n(i)  dengan memotong perkataan \"cek jurubank atau\"; dan\n\nP .U. (A) 233\n\n(ii)  dengan memotong perkataan \"atau melalui perbankan elektronik\";\ndan\n\n(b)      dengan memotong subperaturan (2).\n\nPindaan Jadual Pertama"}},{"id":"MY-H2887-A4","no":4,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 4"},"text":{"ms":"4. Jadual Pertama kepada Peraturan-Peraturan ibu dipinda dalam perenggan (a) —\n\n(a) dalam butiran (vi), dengan menggantikan perkataan \"(7)\" dengan\nperkataan \"(8)\"; dan\n\n(b) dengan memasukkan selepas butiran (vi) butiran yang berikut:\n\n\"(viA) subseksyen 26A(2) d an (4);\" .\n\nPindaan Jadual Kedua"}},{"id":"MY-H2887-A5","no":5,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 5"},"text":{"ms":"5. Jadual Kedua kepada Peraturan-Peraturan ibu dipinda—\n\n(a) dengan menggantikan Borang 2 dengan borang yang berikut:\n\n\"BORANG 2\n[Subperaturan 3(1)]\n\nAKTA CUKAI PERKHIDMATAN 2018\n\nPERATURAN-PERATURAN CUKAI PERKHIDMATAN\n (PENGKOMPAUNAN KESALAHAN) 2018\n\nTAWARAN UNTUK MENGKOMPAUN KESALAHAN\n\nNombor rujukan      : …………………………………………….\nNombor d aftar cukai perkhidmatan : …………………………………………….\nTarikh         : …………………………………………….\n\nP .U. (A) 233\n\nJabatan Kastam Diraja Malaysia\n…………………………………………….\n…………………………………………….\n…………………………………………….\n…………………………………………….\n…………………………………………….\n\nKepada:\n…………………………………………….\n…………………………………………….\n…………………………………………….\n…………………………………………….\n…………………………………………….\nTuan/Puan*,\n\nSuatu penyiasatan telah dijalankan terhadap and a …………………………………………………….*\n                                (nyatakan nama syarikat/perniagaan/badan lain, jika ada*)\nd an and a did apati telah melakukan kesalahan di bawah Akta Cukai Perkhidmatan 2018\n[Akta  807 ]/peraturan-peraturan yang dibuat di bawah Akta d engan butir -butir yang\nberikut:\n\n(a) peruntukan Akta/peraturan-peraturan yang berkaitan*:\n………………………………………………….……………………………………………………………….……...\n………………………………………………….……………………………………………………………….……...\n(b) tarikh  : ………………………………………………….……………………………………………...……......\n(c) masa  : ………………………………………………….……………………………………………...……......\n(d) tempat  : ………………………………………………….……………………………………………...……......\n\nP .U. (A) 233\n\n(e) butir-butir kesalahan:\n………………………………………………….……………………………………………...…….........................\n………………………………………………….……………………………………………...…….........................\n\n2. Menurut subseksyen 80(2) Akta Cukai Perkhidmat an 2018, d engan keizinan\nsecara bertulis ol eh Pendakwa Raya, and a ditawarkan suatu kompaun bagi kesalahan\nyang  dinyatakan  di  atas  bagi  jumlah  wang  sebanyak RM\n………………………………………................................................................................................................................\n(Ringgit Malaysia .................................................... sahaja).\n\n3. Sekiranya tawaran kompaun diterima, bayaran bol eh dibuat melalui draf bank\ndipalang d engan perkataan \" Akaun Penerima Sahaja\" yang kena dibayar kepada Ketua\nPengarah Kastam d an dihantar secara serahan tangan ke Pejabat Kastam yang berkenaan.\n\n4. Suatu resit rasmi akan dikeluarkan apabila pembayaran kompaun itu diterima.\n\n5. Tawaran untuk mengkompaun ini sah sehingga ……………………......................................."}},{"id":"MY-H2887-A6","no":6,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 6"},"text":{"ms":"6. Jika tiad a bayaran diterima d alam tempoh yang disebut d alam perenggan 5,\npend akwaan bagi kesalahan itu bol eh dimulakan terhadap and a tanpa notis selanjutnya.\n\nSekian, terima kasih.\n\"BERKHIDMAT UNTUK NEGARA\"\n\nKetua Pengarah Kastam d an Eksais\nJabatan Kastam Diraja Malaysia\n* Potong mana-mana yang tidak berkenaan\".\n\nP .U. (A) 233\n\n(b) dengan menggantikan Borang 3 dengan borang yang berikut:\n\n\"BORANG 3\n[Subperaturan 3 (2)]\nAKTA CUKAI PERKHIDMATAN 2018\n\nPERATURAN-PERATURAN CUKAI PERKHIDMATAN\n(PENGKOMPAUNAN KESALAHAN) 2018\n\nPENYETUJUTERIMAAN TAWARAN UNTUK MENGKOMPAUN KESALAHAN\n\nKepada:\n\n……………………………………\n……………………………………\n……………………………………\n\nTuan,\nSaya merujuk kepada Tawaran untuk Mengkompaun Kesalahan d engan nombor\nrujukan ……………………….. dan bertarikh ……………………… .\n2.  Saya mengaku bahawa saya telah melakukan kesalahan ini d an saya menerima\ntawaran kompaun itu dan disertakan bersama d engan ini pembayaran melalui draf bank\ndipalang d engan perkataan \" Akaun Penerima Sahaja\" yang kena dibayar kepada Ketua\nPengarah Kastam bagi jumlah wang sebanyak RM……………………………(Ringgit\nMalaysia………………………………... sahaja) sebagai penyel esaian penuh bagi jumlah wang\nyang dinyatakan d alam perenggan 2 Tawaran untuk Mengkompaun Kesalahan.\n\nTand atangan                                                 :…………………………………………….\nNama (huruf besar)                                    :………………………………………….…\n*No. Kad Pengenalan/No. Pasport         :…………………………………………….\n\nP .U. (A) 233\n\nUntuk d an bagi pihak (jika berkenaan) :…………………………………………….\n                                   (nama*syarikat/perniagaan)\nCap rasmi*syarikat/perniagaan (jika berkenaan):\n\n……………………………………………………………………………\n\nAlamat:\n\n……………………………………………………………………………………………………………………………………\n……………………………………………………………………………………………………………………………………\n\nTarikh: …………………….\n*Potong mana-mana yang tidak berkenaan\" .\n\nDiluluskan 30 Ogos 2019\n[PN(PU2)752/III]\n\nTOMMY  THOMAS\nPendakwa Raya\n\nDibuat 30 Ogos 2019\n[MOF.TAX(R)700-2/8/1 JLD.2; PN(PU2)752/III]\n\nLIM GUAN ENG\nMenteri Kewangan\n\nP .U. (A) 233\n\nSERVICE TAX ACT 2018\n\nSERVICE TAX (COMPOUNDING OF OFFENCES) (AMENDMENT) REGULATIONS 2019\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by subsection 80(1) of the Service Tax Act 2018\n[Act 807 ], the Minister, with the approval of the Public Prosecutor, m akes the\nfollowing regulations:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-6"};
  FT["MY-H2888"] = {"id":"MY-H2888","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 233/2020&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":6,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2020年传染病预防与控制（移送检疫站者的医疗照护与供养）（第2号）条例","en":"PREVENTION AND CONTROL OF INFECTIOUS DISEASES (MEDICAL ATTENDANCE AND MAINTENANCE OF PERSON REMOVED TO QUARANTINE STATION) (NO. 2) REGULATIONS 2020","orig":"PREVENTION AND CONTROL OF INFECTIOUS DISEASES (MEDICAL ATTENDANCE AND MAINTENANCE OF PERSON REMOVED TO QUARANTINE STATION) (NO. 2) REGULATIONS 2020","ms":"Peraturan Pencegahan dan Kawalan Penyakit Berjangkit (Rawatan Perubatan dan Saraan Orang yang Dipindahkan ke Stesen Kuarantin) (Bilangan 2) 2020","vi":"Quy định về Phòng chống bệnh truyền nhiễm (Chăm sóc y tế và nuôi dưỡng người được đưa đến trạm kiểm dịch) (số 2) năm 2020","th":"ข้อบังคับการป้องกันและควบคุมโรคติดต่อ (การดูแลรักษาพยาบาลและการเลี้ยงดูบุคคลที่ถูกนำส่งสถานีกักกัน) (ฉบับที่ 2) ค.ศ. 2020","id":"Peraturan Pencegahan dan Pengendalian Penyakit Menular (Perawatan Medis dan Penghidupan Orang yang Dipindahkan ke Stasiun Karantina) (Nomor 2) Tahun 2020"},"level":"regulation","category":"04_劳工与行政法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA233","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2020","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 6 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\04_劳工与行政法\\2020_P.U.(A)233-2020_PREVENTION AND CONTROL OF INFECTIOUS DISEASES (MEDICAL ATTENDANCE AND MAINTENANCE OF PERSON REM.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H2888-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Peraturan-peraturan ini bolehlah dinamakan Peraturan-Peraturan\n\nPencegahan dan Pengawalan Penyakit Berjangkit (Layanan Perubatan dan\n\nPenyaraan Orang yang Dipindahkan ke Stesen Kuarantin) (No. 2) 2020.\n\n(2) Peraturan-Peraturan ini disifatkan telah mula berkuat kuasa\n\npada 24 Julai 2020.\n\nKos dan perbelanjaan yang dikenakan atau ditanggung bagi layanan perubatan\n\ndan penyaraan di stesen kuarantin"}},{"id":"MY-H2888-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. (1) Tertakluk kepada peraturan 3, mana-mana orang yang memasuki Malaysia\n\ndari luar negeri dan diarahkan oleh seseorang pegawai diberi kuasa untuk menjalani\n\npemerhatian atau pengawasan di bawah seksyen 15 Akta di mana-mana stesen kuarantin\n\nhendaklah membayar apa-apa kos dan perbelanjaan yang dikenakan atau ditanggung\n\nbagi layanan perubatan dan penyaraan orang itu di stesen kuarantin itu.\n\n(2) Pembayaran di bawah subperaturan (1) hendaklah dibuat kepada\n\nKetua Setiausaha Kementerian Kesihatan Malaysia mengikut apa-apa cara sebagaimana\n\nyang ditentukan oleh Ketua Pengarah.\n\nOrang yang tidak bertanggungan untuk membayar kos dan perbelanjaan"}},{"id":"MY-H2888-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"ms":"3. (1) Mana-mana orang yang dinyatakan dalam Jadual yang memasuki Malaysia\n\ndari luar negeri dan diarahkan oleh seseorang pegawai diberi kuasa untuk menjalani\n\npemerhatian atau pengawasan di bawah seksyen 15 Akta di mana-mana stesen kuarantin\n\ntidak bertanggungan untuk membayar apa-apa kos dan perbelanjaan yang dikenakan\n\natau ditanggung bagi layanan perubatan dan penyaraan orang itu di stesen kuarantin itu.\n\n(2) Mana-mana orang selain orang yang dinyatakan dalam Jadual boleh\n\nmemohon kepada Menteri untuk tidak membayar kos dan perbelanjaan yang dikenakan\n\natau ditanggung bagi layanan perubatan dan penyaraan orang itu di sesuatu\n\nstesen kuarantin.\n\n(3) Dalam hal orang yang disebut dalam subperaturan 2(1) ialah seorang\n\nwarganegara Malaysia yang diarahkan untuk menjalani pemerhatian dan pengawasan\n\ntelah menjalani ujian pengesanan penyakit Koronavirus 2019 (COVID-19) dalam masa\n\nempat belas hari dari tarikh arahan itu dikeluarkan tetapi keputusan ujian pengesanan\n\nitu tidak diperoleh selepas hari keempat belas, orang itu tidak bertanggungan untuk\n\nmembayar apa-apa kos dan perbelanjaan yang dikenakan atau ditanggung bagi layanan\n\nperubatan dan penyaraan orang itu di stesen kuarantin itu bagi hari kelima belas\n\nsehingga keputusan ujian pengesanan itu diperoleh jika orang itu diarahkan untuk\n\nmenjalani pengawasan dan pemerhatian lebih daripada empat belas hari.\n\nKesalahan"}},{"id":"MY-H2888-A4","no":4,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 4"},"text":{"ms":"4. Mana-mana orang yang melanggar subperaturan 2(1) melakukan suatu kesalahan\n\ndan boleh, apabila disabitkan, didenda tidak melebihi satu ribu ringgit atau\n\ndipenjarakan selama tempoh tidak melebihi enam bulan atau kedua-duanya.\n\nMendapatkan balik kos dan perbelanjaan sebagai hutang sivil"}},{"id":"MY-H2888-A5","no":5,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 5"},"text":{"ms":"5. (1) Apa-apa kos dan perbelanjaan yang terhutang dan kena dibayar oleh\n\nmana-mana orang di bawah subperaturan 2(1) boleh didapatkan balik sebagai suatu\n\nhutang sivil yang kena bayar kepada Kerajaan.\n\n(2) Walau apa pun sabitan mana-mana orang di bawah peraturan 4, apa-apa\n\nkos dan perbelanjaan yang terhutang dan kena dibayar oleh orang itu di bawah\n\nsubperaturan 2(1) boleh didapatkan balik sebagai suatu hutang sivil yang kena bayar\n\nkepada Kerajaan.\n\nPembatalan"}},{"id":"MY-H2888-A6","no":6,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 6"},"text":{"ms":"6. Peraturan-Peraturan Pencegahan dan Pengawalan Penyakit Berjangkit (Layanan\n\nPerubatan dan Penyaraan Orang yang Dipindahkan ke Stesen Kuarantin) 2020\n\n[P.U. (A) 211/2020] dibatalkan.\n\nJADUAL\n\n[Subperaturan 3(1)]\n\nORANG YANG TIDAK BERTANGGUNGAN UNTUK MEMBAYAR KOS\n\nDAN PERBELANJAAN\n\n1. Pemegang Kad OKU yang dikeluarkan di bawah Akta Orang Kurang Upaya 2008\n\n[Akta 685]\n\n2. Warganegara Malaysia daripada golongan *B40\n\n3. Warganegara Malaysia yang merupakan ibu, bapa, suami, isteri, atau anak yang\n\nberumur lapan belas tahun dan ke bawah, kepada warganegara Malaysia daripada\n\ngolongan *B40, yang pulang dari luar negeri bersama-sama dengan warganegara\n\nMalaysia daripada golongan *B40 itu\n\n4. Pelajar yang merupakan warganegara Malaysia daripada keluarga golongan *B40\n\n5. Kanak-kanak yang merupakan warganegara Malaysia yang berumur enam tahun\n\ndan ke bawah\n\n6. Kanak-kanak yang merupakan warganegara Malaysia yang berumur dua belas\n\ntahun dan ke bawah yang pulang dari luar negeri seorang diri\n\n7. Warganegara Malaysia yang pulang ke Malaysia sebaik selepas dibebaskan dari\n\npenjara di negara asing yang tidak mampu membayar kos dan perbelanjaan di\n\nstesen kuarantin atau tiada sumber pendapatan\n\n*Golongan B40 adalah sebagaimana yang ditentukan oleh Menteri Kewangan\n\nDibuat 19 Ogos 2020\n\n[KKM.600-29/4/146 Jld.2 (30); PN(PU2)470/III]\n\n DATO' SRI DR. ADHAM BIN BABA\n\n Menteri Kesihatan\n\nPREVENTION AND CONTROL OF INFECTIOUS DISEASES ACT 1988\n\nPREVENTION AND CONTROL OF INFECTIOUS DISEASES (MEDICAL ATTENDANCE\n\nAND MAINTENANCE OF PERSON REMOVED TO QUARANTINE STATION) (NO. 2)\n\nREGULATIONS 2020\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by paragraph 31(2)(q) of the\n\nPrevention and Control of Infectious Diseases Act 1988 [Act 342], the Minister makes\n\nthe following regulations:\n\nCitation and commencement\n\n1. (1) These regulations may be cited as the Prevention and Control of\n\nInfectious Diseases (Medical Attendance and Maintenance of Person Removed to\n\nQuarantine Station) (No. 2) Regulations 2020.\n\n(2) These Regulations are deemed to have come into operation\n\non 24 July 2020.\n\nCost and expenses charged or incurred for medical attendance and maintenance at\n\nquarantine station\n\n2. (1) Subject to regulation 3, any person who enters Malaysia from overseas and\n\nis directed by an authorized officer to undergo observation or surveillance under\n\nsection 15 of the Act at any quarantine station shall pay any cost and expenses charged\n\nor incurred for his medical attendance and maintenance at the quarantine station.\n\n(2) The payment under subregulation (1) shall be made to the\n\nSecretary General of the Ministry of Health Malaysia in such manner as determined by\n\nthe Director General.\n\nPersons not liable to pay cost and expenses\n\n3. (1) Any person specified in the Schedule who enters Malaysia from overseas\n\nand is directed by an authorized officer to undergo observation or surveillance under\n\nsection 15 of the Act at any quarantine station shall not be liable to pay any cost and\n\nexpenses charged or incurred for his medical attendance and maintenance at the\n\nquarantine station.\n\n(2) Any person other than the person specified in the Schedule may apply to\n\nthe Minister for non-payment of the cost and expenses charged or incurred for his\n\nmedical attendance and maintenance at a quarantine station.\n\n(3) In the case where the person mentioned in subregulation 2(1) is a\n\nMalaysian citizen who is directed to undergo observation and surveillance has undergone\n\nthe Coronavirus disease 2019 (COVID-19) detection test within fourteen days from the\n\ndate the direction is issued but the results of the detection test is not available after\n\nthe fourteenth day, the person shall not be liable to pay any cost and expenses charged or\n\nincurred for his medical attendance and maintenance at the quarantine station for the\n\nfifteenth day until the result of the detection test is available if the person is directed to\n\nundergo observation and surveillance for more than fourteen days.\n\nOffence\n\n4. Any person who contravenes subregulation 2(1) commits an offence and shall, on\n\nconviction, be liable to a fine not exceeding one thousand ringgit or to imprisonment for\n\na term not exceeding six months or to both.\n\nRecovery of cost and expenses as civil debt\n\n5. (1) Any cost and expenses due from and payable by any person under\n\nsubregulation 2(1) may be recovered as a civil debt due to the Government.\n\n(2) Notwithstanding the conviction of any person under regulation 4, any cost\n\nand expenses due from and payable by that person under subregulation 2(1) may be\n\nrecovered as a civil debt due to the Government.\n\nRevocation\n\n6. The Prevention and Control of Infectious Diseases (Medical Attendance and\n\nMaintenance of Person Removed to Quarantine Station) Regulations 2020\n\n[P.U. (A) 211/2020] are revoked.\n\nSCHEDULE\n\n[Subregulation 3(1)]\n\nPERSONS NOT LIABLE TO PAY COST AND EXPENSES\n\n1. A holder of a Kad OKU issued under the Persons with\n\nDisabilities Act 2008 [Act 685]\n\n2. A Malaysian citizen from the *B40 group\n\n3. A Malaysian citizen who is the mother, father, husband, wife, or child of the age of\n\neighteen and below, of a Malaysian citizen from the *B40 group, returning from\n\noverseas together with the Malaysian citizen from the *B40 group\n\n4. A student who is a Malaysian citizen from a family of the *B40 group\n\n5. A child who is a Malaysian citizen of the age of six and below\n\n6. A child who is a Malaysian citizen of the age of twelve and below returning alone\n\nfrom overseas\n\n7. A Malaysian citizen returning to Malaysia immediately upon being released from\n\na prison in a foreign state who is unable to pay for the cost and expenses at the\n\nquarantine station or has no source of income\n\n*B40 group shall be as determined by the Minister of Finance\n\nMade 19 August 2020\n\n[KKM.600-29/4/146 Jld.2 (30); PN(PU2)470/III]\n\nDATO' SRI DR. ADHAM BIN BABA\n\nMinister of Health"}}],"pack":"my-6"};
  FT["MY-H2889"] = {"id":"MY-H2889","coverage":"full","language":"en","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 233/2021&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2021年关税（反倾销税）（行政复审）（延展）（第2号）令","en":"CUSTOMS (ANTI-DUMPING DUTIES) (ADMINISTRATIVE REVIEW) (EXTENSION) (NO. 2) ORDER 2021","orig":"CUSTOMS (ANTI-DUMPING DUTIES) (ADMINISTRATIVE REVIEW) (EXTENSION) (NO. 2) ORDER 2021","vi":"Lệnh về Hải quan (Thuế chống bán phá giá) (Xem xét hành chính) (Gia hạn) (số 2) năm 2021","th":"คำสั่งศุลกากร (อากรตอบโต้การทุ่มตลาด) (การทบทวนทางปกครอง) (การขยายเวลา) (ฉบับที่ 2) ค.ศ. 2021","id":"Perintah Kepabeanan (Bea Masuk Anti-Dumping) (Peninjauan Administratif) (Perpanjangan) (Nomor 2) Tahun 2021","ms":"Perintah Kastam (Duti Anti-Lambakan) (Semakan Pentadbiran) (Lanjutan) (Bilangan 2) 2021"},"level":"regulation","category":"03_涉外投资与贸易","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA233","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2021","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\03_涉外投资与贸易\\2021_P.U.(A)233-2021_CUSTOMS (ANTI-DUMPING DUTIES) (ADMINISTRATIVE REVIEW) (EXTENSION) (NO. 2) ORDER 2021.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H2889-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"en":"1. Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Kastam (Duti Anti -Lambakan)\n(Kajian Semula Pentadbiran) (Pelanjutan) (No. 2) 2021.\n\nPelanjutan"}},{"id":"MY-H2889-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"en":"2. Perintah Kastam (Duti Anti -Lambakan) (Kajian Semula Pentadbiran)  2021 yang\ndisiarkan dalam P.U. (A) 25/2021 pada 22 Januari 2021 dilanjutkan mulai 24 Mei 2021\nhingga 9 Oktober 2021.\n\nDibuat 21 Mei 2021\n[SULIT KE.HT(96)669/12-249 Klt.10 Sk.1; MOF.TAX(S)700-4/1/778(12); PN(PU2)338D/V]\n\nTENGKU DATUK SERI UTAMA ZAFRUL BIN TENGKU ABDUL AZIZ\nMenteri Kewangan\n\n[Akan dibentangkan di Dewan Rakyat menurut subseksyen 11(2) Akta Kastam 1967]\n\nCOUNTERVAILING AND ANTI-DUMPING DUTIES ACT 1993 AND CUSTOMS ACT 1967\n\nCUSTOMS (ANTI-DUMPING DUTIES) (ADMINISTRATIVE REVIEW)\n(EXTENSION) (NO. 2) ORDER 2021\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by section 25 and subsection 28(7)  of the\nCountervailing and Anti-Dumping Duties Act 1993 [Act 504] and subsection 11(1) of the\nCustoms Act 1967 [Act 235], the Minister makes the following order:\n\nCitation"}}],"pack":"my-6"};
  FT["MY-H289"] = {"id":"MY-H289","coverage":"full","language":"en","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-detail.php?act=36&lang=BI","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":5,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"1971年西马来西亚教区议会（注册成立）法","en":"SYNOD OF THE DIOCESE OF WEST MALAYSIA (INCORPORATION) ACT 1971","orig":"SYNOD OF THE DIOCESE OF WEST MALAYSIA (INCORPORATION) ACT 1971","vi":"Luật về Hội đồng Giáo phận Tây Malaysia (Thành lập) năm 1971","th":"พระราชบัญญัติสภาสังฆมณฑลมาเลเซียตะวันตก (การจดทะเบียนจัดตั้ง) ค.ศ. 1971","id":"Undang-Undang Sinode Keuskupan Malaysia Barat (Pendirian) Tahun 1971","ms":"Akta Sinod Keuskupan Malaysia Barat (Perbadanan) 1971"},"level":"law","category":"05_其他及未分类","status":"active","docNumber":"ACT36","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"1971","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 5 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\05_其他及未分类\\1971_36_SYNOD OF THE DIOCESE OF WEST MALAYSIA (INCORPORATION) ACT 1971.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H289-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"en":"1. This Act may be cited as the Synod of the Diocese of\nWest Malaysia (Incorporation) Act, 1971."}},{"id":"MY-H289-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"en":"2. (J) The Synod of the Diocese of West Malaysia, and\nits successors shall be a body corporate and shall have\nperpetual succession under the name \"The Synod of the\nDiocese of West Malaysia\" hereinafter called the Corpora-\ntion and shall be the governing body of the Anglican\nChurch in West Malaysia.\n\nAm: ANI92/96\n\n67/58.\n\nShort title.\n\nIncorpora-\ntion, etc,\n\nCommon\nseal of\n\nCorpora-\ntion, etc.\n\nsub - AAGP3\n\nsub. HAAG 3\n\n2-3]\n\n4                                       Act 36\n\n(2) The Corporation may enter into contracts, and may\nacquire, purchase, take, hold and enjoy movable and\nimmovable property of every description and may convey,\ntransfer, assign, surrender and yield up, charge, mortgage,\ndemise, reassign or otherwise dispose of, or deal with, any\nmovable or immovable property vested in the Corporation\nand may lend or borrow money upon such terms as to the\nStanding Committee of the Corporation, hereafter referred\nto as the Standing Committee, may seem fit, and the minutes\nof the Standing Committee shall be sufficient evidence of\nsuch terms.\n\n(3) The Corporation may sue and be sued in respect of\nits property and otherwise in all courts of justice and in all\nmatters and suits."}},{"id":"MY-H289-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"en":"3. (1) The Corporation shall have a common seal, and such\nseal may from time to time be broken, changed, altered\nand made anew as to the Standing Committee seems fit.\n\n(2) The seal of the Corporation shall not be affixed to\nany deed document or other instrument except by authority\nof a resolution of the Standing Committee and in the\npresence of two members of the Standing Committee one\nof whom shall be the, Bishop of Da piece a West\nMalaysia or the Vigar-General appointed by, the Bishop or\nby the Archbishe ea abs a the\nSee of West of Malaysia or the Chancellor, Treasurer, or\nSecretary of the Corporation.\n\n(3) All deeds documents and other instruments requiring\nthe seal of the Corporation shall be sealed with the seal of\nthe Corporation and shall also be signed by the two\nwitnesses referred to in sub-section (2).\n\n(4) Such signing shall be sufficient evidence that the said\nseal was duly and properly affixed and that the said seal is\nthe lawful seal of the Corporation.\n\n(5) A certificate purporting to be signed by the Bishop\n2 the Diana of West ein of in his absence the\n\nicar-General appointe    the Bishop or   the Arch-\nDisha Se ete Seed Sei een daerkey tact $ Be of West\nMalaysia shall be sufficient evidence as to the persons who\nfrom time to time are members of the Standing Committee\nand who are the Chancellor, Treasurer and Secretary of the\nCorporation,\n\nIS. 4-51\n\nSYNOD OF THE DIOCESE OF WEST MALAYSIA (INCORPORATION)      5"}},{"id":"MY-H289-A4","no":4,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 4"},"text":{"en":"4. (1) The Secretary of the Synod of the Diocese of\nSingapore as incorporated under the Synod of the Diocese\nof Singapore Ordinance, 1958 in whom is vested all movable\nand immovable property situated in West Malaysia belong-\ning to the Corporation immediately before the commence-\nment of this Act is hereby divested of all such movable and\namevabls  property and all estates rights and interests\ntherein\n\n(2) All movable and immovable property referred to in\nsubsection (1) and all estates rights and interests therein\nare hereby vested in the Corporation for the respective\nestates rights and interests for which the same are held and\nthe Corporation shall have full power to deal with the said\nproperty as provided in subsection (2) of section 2.\n\n(3) The appropriate Collector of Land Revenue or\nRegistrar of Titles as the case may be shall substitute the\nname of the Corporation in place of that of the registered\nholder in the case of any registered interest in immovable\nproperty in West Malaysia formerly vested in the Secretary\nof the Synod of the Diocese of Singapore."}},{"id":"MY-H289-A5","no":5,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 5"},"text":{"en":"5. The Synod of the Diocese of Singapore Ordinance, 1958\nis hereby repealed.\n\nKUALA LUMPUR\nDI-CHETAK OLEH PENCHETAK KERAJAAN DAN DI-TERBITKAN DENGAN PERENTAH PADA\n2HB SEPTEMBER, 1971\n\nHarga: 50 sen\n\nTransfer\nof certain\nproperties,\n67/58.\n\nRepeal.\n67/58."}}],"pack":"my-6"};
  FT["MY-H2890"] = {"id":"MY-H2890","coverage":"full","language":"en","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 233/2022&status=CANCEL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2022年价格管制与反暴利（最高价格核定）（第6号）（废止）令","en":"PRICE CONTROL AND ANTI-PROFITEERING (DETERMINATION OF MAXIMUM PRICE) (NO. 6) (REVOCATION) ORDER 2022","orig":"PRICE CONTROL AND ANTI-PROFITEERING (DETERMINATION OF MAXIMUM PRICE) (NO. 6) (REVOCATION) ORDER 2022","vi":"Lệnh về Kiểm soát giá và chống trục lợi (Xác định giá tối đa) (số 6) (Bãi bỏ) năm 2022","th":"คำสั่งการควบคุมราคาและการต่อต้านการฉวยโอกาส (การกำหนดราคาสูงสุด) (ฉบับที่ 6) (การเพิกถอน) ค.ศ. 2022","id":"Perintah Pengendalian Harga dan Anti-Pencatutan (Penetapan Harga Maksimum) (Nomor 6) (Pencabutan) Tahun 2022","ms":"Perintah Kawalan Harga dan Anti-Pencatutan (Penetapan Harga Maksimum) (Bilangan 6) (Pembatalan) 2022"},"level":"regulation","category":"02_民商事与经济法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA233","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2022","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\02_民商事与经济法\\2022_P.U.(A)233-2022_PRICE CONTROL AND ANTI-PROFITEERING (DETERMINATION OF MAXIMUM PRICE) (NO. 6) (REVOCATION) ORDER.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H2890-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"en":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Kawalan Harga dan\nAntipencatutan (Penentuan Harga Maksimum) (No. 6) (Pembatalan) 2022.\n\n (2) Perintah ini disifatkan telah mula berkuat kuasa pada 1 Julai 2022.\n\nPembatalan"}},{"id":"MY-H2890-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"en":"2. Perintah Kawalan Harga dan Antipencatutan (Penentuan Harga Maksimum)\n(No. 6) 2021 [P.U. (A) 320/2021] dibatalkan.\n\nDibuat 1 Julai 2022\n[KPDNKK 600-1/2/14; PN(PU2)695/Jld.31]\n\n                   DATUK AZMAN BIN MOHD YUSOF\n                         Pengawal Harga\n\nDiluluskan 1 Julai 2022\n[KPDNKK 600-1/2/14; PN(PU2)695/Jld.31]\n\nDATO SRI ALEXANDER NANTA LINGGI\nMenteri Perdagangan Dalam Negeri dan Hal Ehwal Pengguna\n\nPRICE CONTROL AND ANTI-PROFITEERING ACT 2011\n\nPRICE CONTROL AND ANTI-PROFITEERING\n (DETERMINATION OF MAXIMUM PRICE) (NO. 6) (REVOCATION) ORDER 2022\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by section 4\nof the Price Control and Anti-Profiteering Act 2011 [ Act 7 23], the Controller,\nwith the approval of the Minister, makes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-6"};
  FT["MY-H2891"] = {"id":"MY-H2891","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 233/2023&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2023年道路交通（禁止使用道路）（联邦道路）（第18号）令","en":"ROAD TRANSPORT (PROHIBITION OF USE OF ROAD) (FEDERAL ROADS) (NO. 18) ORDER 2023","orig":"ROAD TRANSPORT (PROHIBITION OF USE OF ROAD) (FEDERAL ROADS) (NO. 18) ORDER 2023","ms":"Perintah Pengangkutan Jalan (Larangan Penggunaan Jalan) (Jalan Raya Persekutuan) (Bilangan 18) 2023","vi":"Lệnh về Vận tải đường bộ (Cấm sử dụng đường bộ) (Đường bộ liên bang) (số 18) năm 2023","th":"คำสั่งการขนส่งทางถนน (การห้ามใช้ถนน) (ทางหลวงสหพันธ์) (ฉบับที่ 18) ค.ศ. 2023","id":"Perintah Angkutan Jalan (Larangan Penggunaan Jalan) (Jalan Raya Federal) (Nomor 18) Tahun 2023"},"level":"regulation","category":"04_劳工与行政法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA233","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2023","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\04_劳工与行政法\\2023_P.U.(A)233-2023_ROAD TRANSPORT (PROHIBITION OF USE OF ROAD) (FEDERAL ROADS) (NO. 18) ORDER 2023.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H2891-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Pengangkutan Jalan\n\n(Larangan Penggunaan Jalan) (Jalan Persekutuan) (No. 18) 2023.\n\n(2) Perintah ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 8 Ogos 2023.\n\nLarangan"}},{"id":"MY-H2891-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Pemanduan kenderaan di atas bahagian jalan yang dinyatakan dalam ruang (1)\n\nJadual Pertama sebagaimana yang ditunjukkan dalam peta dalam Jadual Kedua,\n\nmelainkan di atas jalan arah yang dinyatakan dalam ruang (2) Jadual Pertama, bagi\n\ntempoh yang dinyatakan dalam ruang (3) Jadual Pertama, dilarang.\n\nJADUAL PERTAMA\n\n(1)\n\nJalan yang baginya\n\nLarangan Terpakai\n\n(2)\n\nJalan Arah\n\n(3)\n\nTempoh Larangan\n\nSebahagian Laluan 1492,\n\nJalan Utama Lepar Hilir\n\nbermula dari seksyen 0.50\n\nhingga seksyen 1.32\n\nsebagaimana yang\n\nditunjukkan dalam peta\n\ndalam Jadual Kedua\n\nKenderaan dari Gambang ke Lepar\n\nHilir 5, 6, dan 7 dan sebaliknya\n\nhendaklah menggunakan jalan\n\nlencongan sementara sebagaimana\n\nyang ditunjukkan dalam peta\n\ndalam Jadual Kedua\n\n8 Ogos 2023 hingga\n\n1 September 2025\n\nJADUAL KEDUA\n\nDibuat 3 Ogos 2023\n\n[KKR.100-1/2/79 Jld.6; PN(PU2)460/Jld. 127]\n\nDATO SRI ALEXANDER NANTA LINGGI\n\nMenteri Kerja Raya\n\nROAD TRANSPORT ACT 1987\n\nROAD TRANSPORT (PROHIBITION OF USE OF ROAD)\n\n(FEDERAL ROADS) (NO. 18) ORDER 2023\n\nWHEREAS by P.U. (B) 257/2023 published on 12 July 2023, notice was given of the\n\nintention to make an order under section 70 of the Road Transport Act 1987 [Act 333]:\n\nAND WHEREAS no objection was received by the Minister of Works against the making\n\nof such order:\n\nNOW THEREFORE, in exercise of the powers conferred by section 70 of the Act,\n\nthe Minister of Works, after taking into consideration the matters referred to\n\nin subsection 70(2) of the Act, makes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement\n\n1. (1) This order may be cited as the Road Transport (Prohibition of Use\n\nof Road) (Federal Roads) (No. 18) Order 2023.\n\n(2) This Order comes into operation on 8 August 2023.\n\nProhibition\n\n2. The driving of vehicles on the part of the road as specified in column (1)\n\nof the First Schedule as shown on the map in the Second Schedule, otherwise than on\n\nthe routes specified in column (2) of the First Schedule, for the period specified\n\nin column (3) of the First Schedule, is prohibited.\n\nFIRST SCHEDULE\n\n(1)\n\nRoad to which\n\nProhibition Applies\n\n(2)\n\nRoutes\n\n(3)\n\nProhibition Period\n\nPart of Route 1492,\n\nLepar Hilir Main Road\n\nstarting from section 0.50\n\nto section 1.32 as shown\n\non the map in the\n\nSecond Schedule\n\nVehicles from Gambang to\n\nLepar Hilir 5, 6, and 7 and\n\nvice versa shall use the temporary\n\ndiversion road as shown on the\n\nmap in the Second Schedule\n\n8 August 2023 to\n\n1 September 2025\n\nSECOND SCHEDULE\n\nMade 3 August 2023\n\n[KKR.100-1/2/79 Jld.6; PN(PU2)460/Jld. 127]\n\nDATO SRI ALEXANDER NANTA LINGGI\n\nMinister of Works"}}],"pack":"my-6"};
  FT["MY-H2892"] = {"id":"MY-H2892","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 233/2024&status=AMENDMENT","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2024年全国限速（修正）（第2号）令","en":"NATIONAL SPEED LIMIT (AMENDMENT) (NO. 2) ORDER 2024","orig":"NATIONAL SPEED LIMIT (AMENDMENT) (NO. 2) ORDER 2024","ms":"Perintah Had Laju Kebangsaan (Pindaan) (Bilangan 2) 2024","vi":"Lệnh về Giới hạn tốc độ quốc gia (Sửa đổi) (số 2) năm 2024","th":"คำสั่งจำกัดความเร็วแห่งชาติ (การแก้ไข) (ฉบับที่ 2) ค.ศ. 2024","id":"Perintah Batas Kecepatan Nasional (Perubahan) (Nomor 2) Tahun 2024"},"level":"regulation","category":"05_其他及未分类","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA233","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2024","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\05_其他及未分类\\2024_P.U.(A)233-2024_NATIONAL SPEED LIMIT (AMENDMENT) (NO. 2) ORDER 2024.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H2892-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Had Laju Kebangsaan\n\n(Pindaan) (No. 2) 2024.\n\n(2) Perintah ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 31 Ogos 2024.\n\nPindaan Jadual"}},{"id":"MY-H2892-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Perintah Had Laju Kebangsaan 1989 [P.U. (A) 18/1989] dipinda dalam Jadual,\n\ndalam butiran 19—\n\n(a) dalam subbutiran (c), dengan memotong perkataan \"dan\" di hujung\n\nsubbutiran itu;\n\n(b) dalam subbutiran (d), dengan menggantikan noktah di hujung subbutiran\n\nitu dengan perkataan \"; dan\";\n\n(c) dengan memasukkan selepas subbutiran (d) subbutiran yang berikut:\n\n\"(e) kilometer 0.00 di koordinat U 314037.031, T 395567.983\n\nGrid RSO Geosentrik (GDM 2000) dan berakhir di kilometer 12.51\n\ndi Persimpangan Bertingkat SKVE di koordinat U 324492.234,\n\nT 391350.504 Grid RSO Geosentrik (GDM 2000) arah utara dan\n\narah selatan.\"; dan\n\n(d) dengan memasukkan selepas PETA 4: PERSIMPANGAN BERTINGKAT\n\nBERUAS KE PERSIMPANGAN BERTINGKAT TAIPING SELATAN\n\npeta yang berikut:\n\n\"PETA 5: PERSIMPANGAN BERTINGKAT BANTING\n\nKE PERSIMPANGAN BERTINGKAT SKVE\n\nDibuat 29 Ogos 2024\n\n[KKR.PUU.110-1/6/20 Jld.2; PN(PU2)460/JLD.133]\n\nLOKE SIEW FOOK\n\nMenteri Pengangkutan\n\n\".\n\nROAD TRANSPORT ACT 1987\n\nNATIONAL SPEED LIMIT (AMENDMENT) (NO. 2) ORDER 2024\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by subsection 69(1)\n\nof the Road Transport Act 1987 [Act 333], the Minister makes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-6"};
  FT["MY-H2893"] = {"id":"MY-H2893","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 233/2025&status=AMENDMENT","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":6,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2025年水务产业（供水服务费率）（霹雳州）（修正）条例","en":"WATER SERVICES INDUSTRY (RATES FOR WATER SUPPLY SERVICES) (STATE OF PERAK) (AMENDMENT) REGULATIONS 2025","orig":"WATER SERVICES INDUSTRY (RATES FOR WATER SUPPLY SERVICES) (STATE OF PERAK) (AMENDMENT) REGULATIONS 2025","ms":"Peraturan Industri Perkhidmatan Air (Kadar Perkhidmatan Bekalan Air) (Negeri Perak) (Pindaan) 2025","vi":"Quy định về Ngành dịch vụ nước (Giá dịch vụ cấp nước) (Bang Perak) (Sửa đổi) năm 2025","th":"ข้อบังคับอุตสาหกรรมบริการน้ำ (อัตราค่าบริการจ่ายน้ำ) (รัฐเประ) (การแก้ไข) ค.ศ. 2025","id":"Peraturan Industri Jasa Air (Tarif Layanan Penyediaan Air) (Negara Bagian Perak) (Perubahan) Tahun 2025"},"level":"regulation","category":"04_劳工与行政法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA233","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2025","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 6 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\04_劳工与行政法\\2025_P.U.(A)233-2025_WATER SERVICES INDUSTRY (RATES FOR WATER SUPPLY SERVICES) (STATE OF PERAK) (AMENDMENT) REGULATI.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H2893-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. Domestik\n\n(meter individu)\n\nBekalan air melalui meter individu atau meter\n\npetak ke premis kediaman atau unit kediaman"}},{"id":"MY-H2893-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Domestik\n\n(meter pukal)\n\nBekalan air melalui meter pukal ke bangunan\n\nkediaman bertingkat tinggi, komuniti berpagar,\n\npremis kediaman, unit kediaman, kuarters estet\n\ndan kuarters kerajaan"}},{"id":"MY-H2893-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"ms":"3. Bukan domestik Premis komersial, premis industri, premis\n\nperdagangan, premis perniagaan, premis\n\nkerajaan, sekolah, institusi pengajian tinggi,\n\nhospital, perusahaan pemprosesan air\n\n(termasuk kios air), perladangan dan perkebunan\n\n(1)\n\nBil.\n\n(2)\n\nJenis penggunaan\n\n(3)\n\nPerihalan"}},{"id":"MY-H2893-A4","no":4,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 4"},"text":{"ms":"4. Rumah ibadat dan institusi\n\nkebajikan\n\nRumah ibadat yang pembinaannya diluluskan\n\noleh kerajaan di bawah mana-mana\n\nundang-undang bertulis atau pengoperasiannya\n\ndiluluskan oleh badan keagamaan berkaitan\n\nyang diiktiraf oleh kerajaan untuk memberikan\n\nkelulusan bagi rumah ibadat\n\nInstitusi kebajikan yang berdaftar dengan\n\nJabatan Kebajikan Masyarakat, yang diberikan\n\npengecualian cukai oleh Lembaga Hasil Dalam\n\nNegeri Malaysia atau yang diiktiraf oleh kerajaan\n\nsebagai sebuah institusi kebajikan"}},{"id":"MY-H2893-A5","no":5,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 5"},"text":{"ms":"5. Perkapalan Bekalan air untuk kegunaan di atas kapal yang\n\nberlabuh di pelabuhan"}},{"id":"MY-H2893-A6","no":6,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 6"},"text":{"ms":"6. Pusat data Premis yang digunakan secara khusus untuk\n\nmenempatkan peralatan dan infrastruktur\n\nteknologi maklumat dan komunikasi secara\n\nberpusat bagi maksud mengurus data termasuk\n\nmenyimpan, mengumpul, memproses atau\n\nmengagih data\".\n\nDibuat 30 Julai 2025\n\n[PETRA. BAP. 100-1/1/3 KLT. 5 (6); PN(PU2)660/JLD.19]\n\nDATO' SRI HAJI FADILLAH BIN HAJI YUSOF\n\nMenteri Peralihan Tenaga dan Transformasi Air\n\nWATER SERVICES INDUSTRY ACT 2006\n\nWATER SERVICES INDUSTRY (RATES FOR WATER SUPPLY SERVICES)\n\n(STATE OF PERAK) (AMENDMENT) REGULATIONS 2025\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by paragraphs 84(2)(a) and 179(i)\n\nof the Water Services Industry Act 2006 [Act 655], the Minister, on the recommendation\n\nof the Commission, makes the following regulations:\n\nCitation and commencement\n\n1. (1) These regulations may be cited as the Water Services Industry\n\n(Rates for Water Supply Services) (State of Perak) (Amendment)\n\nRegulations 2025.\n\n(2) These Regulations come into operation on 1 August 2025.\n\nAmendment of First Schedule\n\n2. The Water Services Industry (Rates for Water Supply Services) (State of Perak)\n\nRegulations 2022 [P.U. (A) 242/2022], which are referred to as the \"principal Regulations\"\n\nin these Regulations, are amended in the First Schedule—\n\n(a) in relation to item 5—\n\n(i) in column (4), by substituting for the words \"7.05\" the words\n\n\"8.00\"; and\n\n(ii) in column (5), by substituting for the words \"70.50\" the words\n\n\"80.00\"; and\n\n(b) by inserting after item 5 and the particulars relating to it the following item\n\nand particulars:\n\nSubstitution of Second Schedule\n\n3. The principal Regulations are amended by substituting for the Second Schedule\n\nthe following schedule:\n\n\"SECOND SCHEDULE\n\n[Regulation 3]\n\nTYPE OF USE\n\n(1)\n\nNo.\n\n(2)\n\nType of use\n\n(3)\n\nDescription\n\n1. Domestic\n\n(individual meter)\n\nSupply of water through individual meter\n\nor parcel meter to residential premises\n\nor residential units\n\n2. Domestic\n\n(bulk meter)\n\nSupply of water through bulk meter to high rise\n\nresidential building, gated community,\n\nresidential premises, residential units, estate\n\nquarters and government quarters\n\n3. Non-domestic Commercial premises, industrial premises,\n\ntrade premises, business premises, government\n\npremises, school, institute of higher learning,\n\n(1)\n\nNo.\n\n(2)\n\nType of use\n\n(3)\n\nAmount of consumption\n\n(4)\n\nRate\n\nper\n\ncubic metre\n\n(RM)\n\n(5)\n\nMinimum\n\ncharge\n\n(per month)\n\n(RM)\n\n\"6. Data centre flat rate 5.30 53.00\".\n\n(1)\n\nNo.\n\n(2)\n\nType of use\n\n(3)\n\nDescription\n\nhospital, water processing industry (including\n\nwater kiosk), plantation and farming\n\n4. House of worship and\n\nwelfare institution\n\nHouse of worship which its construction was\n\napproved by the government under any written\n\nlaws or its operation was approved by the\n\nrelevant religious bodies recognized by the\n\ngovernment to give approvals for houses of\n\nworship\n\nWelfare institution registered with the\n\nDepartment of Social Welfare, given tax\n\nexemptions by the Inland Revenue Board of\n\nMalaysia or recognized by the government as a\n\nwelfare institution\n\n5. Shipping Supply of water for the use aboard ships\n\nanchored at port\n\n6. Data centre Premises specifically used to centrally house\n\nequipment and infrastructure of information\n\ntechnology and communication for the purpose\n\nof managing data including storing, collecting,\n\nprocessing or distributing data\".\n\nMade 30 July 2025\n\n[PETRA. BAP. 100-1/1/3 KLT. 5 (6); PN(PU2)660/JLD.19]\n\nDATO' SRI HAJI FADILLAH BIN HAJI YUSOF\n\nMinister of Energy Transition and Water Transformation"}}],"pack":"my-6"};
  FT["MY-H2894"] = {"id":"MY-H2894","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 234/2011&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2011年沙巴州（1946年二手货商法的延伸与修改）令","en":"STATE OF SABAH (EXTENSION AND MODIFICATION OF THE SECOND-HAND DEALERS ACT 1946) ORDER 2011","orig":"STATE OF SABAH (EXTENSION AND MODIFICATION OF THE SECOND-HAND DEALERS ACT 1946) ORDER 2011","ms":"Perintah Negeri Sabah (Pelanjutan dan Pengubahsuaian Akta Peniaga Barang Terpakai 1946) 2011","vi":"Lệnh về Bang Sabah (Mở rộng và sửa đổi Luật Người buôn bán hàng cũ 1946) năm 2011","th":"คำสั่งรัฐซาบาห์ (การขยายใช้และการแก้ไขพระราชบัญญัติผู้ค้าของมือสอง ค.ศ. 1946) ค.ศ. 2011","id":"Perintah Negara Bagian Sabah (Perluasan dan Modifikasi Undang-Undang Pedagang Barang Bekas 1946) Tahun 2011"},"level":"regulation","category":"05_其他及未分类","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA234","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2011","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\05_其他及未分类\\2011_P.U.(A)234-2011_STATE OF SABAH (EXTENSION AND MODIFICATION OF THE SECOND-HAND DEALERS ACT 1946) ORDER 2011.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H2894-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Negeri Sabah (Peluasan dan\n\nUbah Suaian Akta Peniaga Sekendhend 1946) 2011.\n\n(2) Perintah ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 12 Julai 2011.\n\nPeluasan dan ubah suaian Akta ke Negeri Sabah"}},{"id":"MY-H2894-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. (1) Akta Peniaga Sekendhend 1946 [Akta 189], yang disebut \"Akta yang\n\ndipeluaskan\" dalam Perintah ini, adalah dipeluaskan ke Negeri Sabah.\n\n(2) Dalam pemakaiannya bagi Negeri Sabah, Akta yang dipeluaskan diubah\n\nsuai sebagaimana yang dinyatakan dalam Jadual.\n\nJADUAL\n\nNEGERI SABAH\n\n[Subperenggan 2(2)]\n\nPeruntukan Akta Peniaga\n\nSekendhend 1946\n\nUbah suaian\n\nKesemuanya (kecuali jika\n\ndiperuntukkan selainnya\n\nsecara nyata kemudian\n\ndaripada ini)\n\nSebutan mengenai \"Chief Police Officer\"\n\nhendaklah ditafsirkan sebagai sebutan\n\nmengenai \"Commissioner of Police\".\n\nSeksyen 1 Dalam subseksyen (2), gantikan perkataan\n\n\"only in Peninsular Malaysia\" dengan\n\nperkataan \"to Peninsular Malaysia and the\n\nState of Sabah\".\n\nSeksyen 7 Dalam subseksyen (2), gantikan perkataan\n\n\", Chinese and Tamil languages\" dengan\n\nperkataan \"and Chinese languages\".\n\nDibuat 23 Jun 2011\n\n[KDN(S)/9/836 Klt.4(67); PN(PU2)112/IV]\n\nDengan Titah Perintah,\n\nTAN SRI MOHD. SIDEK BIN HAJI HASSAN\n\nSetiausaha Jemaah Menteri\n\n[Akan dibentangkan di Dewan Rakyat dan Dewan Negara menurut subseksyen 74(9)\n\nAkta Malaysia]\n\nMALAYSIA ACT\n\nSTATE OF SABAH (EXTENSION AND MODIFICATION OF THE\n\nSECOND-HAND DEALERS ACT 1946) ORDER 2011\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by section 74 of the Malaysia Act [Act 26/1963], the\n\nYang di-Pertuan Agong makes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement\n\n1. (1) This order may be cited as the State of Sabah (Extension and\n\nModification of the Second-hand Dealers Act 1946) Order 2011.\n\n(2) This Order comes into operation on 12 July 2011.\n\nExtension and modification of the Act to the State of Sabah\n\n2. (1) The Second-hand Dealers Act 1946 [Act 189], which is referred to as the\n\n\"extended Act\" in this Order, is extended to the State of Sabah.\n\n(2) In its application to the State of Sabah, the extended Act is modified in the\n\nmanner set out in the Schedule.\n\nSCHEDULE\n\nTHE STATE OF SABAH\n\n[Subparagraph 2(2)]\n\nProvisions of the\n\nSecond-hand Dealers Act 1946\n\nModification\n\nThe whole (except where\n\nit is expressly otherwise\n\nprovided hereinafter)\n\nReferences to \"Chief Police Officer\" shall\n\nbe construed as references to\n\n\"Commissioner of Police\".\n\nSection 1 In subsection (2), substitute for the words\n\n\"only in Peninsular Malaysia\" the words\n\n\"to Peninsular Malaysia and the State of\n\nSabah\".\n\nSection 7 In subsection (2), substitute for the words\n\n\", Chinese and Tamil languages\" the words\n\n\"and Chinese languages\".\n\nMade 23 June 2011\n\n[KDN(S)/9/836 Klt.4(67); PN(PU2)112/IV]\n\nBy Command,\n\nTAN SRI MOHD. SIDEK BIN HAJI HASSAN\n\nSecretary to the Cabinet\n\n[To be laid before Dewan Rakyat and Dewan Negara pursuant to subsection 74(9) of the\n\nMalaysia Act]"}}],"pack":"my-6"};
  FT["MY-H2895"] = {"id":"MY-H2895","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 234/2013&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2013年国民服务训练（须接受国民服务训练者）令","en":"NATIONAL SERVICE TRAINING (PERSONS REQUIRED TO UNDERGO NATIONAL SERVICE TRAINING) ORDER 2013","orig":"NATIONAL SERVICE TRAINING (PERSONS REQUIRED TO UNDERGO NATIONAL SERVICE TRAINING) ORDER 2013","ms":"Perintah Latihan Khidmat Negara (Orang yang Dikehendaki Menjalani Latihan Khidmat Negara) 2013","vi":"Lệnh về Huấn luyện Phục vụ Quốc gia (Người phải tham gia huấn luyện phục vụ quốc gia) năm 2013","th":"คำสั่งการฝึกบริการแห่งชาติ (บุคคลที่ต้องเข้ารับการฝึกบริการแห่งชาติ) ค.ศ. 2013","id":"Perintah Pelatihan Dinas Nasional (Orang yang Wajib Mengikuti Pelatihan Dinas Nasional) Tahun 2013"},"level":"regulation","category":"04_劳工与行政法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA234","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2013","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\04_劳工与行政法\\2013_P.U.(A)234-2013_NATIONAL SERVICE TRAINING (PERSONS REQUIRED TO UNDERGO NATIONAL SERVICE TRAINING) ORDER 2013.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H2895-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Latihan Khidmat Negara\n\n(Orang yang Dikehendaki Menjalani Latihan Khidmat Negara) 2013.\n\n(2) Perintah ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 23 Julai 2013.\n\nOrang yang dikehendaki menjalani latihan khidmat negara"}},{"id":"MY-H2895-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Orang yang bertanggungan untuk menjalani latihan khidmat negara menurut\n\nkuasa proklamasi yang dibuat di bawah seksyen 3 Akta yang dilahirkan dalam tahun\n\n1996 dan telah dipilih melalui sistem pemilihan berkomputer, dikehendaki menjalani\n\nlatihan khidmat negara.\n\nDibuat 8 Julai 2013\n\n[KP/JLKM(UPKN)(R)17/847/39 JIL. 4; PN(PU2)635/IV]\n\nDATO'SERIHISHAMMUDDIN TUNHUSSEIN\n\nMenteri Pertahanan\n\nNATIONAL SERVICE TRAINING ACT 2003\n\nNATIONAL SERVICE TRAINING (PERSONS REQUIRED TO UNDERGONATIONAL\n\nSERVICE TRAINING) ORDER 2013\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by section 16 of the National Service Training\n\nAct 2003 [Act 628], the Minister makes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-6"};
  FT["MY-H2896"] = {"id":"MY-H2896","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 234/2014&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2014年印刷机与出版物（不良出版物管制）（第8号）令","en":"PRINTING PRESSES AND PUBLICATIONS (CONTROL OF UNDESIRABLE PUBLICATIONS) (NO. 8) ORDER 2014","orig":"PRINTING PRESSES AND PUBLICATIONS (CONTROL OF UNDESIRABLE PUBLICATIONS) (NO. 8) ORDER 2014","ms":"Perintah Mesin Cetak dan Penerbitan (Kawalan Penerbitan Tidak Diingini) (Bilangan 8) 2014","vi":"Lệnh về Máy in và ấn phẩm (Kiểm soát ấn phẩm không mong muốn) (số 8) năm 2014","th":"คำสั่งแท่นพิมพ์และสิ่งพิมพ์ (การควบคุมสิ่งพิมพ์ที่ไม่พึงประสงค์) (ฉบับที่ 8) ค.ศ. 2014","id":"Perintah Mesin Cetak dan Penerbitan (Pengendalian Terbitan Tidak Diinginkan) (Nomor 8) Tahun 2014"},"level":"regulation","category":"04_劳工与行政法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA234","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2014","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\04_劳工与行政法\\2014_P.U.(A)234-2014_PRINTING PRESSES AND PUBLICATIONS (CONTROL OF UNDESIRABLE PUBLICATIONS) (NO. 8) ORDER 2014.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H2896-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Mesin Cetak dan Penerbitan\n\n(Kawalan Hasil Penerbitan Tidak Diingini) (No. 8) 2014.\n\nLarangan"}},{"id":"MY-H2896-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Pencetakan, pengimportan, penghasilan, penghasilan semula, penerbitan, penjualan,\n\npengeluaran, pengelilingan, pengedaran atau pemilikan hasil penerbitan yang diperihalkan\n\ndalam Jadual yang mungkin memudaratkan kemoralan dan ketenteraman awam dan yang\n\nberlawanan dengan mana-mana undang-undang adalah dilarang secara mutlak di seluruh\n\nMalaysia.\n\nJADUAL\n\nTajuk Hasil\n\nPenerbitan\n\nPengarang/\n\nPenterjemah\n\nPenerbit Pencetak Bahasa\n\n1. The Meaning\n\nOf The Holy\n\nQur'an For\n\nKids\n\n Yahiya J.\n\nEmerick\n\nIfna Bookstore - Inggeris\n\nTajuk Hasil\n\nPenerbitan\n\nPengarang/\n\nPenterjemah\n\nPenerbit Pencetak Bahasa\n\n2. 我従哪裡來? 彼得梅爾 天下雜誌股份有限公\n\n司\n\n台北市104 南京东路\n\n二段139號11樓\n\n中原造像股份有\n\n限公司\n\nCina\n\nWhere Did I\n\nCome From?\n\nPeter Mayle Tian Xia Magazine\n\nCo. Ltd,\n\nNo. 139, Level 11,\n\nNanjing East Rd. 2,\n\n104 Zhongshan,\n\nDistrict Taipei City,\n\nTaiwan\n\nInnovation\n\nGraphic Arts Co.\n\nLtd\n\nDibuat 18 Julai 2014\n\n[KDN:PQ(S) 600-2/2 Jld. 2- (1); KDN:PQ(S) 600-2/3 Jld. 3- (9); PN(PU2)417/XII]\n\nDATO' SERI DR. AHMAD ZAHID BIN HAMIDI\n\nMenteri Dalam Negeri\n\nPRINTING PRESSES AND PUBLICATIONS ACT 1984\n\nPRINTING PRESSES AND PUBLICATIONS\n\n(CONTROL OF UNDESIRABLE PUBLICATIONS) (NO. 8) ORDER 2014\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by subsection 7(1) of the Printing Presses and\n\nPublications Act 1984 [Act 301], the Minister makes the following order:\n\nCitation\n\n1. This order may be cited as the Printing Presses and Publications (Control of\n\nUndesirable Publications) (No. 8) Order 2014.\n\nProhibition\n\n2. The printing, importation, production, reproduction, publishing, sale, issue,\n\ncirculation, distribution or possession of the publications described in the Schedule which\n\nare likely to be prejudicial to morality and public order and which are contrary to any law\n\nare absolutely prohibited throughout Malaysia.\n\nSCHEDULE\n\nTitle of\n\nPublication\n\nAuthor/\n\nTranslator\n\nPublisher Printer Language\n\n1. The Meaning\n\nOf The Holy\n\nQur'an For\n\nKids\n\n Yahiya J.\n\nEmerick\n\nIfna Bookstore - English\n\nTitle of\n\nPublication\n\nAuthor/\n\nTranslator\n\nPublisher Printer Language\n\n2. 我従哪裡來? 彼得梅爾 天下雜誌股份有限公\n\n司\n\n台北市104 南京东路\n\n二段139號11樓\n\n中原造像股份有\n\n限公司\n\nChinese\n\n Where Did I\n\nCome From?\n\nPeter Mayle Tian Xia Magazine\n\nCo. Ltd,\n\nNo. 139, Level 11,\n\nNanjing East Rd. 2,\n\n104 Zhongshan,\n\nDistrict Taipei City,\n\nTaiwan\n\nInnovation\n\nGraphic Arts Co.\n\nLtd\n\nMade 18 July 2014\n\n[KDN:PQ(S) 600-2/2 Jld. 2- (1); KDN:PQ(S) 600-2/3 Jld. 3- (9); PN(PU2)417/XII]\n\nDATO' SERI DR. AHMAD ZAHID BIN HAMIDI\n\nMinister of Home Affairs"}}],"pack":"my-6"};
  FT["MY-H2897"] = {"id":"MY-H2897","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 234/2015&status=AMENDMENT","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":5,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2015年联邦道路（私营管理）（通行费征收）（哥文宁—莎阿南大道）（修正）令","en":"FEDERAL ROADS (PRIVATE MANAGEMENT) (COLLECTION OF TOLLS) (KEMUNING - SHAH ALAM HIGHWAY) (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2015","orig":"FEDERAL ROADS (PRIVATE MANAGEMENT) (COLLECTION OF TOLLS) (KEMUNING - SHAH ALAM HIGHWAY) (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2015","ms":"Perintah Jalan Raya Persekutuan (Pengurusan Swasta) (Kutipan Tol) (Lebuh Raya Kemuning-Shah Alam) (Pindaan) 2015","vi":"Lệnh về Đường bộ liên bang (Quản lý tư nhân) (Thu phí đường bộ) (Đường cao tốc Kemuning-Shah Alam) (Sửa đổi) năm 2015","th":"คำสั่งทางหลวงสหพันธ์ (การบริหารจัดการเอกชน) (การจัดเก็บค่าผ่านทาง) (ทางหลวงเกอมูนิง-ชาห์อาลัม) (การแก้ไข) ค.ศ. 2015","id":"Perintah Jalan Raya Federal (Pengelolaan Swasta) (Pemungutan Tol) (Jalan Raya Kemuning-Shah Alam) (Perubahan) Tahun 2015"},"level":"regulation","category":"05_其他及未分类","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA234","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2015","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 5 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\05_其他及未分类\\2015_P.U.(A)234-2015_FEDERAL ROADS (PRIVATE MANAGEMENT) (COLLECTION OF TOLLS) (KEMUNING - SHAH ALAM HIGHWAY) (AMENDM.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H2897-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. Kenderaan yang mempunyai dua gandar dan\n\ntiga atau empat roda (kecuali teksi dan bas)\n\n1.70\n\n3.40\n\n5.10\n\n0.90\n\n1.20\n\n0.90"}},{"id":"MY-H2897-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Kenderaan yang mempunyai dua gandar dan\n\nlima atau enam roda (kecuali bas)\n\n1.80"}},{"id":"MY-H2897-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"ms":"3. Kenderaan yang mempunyai tiga gandar atau\n\nlebih (kecuali bas)\n\n2.70"}},{"id":"MY-H2897-A4","no":4,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 4"},"text":{"ms":"4. Teksi 0.90"}},{"id":"MY-H2897-A5","no":5,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 5"},"text":{"ms":"5. Bas 0.60\n\nBagi maksud mengira bilangan gandar dan roda sesuatu kenderaan, gandar dan roda\n\nmana-mana treler yang ditarik oleh kenderaan itu hendaklah dikira sebagai sebahagian\n\ndaripada gandar dan roda kenderaan itu.\".\n\nDibuat 12 Oktober 2015\n\n[KKR.PUU.110-1/7/24; PN(PU2)426/LX]\n\nDATO' SRI HAJI FADILLAH BIN HAJI YUSOF\n\nMenteri Kerja Raya\n\nFEDERAL ROADS (PRIVATE MANAGEMENT) ACT 1984\n\nFEDERAL ROADS (PRIVATE MANAGEMENT) (COLLECTION OF TOLLS)\n\n(KEMUNING SHAH ALAM HIGHWAY) (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2015\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by section 2 of the Federal Roads\n\n(Private Management) Act 1984 [Act 306], the Minister makes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement\n\n1. (1) This order may be cited as the Federal Roads (Private Management)\n\n(Collection of Tolls) (Kemuning Shah Alam Highway) (Amendment) Order 2015.\n\n(2) This Order comes into operation on 15 October 2015.\n\nAmendment of paragraph 2\n\n2. The Federal Roads (Private Management) (Collection of Tolls)\n\n(Kemuning Shah Alam Highway) Order 2010 [P.U. (A) 163/2010], which is referred to\n\nas the \"principal Order\" in this Order, is amended in subparagraph 2(1) by deleting the\n\nwords \"according to the concession years,\".\n\nSubstitution of First Schedule\n\n3. The principal Order is amended by substituting for the First Schedule the\n\nfollowing Schedule:\n\n\"FIRST SCHEDULE\n\n[subparagraph 2(1)]\n\nRATES OF TOLL FOR THE CONCESSION PERIOD\n\nFROM 15 OCTOBER 2015 UNTIL 31 JULY 2047\n\n(1)\n\nClasses of Vehicle\n\n(2)\n\nToll Payable\n\n(RM)\n\nPlaza Tol\n\nSeri Muda\n\nPlaza Tol\n\nAlam\n\nImpian\n\n1. Vehicle having two axles and three or\n\nfour wheels (excluding taxi and bus)\n\n1.70 0.90\n\n2. Vehicle having two axles and five or six\n\nwheels (excluding bus)\n\n3.40 1.80\n\n3. Vehicle having three axles or more\n\n(excluding bus)\n\n5.10 2.70\n\n4. Taxi 0.90 0.90\n\n5. Bus 1.20 0.60\n\nFor the purpose of calculating the number of axles and wheels of a vehicle, the axles and\n\nwheels of any trailer towed by the vehicle shall be calculated as part of the axles and\n\nwheels of the vehicles.\".\n\nMade 12 October 2015\n\n[KKR.PUU.110-1/7/24; PN(PU2)426/LX]\n\nDATO' SRI HAJI FADILLAH BIN HAJI YUSOF\n\nMinister of Works"}}],"pack":"my-6"};
